ass="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-4.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-4.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ethporto.org/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/web3concanarias"&gt;WEB3 CON CANARIAS&lt;/a&gt; 🌴&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(15th April, Puerto de La Cruz Tenerife, Spain)&lt;/strong&gt;: The first Web3 event in Tenerife. Connect, learn, surf, and have tons of fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The time has come 🚀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LIMITED EARLY BIRD TICKETS AVAILABLE! 🤘 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab your tickets now, officially on sale at [&lt;a href="https://t.co/nVRTeyabdK"&gt;https://t.co/nVRTeyabdK&lt;/a&gt;] or find out more by checking out the link in our BIO🔗. &lt;a href="https://t.co/6psWcGfNDq"&gt;https://t.co/6psWcGfNDq&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Web3 Island Makers (@join_wim3) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/join_wim3/status/1629951817097330692?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;February 26, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="Some of the exciting events coming up soon... Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from!  WEB3 CON CANARIAS 🌴(15th April, Puerto de La Cruz Tenerife, Spain): Our first event in Tenerife!  learn from global web3 leaders and ride the waves of web3 entrepreneurship. The promise is for a not traditional event and the creation of new opportunities that can include surfing lessons and beach activities to keep you riding those crypto waves." class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Book your ticket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The MetaverseReFiWeek, at Decentraland 🌐&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;(February 27th to March 5th, Once Caribbean Plaza, 40-40, Decentraland): &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/theaeternals"&gt;TheAeternals&lt;/a&gt; organized and amazing metaverse event and it was my first time inside it! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Having a great time in Decentraland!   Come join in .... details below:&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MetaverseReFiWeek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MetaverseReFiWeek&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kicked off yesterday with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/theaeternals?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@theaeternals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt; :)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join us all week for some amazing talks on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Impact?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Impact&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/NFTs?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#NFTs&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Web3?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Web3&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/qcfTmDKIQL"&gt;https://t.co/qcfTmDKIQL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Realm: DG. 40/-40&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/creatorlabsX?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@creatorlabsX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Derreck Landon (@pines_five) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/pines_five/status/1630638055559184388?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;February 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;It was more complicated than I expected but more fun than I imagined! It is a universe, so you have to walk and find the places you are to attend! Caribbean Plaza wasn't that difficult to find, but boy getting around the elevator was! 😅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a look at this clip of me talking (&amp;amp; dancing!) about dynamic NFTs and other ways to make an impact in Web3 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;I got to participate in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MetaverseReFiWeek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MetaverseReFiWeek&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/decentraland?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@decentraland&lt;/a&gt; my first time in the metaverse and it was as scary as you can imagine. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you so much to 🥳&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/theaeternals?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@theaeternals&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Gallardo_Luchi?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Gallardo_Luchi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We got to talk or dance about &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ImpactScope?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ImpactScope&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OrelliRafaella?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@OrelliRafaella&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MadhuriRahman?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MadhuriRahman&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/rTkz2pfHGv"&gt;pic.twitter.com/rTkz2pfHGv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Susana González (@SuaNex) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SuaNex/status/1631643353338068993?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 3, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The week continues, &lt;a href="https://medium.com/@theAEternals/how-to-access-metaverse-refi-week-on-decentraland-1228d63c2c9"&gt;and you can join &lt;/a&gt;other events too - see you there!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the newsletter? Add yours to ReFi Spring! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://airtable.com/shrKUM3uH0Ph5oEYw" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfind-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-ventureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;New gigs from the ReFi world! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🙌 &lt;a href="https://cryptojobslist.com/jobs/blockchain-architect-engineer-refi-canop-e-france-switzerland"&gt;Blockchain Architech/Engineer&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Canopée&lt;/strong&gt;): Remote &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also, keep an eye out for the &lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/?ref=refi-dao"&gt;ReFi Jobs &lt;/a&gt;platform for more future listings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here is an awesome newsletter that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://web3forgood.substack.com/?utm_campaign=pub&amp;amp;utm_medium=web"&gt;Web3 for good#52&lt;/a&gt; by Abeera and Sam - &lt;em&gt;This one is special because it is their aniversary! Exactly one year of amazing news on Web3 and impact, and here are the highlights for this issue.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are people afraid of the term &lt;em&gt;crypto? &lt;/em&gt;It seems that re-branding could be an important subject to scale beyond the Web3 community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;“Don’t Call It ‘Crypto’: How Some Blockchain and NFT Projects are Rebranding”, Stylus’ content director, Katie Baron, spoke with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/stephengraves?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@stephengraves&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/decryptmedia?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@decryptmedia&lt;/a&gt;, about the future of crypto, NFTs, the metaverse and more. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read the full article here: &lt;a href="https://t.co/FiidlMzXcp"&gt;https://t.co/FiidlMzXcp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Stylus (@Stylus_LIVE) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Stylus_LIVE/status/1630499248671277056?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;February 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://web3forgood.substack.com/?utm_campaign&amp;#x3D;pub&amp;amp;utm_medium&amp;#x3D;web" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Subscribe to Web3 for good&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I always like to say that change starts with example, so let's be more regenerative, let's find sustainable paths, and continue the conversation! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Have a fantastic weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help, spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;GM Regens! 👋&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.gaoa.work/"&gt;Gabriel&lt;/a&gt; here, a knowledge worker focused on high-impact research to help &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAframework/status/1633737521183219713?s=20"&gt;self-managed&lt;/a&gt; individuals (DAOists) and organizations (DAOs) achieve efficient collaboration, enhanced productivity, effective decision-making and clarity of purpose. I'm experimenting in the intersection of Web3, Cognitive Science and the Creator Economy with the vision of fostering the &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/14157407/"&gt;future of work&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/gaoanetwork"&gt;Integral Education&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this week's edition, we'll be diving into the human component of ReFi: individual level of coherence and our collective capacity for coordination, &lt;em&gt;and as always, we'll be sharing top news, events, and jobs from the ReFi world and beyond. Let's jump right in. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-15.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="640" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-15.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-15.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-15.png 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;with Midjourney.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="playing-the-infinite-game-of-refi-%E2%99%BE%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Playing the Infinite Game of ReFi ♾️&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;According to the renowned game theorist, &lt;a href="https://www.amazon.com.au/Finite-Infinite-Games-James-Carse/dp/1476731713"&gt;James Carse&lt;/a&gt;, there are at least two kinds of games. One could be called finite, the other infinite. A finite game is played for the purpose of winning, &lt;strong&gt;while an infinite game is for the purpose of continuing the play&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1633650793638395906?s=20" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"&gt;ReFi is an infinite game&lt;/a&gt; energized by the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki/status/1443567700198842373?s=20"&gt;solarpunk&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://mycopunks.gitbook.io/mycopunk-principles/"&gt;mycopunk&lt;/a&gt; movements, with a shared culture based on &lt;strong&gt;co-creation&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;cross-pollination&lt;/strong&gt;, a collective awareness of the current economic system failures: unsustainability and unfairness, and a common willingness to rethink and redesign society from a systemic level. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But where do we start? 🤔&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;10/ &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; is the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/integral?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#integral&lt;/a&gt; use of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/DeFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#DeFi&lt;/a&gt; to play the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/infinite?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#infinite&lt;/a&gt; game of regeneration.&lt;a href="https://t.co/w8DKxwF3DX"&gt;https://t.co/w8DKxwF3DX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; gaoa.eth (@gaoa97) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1633650793638395906?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="individual-coherence-collective-coordination-lasting-impact-%F0%9F%92%A5"&gt;Individual coherence + collective coordination = lasting Impact 💥&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It's easy to think of ourselves as separate from the earth, just temporary inhabitants passing through. But what if we viewed &lt;strong&gt;ourselves as an integral part of the planet&lt;/strong&gt;, connected inextricably to every living thing around us?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://plumvillage.org/podcast/from-extraction-to-regeneration-healing-ourselves-healing-society-episode-16/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Group-122.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1134" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Group-122.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Group-122.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Group-122.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/03/Group-122.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Thich Nhat Hanh, Buddhist Monk, and author&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the idea behind higher levels of consciousness described by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TheKenWilber"&gt;Ken Wilber&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href="https://gaoa.notion.site/A-Theory-of-Everything-An-Integral-Vision-for-Business-Politics-Science-and-Spirituality-by-Ken--d084fe3323ba40e98d7d86a21035ee82"&gt;Integral Theory&lt;/a&gt;, the concept that as we transcend through ego developmental stages, we begin to see ourselves not as separate individuals but &lt;strong&gt;as part of a larger whole&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We move from being ego-centric to ethno-centric to world centric, and eventually, we arrive at a kosmo-centric state of mind, where we see the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1541933080575082496?s=20"&gt;interconnectedness &lt;/a&gt;of all things. As seen in the illustration below 👇🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="ca" dir="ltr"&gt;AQAL Integral Map &lt;a href="https://t.co/WvpYMbWKGM"&gt;pic.twitter.com/WvpYMbWKGM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ⚪ GAOA𝚏𝚛𝚊𝚖𝚎𝚠𝚘𝚛𝚔 (@GAOAframework) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAframework/status/1628677164781666304?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;February 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;All Quadrants. All Levels - Ken Wilber&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are nature. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the system. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;The system is part of a bigger system...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="bridging-the-gap-between-humanity-and-nature%F0%9F%8D%83"&gt;Bridging the Gap Between Humanity and Nature🍃  &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In essence, to truly regenerate the planet, we must first undergo a &lt;strong&gt;paradigm shift within ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;. This includes elevating our state of consciousness and embracing  &lt;a href="https://gaoa.notion.site/The-future-of-management-is-teal-ff9d8b3ae45a4f3485b9eee0c216837f"&gt;Teal organizational structures&lt;/a&gt;: principles of self-management, decentralized decision-making, and &lt;a href="https://norabateson.wordpress.com/2015/11/03/symmathesy-a-word-in-progress/"&gt;living systems&lt;/a&gt; that focus on a holistic, real-world impact and &lt;strong&gt;systemic transformation&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-19.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="980" height="980" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-19.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-19.png 980w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Teal organization illustration. Source: &lt;a href="https://quantumleaders.com/the-living-organization-and-teal/"&gt;Quantum Leaders&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;By prioritizing regenerative practices and leveraging the power of web3 infrastructure, we are able to go one step further and operate as a Decentralised Autonomous Regenerative Entity/Ecosystem (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1634023710721183744?s=20"&gt;DARE&lt;/a&gt;)—a term coined by one of ReFi’s founding fathers &lt;a href="https://capitalinstitute.org/"&gt;John Fullerton&lt;/a&gt;. As a result we can drive a transition towards a more sustainable and equitable future for both humanity and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.notion.so/gaoa/Regenerative-Capitalism-04-20-15-Final-pdf-806e2dbd9fac403996e7ec4d8e494f11" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read Jon Fullerton&amp;#x27;s  paper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LFG—&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoanetwork/status/1633639382937907201?s=61&amp;amp;t=0VW3BcOH3dE52IJjyGgjYQ"&gt;Let's Flourishingly Grow&lt;/a&gt; 🌱🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="ecosystem-updates-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Ecosystem Updates 👀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="in-sync-collaboration-on-chain-verification-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;In-sync collaboration + On-chain verification 🤝&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In a world of zoom calls and remote working, nothing beats a real-life scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;This is why &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt;’s first step to decentralization and going to market is through local ReFi DAO nodes… &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In-person communities gathering to take climate action TOGETHER with publicly verifiable impact for all to see. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coming to a startup city near you! &lt;a href="https://t.co/z3dJlU00X0"&gt;https://t.co/z3dJlU00X0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; jE ❤️ Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1633545959002058752?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 8, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;And not just at ReFi DAO, other local regens communities are also popping up...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/schellingpoint_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@schellingpoint_&lt;/a&gt; i learned that local greenpill/regen crypto chapters are starting 🌱🗺&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the first are in china + in india. 🇨🇳🇮🇳 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if you want to start one in your city pls fill out this form: &lt;a href="https://t.co/TqNGpF1PXM"&gt;https://t.co/TqNGpF1PXM&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/wQVN73xZjw"&gt;pic.twitter.com/wQVN73xZjw&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Owocki.Ξth (🤖,💚) (@owocki) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki/status/1632864125020934145?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 6, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The goal is to integrate local nodes with &lt;strong&gt;individual coherence&lt;/strong&gt; and capacity for &lt;strong&gt;collective coordination&lt;/strong&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Now, we are bringing all of these pieces together to create a global network rooted in local startup communities taking collective action —a nation in the cloud that gathers in person around a shared vision of regeneration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join us --&amp;gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/eV8Yufz5iE"&gt;https://t.co/eV8Yufz5iE&lt;/a&gt; 💚&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/7 &lt;a href="https://t.co/8oWb2ipNLO"&gt;pic.twitter.com/8oWb2ipNLO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Monty Merlin Bryant 🧙✨ (@MontyMerlin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin/status/1633105280006225920?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 7, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;What once sounded like science fiction has now become a reality with the &lt;strong&gt;emergence of Web3&lt;/strong&gt;—a new era where digital connections and collaborations are redefining the way we play the infinite game of regeneration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="und" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/NetworkState?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#NetworkState&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thenetworkstate?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@thenetworkstate&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/balajis?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@balajis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/ycBUZF6dE7"&gt;https://t.co/ycBUZF6dE7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; gaoa.eth (@gaoa97) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1634010933403213829?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-might-better-futures-emerge"&gt;How might better futures emerge?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://radardao.xyz/"&gt;RADAR&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Radarxyz/status/1626320472433467392?s=20"&gt;community&lt;/a&gt; has just released a new whitepaper proposing a theory of change as an approach to accelerating &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1626333165932642304?s=20"&gt;better futures&lt;/a&gt; through &lt;strong&gt;incentive-aligned coordination structures for lasting impact&lt;/strong&gt;—creating positive-sum, self-sustaining ecosystems that support community and resist extraction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;RADAR asks the question, how might better futures emerge? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Multiplayer Futures: Toward An Emergence Economy is our response. A not-so-litepaper, if you will.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We hope you’ll join us:&lt;a href="https://t.co/jx06ZuqVRc"&gt;https://t.co/jx06ZuqVRc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; RADAR (@Radarxyz) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Radarxyz/status/1631030274631892995?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 1, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-can-we-improve-coordination"&gt;How can we improve coordination?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/A8MiPaTOqo"&gt;Hypha&lt;/a&gt;’s organisation-in-a-box technology not only enables decentralized entities to cross-pollinate, but also mobilize quickly and cheaply, with entirely configurable modules enabling token creation and customizable approaches that have already been deployed to multiple &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1634023710721183744?s=20"&gt;DAREs&lt;/a&gt; as part of the alpha launch with &lt;strong&gt;waiting list now open for Beta launch&lt;/strong&gt;. If you’re interested in trialling Hypha’s regenerative technology for your DAO or your Ecosystem, reach out now to &lt;a href="https://www.cognitoforms.com/Hypha1/hyphadaobetaprogrameoi"&gt;register your interest&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uwGaJJYiIcw?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="An introduction to Hypha"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-to-participate-in-coordination"&gt;How to participate in coordination?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The future of work is increasingly decentralized and online, yet many people don't have access to desktop computers. Helping to address this problem, &lt;a href="https://amadao.io/"&gt;amaDAO&lt;/a&gt; is launching a mobile-first—&lt;a href="https://blog.celo.org/a-carbon-negative-blockchain-its-here-and-it-s-celo-60228de36490"&gt;developed on celo&lt;/a&gt;—social network for DAOs &lt;strong&gt;that makes governance enjoyable and rewarding&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/cakerydao"&gt;Cakery&lt;/a&gt; helps DAO members keep track of contributions and build an on-chain portfolio of skills, work and equity across decentralized projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Built on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Celo?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Celo&lt;/a&gt; so any &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/DAO?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#DAO&lt;/a&gt; can be carbon negative.&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Cakery DAO (@CakeryDAO) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CakeryDAO/status/1635202582250659841?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 13, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-to-start-a-startup-society"&gt;How to start a startup society?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jur.io/"&gt;Jur&lt;/a&gt; is building an application specific L1 to facilitate &lt;strong&gt;rapid experimentation of different governance, voting, coordination&lt;/strong&gt; styles to serve online communities that could one day be significant enough to become a &lt;a href="https://thenetworkstate.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Network State&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jur recently launched &lt;a href="https://jur.io/society-awards/"&gt;The Startup Society Founders’ Awards&lt;/a&gt;. Invitations are open to join other like-minded builders to pitch your vision of your very own Startup Society.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uEiGF47tF_A?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Startup Society Demo - How to build a web3 society?"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="supermodular-venture-studio-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Supermodular Venture Studio! 👀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open Source Software is another infinite game of collective intelligence, driven by a passion for continuous improvement and a shared belief that &lt;strong&gt;knowledge belongs to all of us&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?s=20"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; believes in the potential of digital public goods to transform our world for the better and is working to unlock that potential by supporting and incentivizing developers to keep the game going.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://community.supermodular.xyz/t/why-gitcoin-could-substantially-impact-the-status-quo/92"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Why Gitcoin Could Substantially Impact the Status Quo&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;This piece was written as part of my application for a content writer position at Gitcoin. I also wrote the Spanish version and created a content pipeline that I plan to use for my next writing pieces, aligned with the G.A.C.C Content Briefing framework by MKT1 Posting it here to share my thoughts,…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://global.discourse-cdn.com/business7/uploads/supermodular/optimized/1X/f34a167a1a12d07376b0d5712756316b33b019e3_2_180x180.jpeg" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;SuperModular.xyz Community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;gaoa97&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://global.discourse-cdn.com/business7/uploads/supermodular/original/1X/f34a167a1a12d07376b0d5712756316b33b019e3.jpeg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Picking up where Gitcoin left off, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Kevin Owocki&lt;/a&gt; - the Co-Founder of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?s=20"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; - unveiled more details about Supermodular at EthDevnver. He describes it as an “incubator” designed to simultaneously help developers advance Web3 technology while “&lt;strong&gt;protecting critical resources and global public goods&lt;/strong&gt;”. 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;┏┓  &lt;br&gt;┃┃╱╲ in this&lt;br&gt;┃╱╱╲╲  house&lt;br&gt;╱╱╭╮╲╲  we &lt;br&gt;▔▏┗┛▕▔ know&lt;br&gt;╱▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔╲  &lt;br&gt;crypto CAN regenerate the world 🌱&lt;br&gt;it just needs a little push to get there 💚💊&lt;br&gt;╱╱┏┳┓       ╭╮          ┏┳┓ ╲╲ &lt;br&gt;▔▏┗┻┛       ┃┃          ┗┻┛▕▔&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; supermodular.xyz 🌱 (@supermodularxyz) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/supermodularxyz/status/1633642874381406208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://decrypt.co/122681/gitcoin-kevin-owocki-refi-incubator-supermodular" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;Also on our radar this week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤝 A great example of what’s possible with a collaborative culture was &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin/status/1633507025991909376?s=20"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;'s partnership with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/metalabel_xyz/status/1630976312155459584?s=20"&gt;Metalabel&lt;/a&gt; to celebrate Quadratic Funding and &lt;strong&gt;raise funds for public goods&lt;/strong&gt; with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin/status/1633534674864832512?s=20"&gt;QF open-edition record&lt;/a&gt;, containing work by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/VitalikButerin?s=20"&gt;@VitalikButerin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/zhitzig?s=20"&gt;@zhitzig&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/glenweyl?s=20"&gt;@glenweyl&lt;/a&gt;, as well as Gitcoin co-founders &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki?s=20"&gt;@owocki&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/notscottmoore?s=20"&gt;@notscottmoore&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🐣 &lt;a href="https://impactdaos.xyz/posts/5-types-of-impact-daos"&gt;ImpactDAOs&lt;/a&gt; just released &lt;a href="https://airtable.com/shrTqLycfHyYr6ym6/tblVBrLEhRD0OKrPU"&gt;a list of 70+ impact DAOs&lt;/a&gt; and the 5 categories they fall into.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤟 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/vgr"&gt;Venkatesh Rao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;officially announces the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/vgr/status/1632844338161156096?s=20"&gt;Summer of Protocols (SoP) program&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;📰 &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/"&gt;WEF &lt;/a&gt;just published their &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/recommendations-for-the-digital-voluntary-and-regulated-carbon-markets"&gt;Recommendations &lt;/a&gt;for the Digital Voluntary and Regulated Carbon Markets.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🧐 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/rexstjohn"&gt;Rex St John&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiSummit?s=20"&gt;ReFi Summit&lt;/a&gt; organizer, suggested that &lt;a href="https://rexstjohn.medium.com/the-purpose-of-this-article-is-to-outline-a-complete-end-to-end-operating-system-grounded-in-the-4a85c0669bfb"&gt;ReFi needs better plumbing&lt;/a&gt; by outlining a simplified understanding of what effectiveness means in ReFi.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-20.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-20.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-20.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-20.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-20.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;️✳️ &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regen.network/"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: all-in-one science-powered platform that connects investors and buyers to a growing pipeline of premier-quality ecological impact projects.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🟪 &lt;a href="https://loalabs.io/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOA Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: trusted partner for blockchain and Web3 companies focused on building better world blockchains.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌟 &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: carbon-negative, mobile-first, EVM-compatible blockchain ecosystem leading a thriving new digital economy for all.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌏 &lt;a href="https://www.solid.world/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid World&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: enabling institutions to scale their carbon financing through diversified and derisked carbon financing pools.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethichub.com/en/"&gt;EthicHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: A new way of investing online that generates social impact and up to 8% profit for your investment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Projects included in&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/tag/roundup/"&gt;previous roundups&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;are not counted this week!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-project" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-investment-founders-circle-global-south-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;ReFi DAO Investment Founders Circle: Global South 🤝 &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another round of founders circle session, connecting entrepreneurs with investors in the ReFi Space. Check out the conversations around ​investor theses, climate financing beyond carbon and web3,  and insights on building in the global south 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-global-south-founders-with-pranav-khanna"&gt;ReFi Global South Founders with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/checkfit?s=20"&gt;Pranav Khanna&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tg3m0vV21dg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Refi Global South Founders with Pranav"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-global-south-founders-with-natalie-vergara-giron"&gt;ReFi Global South Founders with Natalie Vergara Giron&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EqmaB7mPonY?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Refi Global South Investors with Natalie Vergara Giron"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-global-south-founders-with-toffene-kama"&gt;ReFi Global South Founders with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tkanet?s=20"&gt;Toffene Kama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MaT0CsOV5Hg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Refi Global South Founders with Toffene Kama"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-global-south-founders-with-tim-rann"&gt;ReFi Global South Founders with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/timrann?s=20"&gt;Tim Rann&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/85bgKA6kAvs?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Refi Global South Investors with Tim Rann"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podfollow.com/refi-podcast/view" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Subscribe to ReFi DAO podcast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id="soulbound-tokens-deep-dive"&gt;Soulbound Tokens Deep Dive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/emthemaker"&gt;Emily Furlong&lt;/a&gt;, Co-founder of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/otterspace_xyz?lang=en"&gt;Otterspace&lt;/a&gt;, shares in detail Soulbound Tokens (SBTs), on-chain reputation, Otterspace protocol, and its wide range of applications from DAO governance and education credentials to on-chain passports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/ca/podcast/all-about-impact-daos/id1647617360?i&amp;#x3D;1000603157077"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;‎All About Impact DAOs: Deep Dive | Non-Financial Future of Web3, Soulbound Tokens, Otterspace Protocol, Trustless Coordination, SBTs Vs. POAPs with Emily Furlong Co-Founder Otterspace #29 on Apple Podcasts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;‎Show All About Impact DAOs, Ep Deep Dive | Non-Financial Future of Web3, Soulbound Tokens, Otterspace Protocol, Trustless Coordination, SBTs Vs. POAPs with Emily Furlong Co-Founder Otterspace #29 - Mar 7, 2023&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client&amp;#x3D;SOCIAL&amp;amp;type&amp;#x3D;FAVICON&amp;amp;fallback_opts&amp;#x3D;TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;amp;url&amp;#x3D;https://podcasts.apple.com/ca/podcast/all-about-impact-daos/id1647617360?i&amp;#x3D;1000603157077&amp;amp;size&amp;#x3D;128" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Apple Podcasts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts112/v4/a8/9e/00/a89e0093-b1bc-dfbc-c6d3-981d7f40d23a/mza_4421466150526984221.jpg/1200x630wp.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="everything-is-a-protocol"&gt;Everything is a protocol&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;But which will be passed on to our descendants? A conversation with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/vgr?s=20"&gt;Venkatesh Rao&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ribbonfarm"&gt;Ribbonfarm&lt;/a&gt;, discussing about the Summer of Protocols Program: course about protocols and advance thinking of protocols as a category.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://pod.link/1609313639/episode/830d45eaa9f30fac6a7dde2a6986e198"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;GreenPill&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;GreenPill is about crypto-economic systems that create positive externalities for their neighbors &amp;amp; for the world. We explore the intersection of programmable money, game theory, &amp;amp; mechanism design. We search for powerful new ways to fund, design, develop, &amp;amp; market regenerative web3-era application…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://pod.link/assets/favicon.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://podlink.imgix.net/69cff38e5a7499b5a571e5768193e66e/poster.jpeg?width&amp;#x3D;1280&amp;amp;height&amp;#x3D;720&amp;amp;fit&amp;#x3D;fill&amp;amp;pad&amp;#x3D;104&amp;amp;bg&amp;#x3D;FFF" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refispring.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="looking-forward-%F0%9F%93%8D"&gt;Looking Forward 📍&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some of the exciting events coming up soon... Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring/status/1635283333906337798"&gt;ReFi Event Organizers Guild &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;🤝&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(March 14th, Twitter Space):&lt;/strong&gt; as a result of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring"&gt;ReFi Spring&lt;/a&gt; merging with ReFi DAO, the Event Organizers Guild will officially launch this Tuesday. 🎉&lt;br&gt;If you are considering to organize a gathering for your local ReFi fam or you are a former event organizer, join the Twitter space to find out more about the Guild. 👇&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;GM &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; fam! ☀️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tomorrow we are kicking off &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt; Event Organizers Guild!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join the Twitter space for all the info on what is it, what&amp;#39;s coming next and how to join. 🍿&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set a reminder 🔔 and talk tomorrow! 👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/nqdmlUNvps"&gt;https://t.co/nqdmlUNvps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Spring 🤝 ReFi DAO (@RefiSpring) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring/status/1635283333906337798?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 13, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://consensus.coindesk.com/overview/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi @ Consensus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🎪 &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 26-28 in Austin, Texas): &lt;/strong&gt;Just like for ethDenver, The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/loa_labs"&gt;LOA Labs&lt;/a&gt; team has set up a Telegram group for Consensus 2023. Hop in if you're attending and want to have a streamlined way to connect and communicate with your fellow Regens in Austin.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-10.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="807" height="465" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-10.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-10.png 807w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Consensus 2023&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://loalabs.io/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-11.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1900" height="634" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-11.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-11.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-11.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-11.png 1900w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://loalabs.io/"&gt;LOA Labs team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/ReFiatConsensus" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Join ReFi @ Consensus!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://ethprague.com/"&gt;ETH Prague&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🎪 &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(June 9 -11, in Prague): &lt;/strong&gt;Ready to build something awesome around ReFi? sign up for the next ETH Prague. Experimental and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Solarpunk?src=hashtag_click"&gt;#Solarpunk&lt;/a&gt; projects are welcome!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-12.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1126" height="737" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-12.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-12.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-12.png 1126w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://ethprague.com/"&gt;ETH Prague&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gmevents.typeform.com/to/jy3Mufeq?typeform-source&amp;#x3D;ethprague.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Apply to hack!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethdenver.com/"&gt;ETHDenver&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🎪 &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Feb 24th - Mar 5th in Denver, Colorado)&lt;/strong&gt;: How do we rotate capital, attention, resources from degenerative projects to regenerative projects? Check out this mind blowing talk from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Owocki&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_V5J4FjOMDQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="How crypto can regenerate the world - Kevin Owocki ETHDenver 2023 Talk"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ethereumgt"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ETHGuatemala&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 🇬🇹&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;( Mar 11th in Guatemala City, Guatemala) &lt;/strong&gt;The event gathered 100+ builders and enthusiasts to foster the growth of the ecosystem in Guatemala. It also included inspiting ReFi talks from our friends at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/EthicHub"&gt;EthicHub&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/United_Species"&gt;United Species DAO&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xUrbanika"&gt;Urbánika&lt;/a&gt;. 👏&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-21.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-21.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-21.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-21.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethguatemala.com/"&gt;ETHGuatemala&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the newsletter? Add yours to ReFi Spring! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://airtable.com/shrKUM3uH0Ph5oEYw" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfind-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-ventureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;New gig listed on &lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;ReFiJobs&lt;/a&gt;! 👇👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/job/854442-carbon-markets-and-project-origination-lead-dclimate"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-7.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="725" height="145" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-7.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-7.png 725w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/job/854442-carbon-markets-and-project-origination-lead-dclimate"&gt;https://refijobs.com/job/854442-carbon-markets-and-project-origination-lead-dclimate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the ReFi Jobs platform for more! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;https://refijobs.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="multiplayer-futures-toward-an-emergence-economy-part-7-by-radar"&gt;&lt;a href="https://radarxyz.substack.com/p/implementation-on-acceleration-infrastructure?utm_source=substack&amp;amp;utm_medium=email"&gt;Multiplayer Futures: Toward an Emergence Economy (part 7)&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Radarxyz?s=20"&gt;RADAR &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMPLEMENTATION: On Acceleration Infrastructure, or How Better Futures Come to Bear. &lt;/em&gt;Putting forward the idea of tokenized markets as a path to create co-ownership,&lt;strong&gt; inspired from the natural world &amp;amp; living systems&lt;/strong&gt; – mycelia, bird ballets, etc – to explore the idea of change through &lt;strong&gt;connected emergence&lt;/strong&gt; vs. individual innovation...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://radarxyz.substack.com/p/implementation-on-acceleration-infrastructure?utm_source=substack&amp;amp;utm_medium=email"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-16.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1434" height="806" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-16.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-16.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-16.png 1434w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="building-daos-as-scalable-networks-15-article-series-by-superbenefit"&gt;&lt;a href="https://superbenefit.mirror.xyz/Gx_rXSPOyt2sydHwlStfbrgVqYt6P3k5huT3xyZAolo"&gt;Building DAOs as scalable networks (#15 / Article Series)&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SuperBenefitDAO?s=20"&gt;SuperBenefit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of the breakthrough concepts of DAOs as community driven networks is that they have the potential to influence &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;whole systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Addressing complex societal issues such as &lt;strong&gt;climate change and income inequality&lt;/strong&gt; requires coordinated, multi-scale approaches. Such approaches must be responsive to the emergent nature of the systems they are working in and require long-term resourcing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://superbenefit.mirror.xyz/Gx_rXSPOyt2sydHwlStfbrgVqYt6P3k5huT3xyZAolo"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-17.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="594" height="933"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;🟢&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the universe experiencing itself as individualized &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1634477107924586500?s=20"&gt;fractals&lt;/a&gt; of consciousness...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-14.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1568" height="928" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-14.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-14.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-14.png 1568w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;with Midjourney.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a regenerative week my frens &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hey Regens, it’s &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/raamcc"&gt;Raam&lt;/a&gt; here!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I am a DAO contributor working on coordination, governance, and operations at &lt;a href="https://www.gro.xyz/#/"&gt;Gro DAO&lt;/a&gt;; and a member of the World Economic Forum (WEF)’s &lt;a href="https://initiatives.weforum.org/crypto-impact-and-sustainability-accelerator/epillar"&gt;Crypto Sustainability Coalition&lt;/a&gt;. I believe in the programmability of Web3 to improve socioeconomic systems such that they create positive externalities for the planet and its people. It’s a true honor to be sharing my first ReFi Roundup with you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This week, we’ll be looking at: the WEF’s recommendations for the Digital Voluntary and Regulated Carbon Markets, how Crypto can help local communities through ReFi, the SVB collapse’s impact on climate tech + the latest news, updates, jobs and events in ReFi and beyond! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lets dive in 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/rWy7vc6Cw1YxaoAmNgPfBkrpBonclkFd29MsHjK7BuSbWSZy_YIgUyVvZanNpHGCZ2i_aQbeuBfb7e7CYre7biU5nhljvRFsWBHyL7GHhf08GiTmlVBWRo9Bi7wDYOtd_OUZpOmrJJEabE3eVkHhC-0" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="624" height="624"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;How Web3 technologies will mitigate climate change and lead to a regenerative future. &lt;/em&gt;Source: Midjourney&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="wef-recommendations-for-the-digitisation-of-carbon-markets-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;WEF Recommendations for the Digitisation of Carbon Markets 🌍&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/"&gt;WEF&lt;/a&gt; recently published a paper that explores carbon market challenges and the prospects of blockchain for lasting positive impact on the environment, society, and economy.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's dive in 👇🏽.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The paper "&lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/recommendations-for-the-digital-voluntary-and-regulated-carbon-markets"&gt;Recommendations for the Digital Voluntary and Regulated Carbon Markets&lt;/a&gt;" provides a digestible and impartial overview of the challenges created by digital carbon market technologies and the opportunities for blockchain technology-based approaches to expand the reach, credibility, and scalability of carbon markets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;1/ Carbon markets are a key part of global efforts to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and combat climate change. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;But they can be complex and difficult to navigate, especially for small and medium-sized enterprises&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This we know! So what is recommended? 👇&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Open Forest Protocol (OFP) (@OpenForest_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OpenForest_/status/1635334191830409219?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 13, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;It was developed by a varied group of stakeholders, including project developers, MRV (Measurement, Reporting, and Verification) providers, carbon marketplaces, blockchain foundations, and more... a mass-coordination effort. The aim is to educate key players like policymakers and corporate buyers for wider adoption of Web3-based climate solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-top-challenges-%F0%9F%A4%94"&gt;The top challenges 🤔&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-26.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="960" height="540" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-26.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-26.png 960w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: @&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/finrenton/status/1633910356048334866?s=20"&gt;Finrenton&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="recommendations-to-improve-%F0%9F%8C%BF"&gt;Recommendations to improve 🌿&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h5 id="1-promoting-inclusive-equitable-and-transparent-governance-%F0%9F%A4%B2"&gt;1. Promoting inclusive, equitable, and transparent governance 🤲&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;... at both technological and human levels. This includes educating and supporting local project developers and vulnerable populations (such as women and local communities) in governance and benefit sharing - to avoid unequal representation of stakeholders such as land stewards, address power imbalances, and better understand nuanced topics such as indigenous land practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5 id="2-create-a-more-accessible-marketplace-through-product-definition-and-clarity-%F0%9F%93%8B"&gt;2. Create a more accessible marketplace through product definition and clarity 📋&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is a need to create a standardized system, with clear labels, attributes and pricing, to distinguish signal from noise. Using open and transparent platforms like decentralized MRV networks and blockchain boots confidence, simplifies participation, and helps integrate credit usage into industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5 id="3-using-emerging-technologies-for-radical-scalability-%F0%9F%96%A5%EF%B8%8F"&gt;3. Using emerging technologies for radical scalability  🖥️&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;For instance, using satellite images, AI, and IoT sensors connected to blockchain and smart contracts can automate monitoring and verification, and enable digital native representations of these real-world assets. This increased transparency allows direct transactions between buyers and sellers, benefiting suppliers, project developers, and land stewards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5 id="4-interoperability-and-transparency-across-exchanges-and-platforms-%F0%9F%92%A1"&gt;4. Interoperability and transparency across exchanges and platforms 💡&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;A successful carbon market needs diverse participants and innovative solutions that work together. Creating public APIs for blockchain data and a data standard for carbon credits, ensures easy access and compatibility. Such tools must be designed according to data usage needs and developing industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-35.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="500" height="616"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Next level carbon market&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="what-does-it-mean-for-refi"&gt;What does it mean for ReFi?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;While new technologies aren't a cure-all, understanding them enables effective experimentation for tackling climate change. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi's principles are aligned with these ideas, using blockchain and decentralized tech to involve more people and offer fair incentives for large-scale solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/recommendations-for-the-digital-voluntary-and-regulated-carbon-markets" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the full paper here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="toucan-history-and-origins-%F0%9F%90%A7"&gt;Toucan History and Origins... 🐧&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toucan CEO and Co-Founder &lt;a href="https://blog.toucan.earth/toucan-history/www.twitter.com/raphabenoi"&gt;Raphaël Haupt&lt;/a&gt; dives into the story of how they saw&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;over 20 million tonnes of carbon credits flow on chain within the first six months after launch. How did they get there, what did they learn, and what is next? Read more 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://blog.toucan.earth/toucan-history/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Toucan | Digital Carbon Market Infrastructure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Applying a powerful set of tools to a complex set of problems: A stroll through Toucan’s history. How we got to where we are, and what we learned along the way.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://blog.toucan.earth/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/01/tc_symbol_OnDark_color@2x-1.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Toucan Protocol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Raphaël Haupt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.toucan.earth/content/images/2023/03/Header_Toucan_History.jpeg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-for-the-people-how-crypto-can-help-local-communities-help-their-ecosystems"&gt;ReFi for the People: How Crypto Can Help Local Communities Help Their Ecosystems&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coindesk article covers the importance of ReFi being embeded in local communities. They highlight the emerging ReFi Ecosystem in Suriname as a case study, which you can read more about in our review by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GoudzandT?ref=refi-dao"&gt;Tim Goudzand&lt;/a&gt; - the Surinamese founder of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/INFINITRI_IO"&gt;Infinitri.io&lt;/a&gt; - and the ReFi Spring team 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="__GHOST_URL__/the-refi-ecosystem-in-suriname/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;The ReFi Ecosystem in Suriname 🇸🇷&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;The settling of a formal ReFi community in Suriname, aligned around the principles of regeneration, collaboration, and mutual prosperity…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/12/6319c4c1d0b248c635dc4002_ReFi-DAO.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Marcelo Silva&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/The-ReFi-Ecosystem-in-Suriname-----.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Coindesk article also reflects on ReFi carbon markets and highlights an important quote from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Gallardo_Luchi"&gt;Lucía Gallardo&lt;/a&gt; “We need deeper discussions on underlying incentives and value dynamics to ensure we aren’t just digitizing and distributing the same processes that got us to where we are today.” 💯&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.coindesk.com/consensus-magazine/2023/02/24/refi-for-the-people-how-crypto-can-help-local-communities-help-their-ecosystems/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read full article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-lisboa-%E2%80%94-emergence"&gt;ReFi Lisboa — Emergence&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;What to learn what creating a network state to regenerate the earth really means? What it feels like? and meet other amazing people shared in this mission? The 2nd event from ReFi Lisboa kicks off on March 23rd. Come join a shelling point of founders, builders, and impact investors in the land of pastel de nata 🇵🇹&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/refi-lisboa-2"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-27.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1440" height="710" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-27.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-27.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-27.png 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is what happened last time 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qq0Xf4CUa30?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="ReFi Lisboa | KICK-OFF! 🎉 — Feb 17 2023"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/refi-lisboa-2" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register for Emergence&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="event-organizers-guildintro-call-%F0%9F%A4%99"&gt;Event Organizers Guild - Intro Call 🤙&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;How to run a successful ReFi event in your local community? Join us tomorrow (21st March) for our Intro Call discussing the newly announced &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/kicking-off-the-refi-event-organizers-guild/"&gt;Event Organizers Guild&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The call will take place in &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/5xaBNzHX"&gt;ReFi DAO's Discord server&lt;/a&gt; at two different times (to cover different time-zone needs):&lt;br&gt;🕚 &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/f4UjCrDX?event=1085325871084208168"&gt;11 AM UTC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;🕒 &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/f4UjCrDX?event=1085326272328110290"&gt;3 PM UTC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; After entering ReFi DAO's Discord, make sure to pick the 🌱 emoji in the &lt;strong&gt;#start-here&lt;/strong&gt; channel. In this way, you'll be able to enter the Event Organizers Guild channel. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/kicking-off-the-refi-event-organizers-guild/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-17-at-12-56-25-ReFi-Event-Organizers-Guild.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1187" height="667" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-17-at-12-56-25-ReFi-Event-Organizers-Guild.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-17-at-12-56-25-ReFi-Event-Organizers-Guild.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-17-at-12-56-25-ReFi-Event-Organizers-Guild.png 1187w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/meM2oo?ref&amp;#x3D;refi-dao" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="climate-bank-collapse-%F0%9F%8F%A6-%F0%9F%93%89"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate Bank Collapse &lt;/strong&gt;🏦 📉&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Asides from being a crypto-friendly bank (whose closure led to the temporary &lt;a href="https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-whales-suffer-huge-losses-due-to-usdc-depeg-svb-collapse"&gt;USDC de-pegging&lt;/a&gt;), SVB was &lt;a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2023/03/12/climate/silicon-valley-bank-climate.html"&gt;vital for climate tech&lt;/a&gt;. It had over 1,500 climate tech companies as customers and financed ≈60% of the American community solar market. FDIC has now reimbursed the bank's depositors, yet the lack of innovative banks sparks concerns about the industry's future...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;With the implosion of SVB, the planet could literally be at stake.  1,500 companies in climate tech were venture backed at the bank.&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Ryan Maue (@RyanMaue) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RyanMaue/status/1634319326202265604?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="impact-dao-landscape-%E2%9C%A8"&gt;Impact DAO Landscape ✨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Generalmagicio"&gt;General Magic&lt;/a&gt; 🪄 released a beautiful &lt;a href="https://mint.highlight.xyz/6411b58f37fbe7e23a150f1d"&gt;second edition&lt;/a&gt; illustration of the latest and greatest Impact DAOs driving positive change.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mint.highlight.xyz/6411b58f37fbe7e23a150f1d"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-40.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1414" height="1000" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-40.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-40.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-40.png 1414w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://mint.highlight.xyz/6411b58f37fbe7e23a150f1d"&gt;https://mint.highlight.xyz/6411b58f37fbe7e23a150f1d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mint.highlight.xyz/6411b58f37fbe7e23a150f1d" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Mint Landscape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;a href="https://www.thallo.io/"&gt;Thallo&lt;/a&gt; successfully &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thallo_io/status/1637741097534255107"&gt;retired its first carbon credits&lt;/a&gt; on its two-way bridge!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌐 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Kolektivo"&gt;Kolektivo&lt;/a&gt; shared its&lt;a href="https://www.kolektivo.cw/impact-report"&gt; 2022 Impact Report&lt;/a&gt; - highlights new technologies for ecological restoration and community empowerment, creating real impact in Curaçao and beyond!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🙌 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq"&gt;Solid World&lt;/a&gt; was &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq/status/1636452156214485007"&gt;selected by Mastercard Lighthouse&lt;/a&gt; to make forward financing liquid and launch green bonds with top-tier Nordic &amp;amp; Baltic banks, exemplifying ReFi's entrance into mainstream finance.  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;⛓️ &lt;a href="https://chain.link/"&gt;Chainlink&lt;/a&gt; published &lt;a href="https://blog.chain.link/climate-finance/"&gt;an article&lt;/a&gt; explaining how blockchains enhance climate finance, focusing on oracle networks that integrate climate data from dMRV solutions, auditors, and regulators on-chain&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🇺🇦 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AragonProject"&gt;Aragon&lt;/a&gt; partners with the Ukrainian Government to &lt;a href="https://theeagleweekly.substack.com/p/partnering-with-the-ukrainian-government"&gt;bring censorship-resistant DAOs to its citizens&lt;/a&gt;! &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💛 &lt;a href="https://www.goldstandard.org/blog-item/tokenisation-consultation-feedback-and-next-steps-gold-standard"&gt;Gold Standard&lt;/a&gt; progresses with tokenizing carbon credits, potentially launching them by summer.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=refi-dao"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-37.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-37.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-37.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-37.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-37.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;✳️ &lt;a href="https://dgguardians.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Green Digital Guardians&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/a&gt; a community of 'Green Digital Guardians' utlising Blockchain and NTFs for a decentralized and democratic model of environmental protection.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🟪 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://future.quest/"&gt;Future Quest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: a play-and-earn ecosystem committed to fixing our future. Help combat climate change and earn rewards along the way...&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌟 &lt;a href="https://regenliving.eco/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regen Living&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: a collective impact initiative to develop and fund ecosystem prototypes and place-based pilot projects. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌏 &lt;a href="https://nori.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nori&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: a transparent, verifiable, and high-quality carbon removal marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://popcorn.network/"&gt;PopcornDAO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: a DeFi protocol that allows users to earn high yield on cryptoassets while creating real world impact.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Projects included in&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/tag/roundup/"&gt;previous roundups&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;are not counted this week!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-55/refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-project" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="planetary-regeneration-podcast-%F0%9F%8C%8E%F0%9F%8C%8D%F0%9F%8C%8F"&gt;Planetary Regeneration Podcast 🌎🌍🌏&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/timrann"&gt;Tim Rann &lt;/a&gt;of &lt;a href="https://medium.com/mercy-corps-social-venture-fund"&gt;Mercy Corps Venture&lt;/a&gt; discusses impact investment in web3 &amp;amp; ReFi on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gregory_landua"&gt;Gregory Landua&lt;/a&gt;'s Planetary regeneration podcast 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🎙️On the podcast! &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gregory_landua?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gregory_landua&lt;/a&gt; is joined by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/timrann?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@timrann&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MCSocialVenture?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MCSocialVenture&lt;/a&gt; to discuss impact &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/investment?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#investment&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/web3?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#web3&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;MCV is an early-stage VC that backs startups increasing the resilience of underserved communities in emerging markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tune in: &lt;a href="https://t.co/na0U6LwuBB"&gt;https://t.co/na0U6LwuBB&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/pcC4V5JIVa"&gt;pic.twitter.com/pcC4V5JIVa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regen Network (@regen_network) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network/status/1636337024448753665?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 16, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/13ozFntuVRvl4n77XOt4Uo?si&amp;#x3D;18c31057d58342a2&amp;amp;nd&amp;#x3D;1" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JxPGzAYq_sw"&gt;SEC drama continues, Soil Carbon is hard&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;|&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; This Week In ReFi Episode by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SlaptainShwirv"&gt;Slaptain Shwirv&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRez"&gt;Rez&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lhtabNAx98s"&gt;Toward a More Cooperative Web3 with guests from Gitcoin, Harvard University and Safra Center for Ethics, and flickr.org&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;|&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Green Pill by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Kevin Owocki&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/block_explore/status/1636158717593829377?s=46&amp;amp;t=WHttsWhxGzMjVRuvHoBWyA"&gt;Carbon markets &amp;amp; Thallo with Hayley Moller&lt;/a&gt; | The Block Explorer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki/status/1636542900862611456"&gt;DAO Alignment with Sam Spurlin of The Ready&lt;/a&gt; | Green Pill by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Kevin Owocki&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refispring.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="browse-upcoming-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%8E%AA"&gt;Browse upcoming events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt; ! 🎪&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have recently launched the Alpha version of the new ReFi DAO web-app and knowledge graph (&lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/new-website-refi-dao/"&gt;read more about it&lt;/a&gt;). As part of this we are collecting a database of upcoming ReFi events. Check it out below and &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/add-data"&gt;add your event&lt;/a&gt; if it's missing!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.40.24-am-1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1226" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.40.24-am-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.40.24-am-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.40.24-am-1.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.40.24-am-1.png 2382w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the exciting events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-paris-blockchain-week-2023"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refi-paris-blockchain-week-2023-tickets-558736996397"&gt;ReFi @Paris Blockchain Week 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(20 - 24 March in Paris, France): &lt;/strong&gt;An event connecting ReFi and web 3 builders, devs, sustainability experts, citizens, creators and investors. It will focus on topics such as: digital identity, nature-based assets, tokenomics, ReFi network mapping and deep regeneration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-38.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-38.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-38.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refi-paris-blockchain-week-2023-tickets-558736996397" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Reserve a spot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="european-climate-summit"&gt;&lt;a href="https://reg.eventmobi.com/ECS2023"&gt;European Climate Summit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(28 - 30 March in Lisbon, Portugal)&lt;/strong&gt;: Discuss carbon markets with experts, tackling challenges and collaboration for net-zero emissions across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://reg.eventmobi.com/ECS2023/register"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-29.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="720" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-29.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-29.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-29.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-29.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://reg.eventmobi.com/ECS2023/register" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get your ticket here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="measuring-climate-impact-theory-learnings-from-web3-refi-projects"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/14-measuring-climate-impact-theory-learnings-from-web3-refi-projects-tickets-588478152997"&gt;Measuring Climate Impact: theory &amp;amp; learnings from web3 ReFi projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(28 March in Berlin, Germany): &lt;/strong&gt;learn more about the theory and learnings from Web3/ ReFi projects about digital Measurement, Reporting, Verification.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/14-measuring-climate-impact-theory-learnings-from-web3-refi-projects-tickets-588478152997"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-30.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-30.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-30.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/14-measuring-climate-impact-theory-learnings-from-web3-refi-projects-tickets-588478152997" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfind-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-ventureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/jasmine-energy/jobs/Iq6e8Z6-jasmine-energy-s22-full-stack-developer?utm_source=syn_li"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-32.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1436" height="954" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-32.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-32.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-32.png 1436w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/jasmine-energy/jobs/Iq6e8Z6-jasmine-energy-s22-full-stack-developer?utm_source&amp;#x3D;syn_li" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;View position&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the ReFi Jobs platform for more! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/?ref=refi-dao"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-33.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-33.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-33.png 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="step-by-step-guide-on-how-to-start-an-impact-dao-from-aragon"&gt;Step-by-step guide on how to start an impact DAO from &lt;a href="https://blog.aragon.org/how-to-start-an-impact-dao/"&gt;Aragon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;1️⃣ Define your mission&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2️⃣ Set incentives and decide if you’re launching a token&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3️⃣ Define your governance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4️⃣ Gather your community around your cause&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.aragon.org/how-to-start-an-impact-dao/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-31.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1200" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-31.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-31.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-31.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-31.png 2000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.aragon.org/how-to-start-an-impact-dao/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="solid-world-investor-letter-%E2%80%94-february-2023"&gt;Solid World Investor Letter — February 2023&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq"&gt;Solid world&lt;/a&gt; joined the &lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;Climate collective&lt;/a&gt;, mentioned in the new book "&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq/status/1633194958868959232"&gt;Catching up to Crypto&lt;/a&gt;", and recently completed an audit with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq/status/1636036082658582533"&gt;Dedaub&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;GM Solid World! We published our monthly investor letter for February 2023!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This Month:&lt;br&gt;✅Smart Contract Audits&lt;br&gt;🤝Climate Collective Membership&lt;br&gt;🧑‍🍳Investor Breakfast in Denver&lt;br&gt;🤩Bitboy Mention&lt;br&gt;🦸The Return of This Week In ReFi&lt;br&gt;⁉️MORE! &lt;a href="https://t.co/OTKeleieq2"&gt;https://t.co/OTKeleieq2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Solid World (@solidworldhq) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq/status/1637462635154231297?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 19, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="toucan-protocols-perspective-on-how-crypto-can-be-good-for-the-planet"&gt;&lt;a href="https://toucan.earth/"&gt;Toucan Protocol&lt;/a&gt;'s Perspective on how Crypto can be Good for the Planet&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://blog.toucan.earth/crypto-is-good-for-the-planet/"&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt; explores how as the foundations of blockchain technology become more sustainable - users, founders and developers are increasingly using it as a tool for good.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;How blockchain technology creates an environment where users, founders and developers can work together 🤝 to build a more sustainable future 👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/oU1yUrhPLO"&gt;https://t.co/oU1yUrhPLO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join the conversation and  share your thoughts in the comments!&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Toucan (@ToucanProtocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol/status/1636397019622195200?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 16, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.toucan.earth/crypto-is-good-for-the-planet/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;⚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Periods of sustained economic and societal instability inevitably lead to systemic points of inflection. Let us use this as an opportunity to incorporate ReFi in the redevelopment of our systems for the better.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic week friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-36.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1800" height="2250" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-36.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-36.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/image-36.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-36.png 1800w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;A peaceful terrarium - a balanced system that is designed to entirely sustain itself through its encompassing elements (+ sunlight)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hey ReFi fam! 👋&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On February 14th, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring"&gt;ReFi Spring&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/refi-spring-has-merged-with-refi-dao/"&gt;officially merged with ReFi DAO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, becoming its &lt;strong&gt;Event Organizers Guild&lt;/strong&gt;. During its first season, ReFi Spring supported the organization of 27 ReFi events and, until now, has received 130+ applications. One thing has become clear - the interest in organizing ReFi events has grown exponentially.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The power of IRL events to sow the seeds of regeneration worldwide is huge, and it needs the support of this incredible community to reach every corner of our planet. 🌱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;That’s where Event Organizers Guild emerges.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this blog post, we’ll cover some key points:&lt;br&gt;1. What is the ReFi Event Organizers Guild&lt;br&gt;2. When is the Guild opening its doors&lt;br&gt;3. What can you expect&lt;br&gt;4. How to get involved&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s go! 🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Untitled-design-142-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Untitled-design-142-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Untitled-design-142-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Untitled-design-142-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Untitled-design-142-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;The new ReFi Event Organizers Guild logo&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="friends-we-present-you-the-refi-event-organizers-guild-%F0%9F%97%BA%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Friends, we present you the ReFi Event Organizers Guild 🗺️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Imagine a place where event organizers, organizations and newcomers can find support and the opportunity to coordinate globally around the planning of ReFi events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The members of the guild coordinate to build their local communities, define priorities, raise funds and set standards for ReFi events, all with the validation coming from grassroots organizations with the support of global partners. 🤝&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the Guild will happen in 4 stages:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📜 &lt;strong&gt;Invitation:&lt;/strong&gt; key organizations from the ReFi ecosystem and experienced event organizers are invited to join the designing of the guild.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🏃 &lt;strong&gt;Training:&lt;/strong&gt; experts in different fields will host weekly sessions to help event organizers to get the most out of their events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🏗️ &lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; synchronized ReFi events &amp;amp; gatherings will kick off in different parts of the world, built by the members of the guild to consolidate the powerful network effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚙️ &lt;strong&gt;Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; the members of the guild will participate in the creation of the next season of ReFi events&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="so-when-do-we-start-%F0%9F%8F%81"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, when do we start? 🏁&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are super excited to share that the Event Organizers Guild has officially kicked - off &lt;strong&gt;today, March 14th&lt;/strong&gt;! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;During the kickoff Twitter space, we:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Presented the vision of the Guild&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shared the topics of upcoming workshops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Find the full recording of the Twitter Space here 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="zxx" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/8qYTg5QzsQ"&gt;https://t.co/8qYTg5QzsQ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🤝 ReFi Spring (@ReFiDAOist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist/status/1635642001914748929?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 14, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-can-i-join-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;How can I join? 🤝&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To join the Event Organizers Guild, make sure to:&lt;br&gt;1️ Fill in this &lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/meM2oo"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tally form&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; so we can get to know you better&lt;br&gt;2️ Join the ReFi DAO Discord server &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/5xaBNzHX "&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and pick the&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🌱 emoji in the #start-here channel to access the Guild channel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="upcoming-trainings-%F0%9F%8F%83"&gt;Upcoming Trainings 🏃 &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every Tuesday, starting from March 21th, the Event Organizer Guild will host regular trainings inside ReFi DAO's Discord server in the #event-organizers-guild channel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sure to join the first Intro Call with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/commonsstack"&gt;Commons Stack&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;When?&lt;/strong&gt; March 21st&lt;br&gt;⏰ &lt;strong&gt;Pick the time that works best for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;    - 3 PM UTC&lt;br&gt;    - 11 AM UTC&lt;br&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Where? In ReFi DAO's &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/5xaBNzHX "&gt;Discord Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;     - set a reminder for the 11 AM UTC call &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/f4UjCrDX?event=1085325871084208168"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;     - set a reminder for the 3 PM UTC call &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/5EJSaP8e?event=1085326272328110290"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The upcoming trainings will feature topics such as:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Regenerative Event Design&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;How to Run a ReFi 101 Talk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Climate 101 Masterclass&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Marketing of ReFi Events&lt;br&gt;&amp;amp; more &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-can-you-expect-%E2%9C%A8"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect?&lt;/strong&gt; ✨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Guild has its sights set on establishing itself as the go-to platform for everyone looking to host ReFi events, with the goal of spreading the seeds of regeneration in their local communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an event organizer, you’ll get the chance to tap into the collective intelligence of the community and all the resources that have been collected and prepared to support event organizers during two seasons of ReFi Spring events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The members are expected to share their knowledge and experience with all the other guild members, and actively participate in building the tools and setting for the upcoming ReFi events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are a perspective ReFi organizer, a local activist or a community builder, we can’t wait to meet you. 👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-14-at-16-34-11-ReFi-Spring-2022-Retrospective---ReFi-Spring.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="651" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-14-at-16-34-11-ReFi-Spring-2022-Retrospective---ReFi-Spring.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-14-at-16-34-11-ReFi-Spring-2022-Retrospective---ReFi-Spring.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-14-at-16-34-11-ReFi-Spring-2022-Retrospective---ReFi-Spring.png 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sowing the seeds of regeneration through IRL events - ReFi Perú 2022&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;A huge THANK YOU to all the event organizers that have helped us arrive to this point with their feedback and suggestions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the intro call of the Event Organizers Guild on March 21st, and follow &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi Spring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; on Twitter to stay up to date with the upcoming trainings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Peace! ✌️&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey  Regens!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Today we have &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ezeugosimon?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;Simon Eze&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Aida_Regen?t=R3Xi9bEcyLC321YZ0axJNw&amp;amp;s=09"&gt;Adaeze Okafor&lt;/a&gt; here for a &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/tag/community/"&gt;ReFi Community Story&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;✨ &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Simon is an entrepreneur, climate researcher, and &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/author/simon/"&gt;ReFi DAO content contributor&lt;/a&gt;. Adaeze is a Soil scientist and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refibysouth?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;ReFi by South&lt;/a&gt; Ambassador in Nigeria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For this article, we’ll be looking at the impacts of climate change in the Sahel region and exploring how regenerative agriculture + indigenous knowledge + ReFi and Web3 can help these local communities and combat climate change.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;But first, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/round/10/0x10be322de44389ded49c0b2b73d8c3a1e3b6d871/0x10be322de44389ded49c0b2b73d8c3a1e3b6d871-16"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi Lagos&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, and a network of our local refi commtunies across the globe need your support! We would be super grateful if you might consider supporting &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://tinyurl.com/refi-local-nodes"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi Local Nodes on Gitcoin&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;! &lt;/em&gt;🙏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tinyurl.com/refi-local-nodes" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support ReFi Local Nodes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Now lets dive in 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_10-45-56-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_10-45-56-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_10-45-56-1.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_10-45-56-1.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="exploring-the-sahel-%F0%9F%90%AA"&gt;Exploring The Sahel 🐪&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smallholder farmers produce one-third of the world's food, helping to feed the planet's &lt;a href="https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/"&gt;8 billion people&lt;/a&gt;. Across developing countries, rural economies account for a significant share of natural capital, employment, and output, but are widely characterized by severe work deficits and poverty, hosting nearly &lt;a href="https://www.ilo.org/global/topics/economic-and-social-development/rural-development/lang--en/index.htm"&gt;80 per cent of the world's poor.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahel"&gt;The Sahel region,&lt;/a&gt; which stretches 5,410 kilometers, from West to East Africa, from the Atlantic Ocean to the Red Sea, is one of the most promising in the world. However, this territory is characterized by persistent poverty, fragile ecosystems, and a changing climate. With &lt;strong&gt;temperatures projected to be 1.5 times higher than the global average&lt;/strong&gt;, Sahelian countries are being pushed beyond their abilities to adapt.‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Sahel?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Sahel&lt;/a&gt; stretches from Africa&amp;#39;s Atlantic coast to the Red Sea, with 4 countries bordering Lake Chad.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Challenges in the region are many, including poverty, inequality, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ClimateChange?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ClimateChange&lt;/a&gt; and conflict, but so are the opportunities. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ThrivingSahel?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ThrivingSahel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/yMxNzt4ntx"&gt;https://t.co/yMxNzt4ntx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; UN Development (@UNDP) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/UNDP/status/1532134902593994759?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;June 1, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/hahahahah-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="711" height="374" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/hahahahah-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/hahahahah-1.jpg 711w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Sahel Countries&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.blockdata.tech/blog/general/what-is-regenerative-finance"&gt;Regenerative finance (ReFi)&lt;/a&gt;, which aims to create financial systems that support sustainable economic growth and environmental stewardship, has the potential to play a critical role in addressing climate adaptation and food justice in the Sahel region. ReFi is crypto's answer to sustainable initiatives. As the need to address climate change grows, so does interest in ReFi projects. Especially in Africa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Looking to understand the concept of Regenerative Finance (or &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;)?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&amp;#39;ve got something for you! Take a peek at &lt;a href="https://t.co/MFqB4wCfhg"&gt;https://t.co/MFqB4wCfhg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Toucan (@ToucanProtocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol/status/1641062902198140928?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-invisible-enemy-climate-change-%F0%9F%92%A8"&gt;The Invisible Enemy: Climate Change 💨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Millions of smallholder farmers in the Sahel region rely on rain-fed agriculture for a living. However, the region is prone to frequent droughts, desertification, and other environmental challenges, making it difficult for farmers to produce enough food to meet the needs of the growing population.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crop failures, livestock losses, and reduced access to water are all&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AFEXNigeria/status/1630143103817469952?s=20"&gt; effects of climate change&lt;/a&gt;, consequently leading to food crises, migration, and widespread &lt;a href="https://www.iss.europa.eu/content/sahel-climate-conflicts-when-fighting-climate-change-fuels-terrorism"&gt;terrorism&lt;/a&gt; in the region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_16-59-21-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="668" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_16-59-21-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_16-59-21-1.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-13_16-59-21-1.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to the&lt;a href="https://www.fao.org/3/cb9910en/cb9910en.pdf"&gt; Food and Agriculture Organization&lt;/a&gt;, the percentage of irrigated farming in the Sahel region is relatively low. It is estimated that &lt;strong&gt;only 1.4% of total agricultural land in the region are irrigated, compared to the global average of around 20%&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The low percentage of irrigated farming is due to several factors, including the high cost of irrigation infrastructure, water scarcity, and limited access to financing for smallholder farmers. Poor access to agriculture financing has left lots of smallholder farmers unbanked and out of the farming business, consequently increasing agricultural infrastructure and food deficit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;However, ongoing efforts to increase irrigated agriculture use in the region, including large-scale projects like the&lt;a href="https://www.fao.org/in-action/action-against-desertification/overview/great-green-wall/en/"&gt; Great Green Wall (GGW)&lt;/a&gt;, are aimed at promoting sustainable land management practices and expanding irrigated agriculture to improve agricultural productivity and food security in the Sahel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZDXRAFT-cNM?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Great Green Wall Implementation Status and Way Ahead to 2030 Report"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 2030, the Great Green Wall initiative hopes to have restored 100 million hectares of degraded land&lt;/strong&gt;, sequestered&lt;a href="https://www.unccd.int/our-work/ggwi"&gt; 250 million tons of carbon&lt;/a&gt;, and "created 10 million of green jobs.”&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="unlocking-climate-finance-with-refi-%F0%9F%92%B0"&gt;Unlocking Climate Finance with ReFi 💰&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to a &lt;a href="https://blogs.afdb.org/a-race-against-time/post/climate-change-interventions-in-africa-applying-a-gender-lens-18464"&gt;report&lt;/a&gt; by the &lt;a href="http://www.afdb.com"&gt;African Development Bank&lt;/a&gt;, the &lt;strong&gt;total cost of adapting to climate change in the continent is estimated to be between US$20 billion and US$30 billion per year&lt;/strong&gt;. However, the actual amount of finance currently being provided for climate change adaptation and mitigation initiatives in the region is far below this estimate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To end poverty and meet the nutritional needs of a growing global population in the Sahel region, we must promote agricultural investments and develop rural economies. This is acknowledged in the Sustainable Development Goals (SDG) of the 2030 Agenda, which aim to accelerate the rural economy, and &lt;a href="https://sdgs.un.org/2030agenda"&gt;ensure sustainable consumption and production&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The global regenerative agriculture&lt;a href="https://www.polarismarketresearch.com/press-releases/regenerative-agriculture-market"&gt; &lt;em&gt;market size&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is expected to reach USD 23.84 billion by 2030. With ReFi, we can align people, technology, and financial incentives with the principles of sustainability and regeneration. ReFi can help address the climate finance deficit in the Sahel region by promoting sustainable agriculture practices. These practices include agroforestry, conservation agriculture, and other&lt;a href="https://www.earthday.org/campaign/regenerative-agriculture/"&gt; regenerative farming&lt;/a&gt; methods that promote soil health, reduce water usage, and increase crop yields.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Regenerative agriculture is a holistic approach to farming that focuses on restoring and enhancing the health of ecosystems, rather than just maximizing yields. It&amp;#39;s based on 5 principles that help create a sustainable and resilient system. Let&amp;#39;s dive into them! &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/SoilHealth?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#SoilHealth&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/FBRVkcbGnh"&gt;pic.twitter.com/FBRVkcbGnh&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Shamba (@shambanetwork) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/shambanetwork/status/1641855536022065153?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 31, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;To bridge the financial gaps and accelerate investments in agriculture real-world assets (RWAs), emerging startups like &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/landxfinance/status/1631716728550957056?t=Eepf-51tsDG_VMxBW8L4Tw&amp;amp;s=35"&gt;LandX&lt;/a&gt; is launching a digital currency backed by real-world agricultural commodities- corn, rice, wheat, and soybeans, called &lt;a href="https://blog.landx.fi/xusd-a-stablecoin-backed-by-real-world-assets-a9bd608478df"&gt;xUSD stablecoin&lt;/a&gt;.  &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.boundlesspay.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BoundlessPay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is creating an offline payment solution using SMS verification for the unbanked population in an effort to enhance financial inclusion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://nodo.xyz/news/pay-remit/boundlesspay-targets-offline-users-in-blockchain-payment-system-ceo?p&amp;#x3D;1540"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;BoundlessPay Targets Offline Users in Blockchain Payment System: CEO - https://nodo.xyz&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;BoundlessPay future rollout will include an offline system where users can receive withdrawal codes using SMS and Email.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://nodo.xyz/_nuxt/icons/icon_512x512.6e69dd.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;nodo-frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Vincent Matinde&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://admin.nodo.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/boundlesspay.jpeg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="empowering-indigenous-peoplebuilding-a-global-network-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;Empowering Indigenous People - Building A Global Network 🌍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;By 2050, the population of countries in the Sahel region is expected to increase dramatically. Niger is expected to grow from 25 million to more than&lt;a href="https://worldpopulationreview.com/countries/niger-population"&gt; 65 million&lt;/a&gt;; Burkina Faso from&lt;a href="https://worldpopulationreview.com/countries/burkina-faso-population"&gt; 21.6 million to 43.4 million&lt;/a&gt;; and Nigeria from&lt;a href="https://worldpopulationreview.com/countries/nigeria-population"&gt; 212 million to 401 million&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agriculture employs more than 90% of the Sahel's population&lt;/strong&gt;, and the region is one of the world's most youthful, with approximately 64% of the population under the age of 25. Investing in regenerative agriculture can aid in the adaptation of local nomads and farmers to the effects of climate change.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Sahel?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Sahel&lt;/a&gt; is one of the youngest regions in the 🌎. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;About 64% of its population is under the age of 25. Young people can bring hope and change to the many challenges of the region, including inequality, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ClimateChange?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ClimateChange&lt;/a&gt; and violent extremism. &lt;a href="https://t.co/Ic6P2YisxL"&gt;https://t.co/Ic6P2YisxL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/UNGA?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#UNGA&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/mJza4EF0b8"&gt;pic.twitter.com/mJza4EF0b8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; UN Development (@UNDP) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/UNDP/status/1573024806257426432?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;September 22, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Policies and initiatives that promote food sovereignty, or the right of people to determine their food systems, can also help address the Sahel region's growing food crisis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Local-benefits-1.PNG" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="387" height="396"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: Vivid Economics&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="but-how-can-refi-contribute-%F0%9F%94%A8"&gt;But How Can ReFi Contribute? 🔨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supporting bioregional governance, establishing a &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-54/"&gt;network&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/announcing-the-refi-dao-local-node-prize/"&gt;local nodes&lt;/a&gt;, and encouraging the use of&lt;a href="https://agrifoodnetworks.org/afn/article/indigenous-seeds-achieving-food-sovereignty-empowering-the-local-people"&gt; indigenous seeds&lt;/a&gt; are examples of initiatives with potential to help regenerate and promote food sovereignty in the region. Indigenous farmers can also sponsor irrigation projects and regenerate the environment by leveraging the rapidly growing &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-56/"&gt;carbon market&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here are some examples of projects driving agricultural investments and sustainable land-use in Africa:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-9.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-9.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-9.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-9.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-9.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🔬 &lt;a href="https://sfarmlab.com/"&gt;Soilless Farm Lab&lt;/a&gt;: enabling food security and green skills by integrating modern technologies in hydroponics and aeroponic greenhouse farming. Soilless Lab has trained over 13,700 African youths in climate-smart agriculture&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🛖 &lt;a href="https://houseafrica.io/"&gt;HouseAfrica&lt;/a&gt;: a property tech startup digitizing physical asset payments, land title allocation, and verification on the blockchain&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;👩🏾‍🌾 &lt;a href="http://@shambanetwork"&gt;Shamba Network&lt;/a&gt;: developing a decentralized ecological data oracle for smallholder farmers using &lt;a href="https://bounties.gitcoin.co/grants/4851/shamba-ecological-oracle-and-dmrv-network"&gt;digital -MRV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🛰 &lt;a href="https://agroextech.com/"&gt;Agro Exchange&lt;/a&gt;: building a satellite data system to monitor crop health and provide early warning information to smallholder farmers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌾 &lt;a href="https://falgates.com/"&gt;FaLGates&lt;/a&gt;: an emerging rice brand with 1,005 Ha farm in Kaduna and a 300-tonnes-per-day  milling facility. Falgates is the owner of #FalRice and works closely with smallholder farmers to revolutionize rice farming, crop development, and seed processing in Nigeria.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌽 &lt;a href="https://ubiafrica.com/"&gt;Úbì Africa&lt;/a&gt;: building a b2b digital distribution platform for farmers and emerging food producers in Africa.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Interested in African foods  and agro commodities?  Kindly sign up using the link below. &lt;a href="https://t.co/jwDLco2Zfn"&gt;https://t.co/jwDLco2Zfn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/daryljedwards?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@daryljedwards&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@JimiCohen&lt;/a&gt; @ &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@owocki&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@climateXcrypto&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/shambanetwork?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@shambanetwork&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Aida_Regen?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Aida_Regen&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ezeugosimon?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ezeugosimon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OpenFoodChain?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@OpenFoodChain&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiHongKong?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiHongKong&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/supermodularxyz?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@supermodularxyz&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/wr8T3LZgKV"&gt;pic.twitter.com/wr8T3LZgKV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Lagos 🌴 🌾 #GG18 (@ReFiLagos01) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLagos01/status/1686012684464975874?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;July 31, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="adapting-indigenous-knowledge"&gt;Adapting Indigenous Knowledge&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In addition to modern technologies &amp;amp; ReFi solutions, indigenous knowledge and inclusion is key. For centuries, Sahelian nomads have been using &lt;a href="https://www.wired.co.uk/bc/article/3d-mapping-indigenous-climate-change-extinction"&gt;indigenous knowledge&lt;/a&gt; of the land and animal behavior to track herds and predict weather patterns. For example,&lt;a href="https://www.goodnet.org/articles/traditional-farming-techniques-are-stopping-desertification"&gt; the old age zaï technique&lt;/a&gt; practiced in the sahel, digging small pits in the soil to catch water and retain it in the root zone of crops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-12_12-20-30-2.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="672" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/photo_2023-03-12_12-20-30-2.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/photo_2023-03-12_12-20-30-2.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/photo_2023-03-12_12-20-30-2.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Example of the &lt;a href="https://www.goodnet.org/articles/traditional-farming-techniques-are-stopping-desertification"&gt;zaï technique&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‌‌&lt;/strong&gt;Combining traditional knowledge with modern technologies can provide a powerful tool for climate adaptation efforts in the Sahel. Stakeholders can make informed decisions about how to manage their land and identify which regenerative agriculture practices are most effective in the Sahel region by collecting data on soil health, crop yields, and other metrics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This can help to track progress over time and guide future efforts to improve land health and food security in the Sahel region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Benefits-2.PNG" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="847" height="375" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Benefits-2.PNG 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Benefits-2.PNG 847w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: Vivid Economics&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="seeds-of-hope-regeneration-for-a-sustainable-sahel-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Seeds of Hope: Regeneration for a sustainable Sahel 🌱&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In summary, it is more than possible to restore the health of the land and enhance food security for the local population through a coordinated network of farmers and stakeholders who are educated and incentivised to this goal and by utilizing technology, partnerships, data, and the emerging systems of Regenerative Finance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Although there are obstacles to putting this strategy into practice, let us approach these challenges with pragmatic optimism and invest in the power of collaboration and innovation to transform the Sahel into a thriving, sustainable ecosystem for generations to come! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-article-lets-spread-the-word-%F0%9F%93%A2"&gt;Enjoyed this article? Let's spread the word 📢 ...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please help to share this article, especially to regens in Africa and the rest of the global south by clicking the button below 👇🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/_DZdd" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share this article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Furthermore, you can join &lt;a href="https://t.me/+zGhwit24SUNkZWJh"&gt;ReFi Lagos on telegram&lt;/a&gt; and we would also be super grateful if you might consider supporting us and the network of other &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://tinyurl.com/refi-local-nodes"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi Local Nodes on Gitcoin&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;! &lt;/em&gt;🙏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tinyurl.com/refi-local-nodes" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support ReFi Local Nodes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌‌&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Howdy Regens!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/thetokenjedi"&gt;Scott Morris&lt;/a&gt;, (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetokenjedi"&gt;@thetokenjedi&lt;/a&gt;) here with your weekly ReFi Roundup. I got my start back in 2009 by organizing a community currency pilot in the wake of the "Great Financial Crisis". I was mighty honored to be in the film &lt;a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2949308/"&gt;Money &amp;amp; Life&lt;/a&gt; for that work alongside some real ReFi OG's; folks like &lt;a href="https://capitalinstitute.org/"&gt;John Fullerton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://charleseisenstein.org/"&gt;Charles Eisenstein&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://centerforpartnership.org/"&gt;Riane Eisler&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.ethicalmarkets.com/"&gt;Hazel Henderson&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://bernard-lietaer.org/"&gt;Bernard Lietaer&lt;/a&gt;. These days I offer regenerative economic systems design expertise and a seasoned operator's perspective to teams, funders, and policy makers on what community based systems can do with crypto and what it takes to implement. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this edition of the Roundup, we talk about the still unfolding banking crisis, the IPCC report, and the usual array of goodies. Lets dive in... 🤿&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/bank-failure-bingo-card.webp" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="960" height="874" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/bank-failure-bingo-card.webp 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/bank-failure-bingo-card.webp 960w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bank failure bingo card via r/StockMarket&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="its-bank-collapse-season-already"&gt;It's Bank Collapse Season &lt;em&gt;Already?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 id="i-havent-even-put-away-my-ftx-crisis-decorations-yet"&gt;I haven't even put away my FTX crisis decorations yet...&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Too soon?&lt;/em&gt; It might feel that way, but then again you don't even really need to be that old to remember the last crisis, the GFC in 2008, or the dot-com bubble. What boomers call a "once in a lifetime" crisis is basically just &lt;em&gt;Tuesday&lt;/em&gt; for millennials and younger generations. Many of us have already reached the point of "just throw it on the crisis pile." 🤷‍♂️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Last week we saw an escalation in the latest financial crisis, after the &lt;a href="https://www.ft.com/content/072dd83d-232d-4223-9428-801d4437b4f6"&gt;Swiss bank Credit Suisse&lt;/a&gt; went down following the collapse of &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2023/mar/17/why-silicon-valley-bank-collapsed-svb-fail"&gt;Silicon Valley Bank&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2023-03-15/signature-bank-faced-criminal-probe-ahead-of-firm-s-collapse"&gt;Signature Bank&lt;/a&gt; in the US. If you would like to get caught up, check out the video below 👇🏽.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/pZq6TJrUaiM?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Big Short Investors Explain the Banking Crisis (Credit Suisse Fails - Michael Burry, Steve Eisman)"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;TLDW: Is the end nigh? Not today at least; i.e. IT'S FINE. 🔥&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="economic-diversity-financial-monoculture-%F0%9F%92%B8"&gt;Economic Diversity &amp;gt; Financial Monoculture 💸&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;So what's the deal? For all we hear about how risky crypto is, it sure feels like the old system flies into panic mode &lt;em&gt;somewhere &lt;/em&gt;at least every 2-3 years. Our dearly departed monetary and economic philosopher, and co-architect of the European Currency Unit (predecessor to the Euro), &lt;a href="https://bernard-lietaer.org/"&gt;Bernard Lietaer&lt;/a&gt; loved to remind people that we have actually experienced &lt;em&gt;hundreds&lt;/em&gt; of financial, banking, and debt crises since the 1970's. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But what are we to do? Return to the gold standard? Hardly. Bernard had a &lt;a href="https://bernard-lietaer.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2010-Is-Our-Monetary-Structure-a-Systemic-Cause-for-Financial-Instability-Evidence-and-Remedies-from-Nature-Lietaer-et-al-annotated.pdf"&gt;different recommendation&lt;/a&gt;, which was to diversify our economical systems so they were in line with the way nature designed ecological systems: as a balance of streamlining for efficiency with diversity and interconnectedness for resilience. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In other words, instead of striving for a hyper-connected, uber-liquid monetary and financial &lt;em&gt;monoculture&lt;/em&gt;, what we really need is to create an economic &lt;em&gt;permaculture&lt;/em&gt;, one with ample alternatives and redundancies so that when the shocks come (and they will continue to) real people in real communities can rest easier knowing they will still be able to meet local needs with local resources. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screen-Shot-2023-03-24-at-4.36.34-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="587" height="298"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://bernard-lietaer.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2010-Is-Our-Monetary-Structure-a-Systemic-Cause-for-Financial-Instability-Evidence-and-Remedies-from-Nature-Lietaer-et-al-annotated.pdf" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read Bernard&amp;#x27;s article here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="empowering-communities-through-alternative-economics-%F0%9F%AB%B6%F0%9F%8F%BC"&gt;Empowering Communities Through Alternative Economics 🫶🏼&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is in these moments of crisis and uncertainty that we gain the sharpest sense of how urgently and how badly these alternatives are needed, especially by those &lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt; working with substantial amounts of financial capital. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That's where we come in Regens. ReFi is really but the latest chapter of a long tradition of native, informal, alternative, complementary, feminist, emancipatory, solidarity, and syntropic economics arising to fill the gaps and reprioritize the health and wealth of the planet and her people. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/OL5xyoD_P6A?t=3910"&gt;What does that look like&lt;/a&gt;? It looks like a &lt;em&gt;full spectrum&lt;/em&gt; of monetary and financial mechanisms, and any number of the technologies that provide access and use of the same, working &lt;em&gt;together&lt;/em&gt; in service of a post-extractive, pro-regeneration way of being for humanity on the planet. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Spectrum-of-Monetary-Systems.001.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1680" height="1050" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Spectrum-of-Monetary-Systems.001.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Spectrum-of-Monetary-Systems.001.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Spectrum-of-Monetary-Systems.001.jpeg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Spectrum-of-Monetary-Systems.001.jpeg 1680w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;an improved version of a slide from my TEDx: &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/v_mWaoBhAEA"&gt;Putting People and Planet Before Paper Wealth&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over the years, I have drawn deep inspiration from stories I've heard of people overcoming incredibly challenging conditions by rethinking how money works in relationship to what "value" means in their community:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stories like that of the &lt;a href="https://tontinecoffeehouse.com/2020/06/15/silvio-gesell-and-the-worgl-experiment/"&gt;Austrian Worgl&lt;/a&gt;, where a local mayor issued local notes to stimulate the local economy during the Great Depression which were so effective people reportedly had enough extra cash to start prepaying their taxes. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Like that of the distributed regional &lt;a href="https://bancopalmas.com/"&gt;Banco Palmas&lt;/a&gt; system in Brazil, whereby local farmers and rural communities gained access to credit systems and other financial services powered by regionally devoted currencies, each with their own local flavour.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;And like those of the more &lt;a href="https://www.moneyland.ch/en/time-banking-currency-switzerland-guide"&gt;recent introduction&lt;/a&gt; of a time-based currency &amp;amp; approach to saving for retirement in Switzerland, where they have already had time to cultivate a famously stable economy in part due to the now 80+ year old &lt;a href="https://monneta.org/en/wir-bank-switzerland/"&gt;WIR bank&lt;/a&gt; and its business to business mutual credit system.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over time, it becomes clear that the tools we're building and the technologies involved matter much less than the relationships rooted in real community and the process by which the community is included in the process of determining what is actually needed based on their specific set of challenges. Each of the above examples provide a glimpse at the power of what's possible when this is done well. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Good luck, and may the Force be with you always. 💪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="ipcc-publishes-synthesis-report-%E2%98%81%EF%B8%8F"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IPCC Publishes Synthesis Report ☁️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The good news: The world is not &lt;em&gt;completely&lt;/em&gt; doomed! There's still a chance to save humanity from a future which can be approximated as a sort of hell on earth type of situation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bad news: Their is a &lt;strong&gt;"Rapidly closing window of opportunity"&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/syr/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/337323986_640441244571210_1174560676295375908_n.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1440" height="1440" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/337323986_640441244571210_1174560676295375908_n.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/337323986_640441244571210_1174560676295375908_n.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/337323986_640441244571210_1174560676295375908_n.jpg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/syr/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get the IPCC Report&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-local-node-prize-%F0%9F%8E%89"&gt;ReFi DAO Local Node Prize 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi DAO, in partnership with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/commonsstack?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;Commons Stack&lt;/a&gt;, has announced the launch of the Local Node Prize. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;As a part of our vision of realizing a global regenerative economy, we have opened applications for the ReFi DAO Local Node Prize with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/commonsstack?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@CommonsStack&lt;/a&gt;! 🎉&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply now: &lt;a href="https://t.co/fHD17FH2qd"&gt;https://t.co/fHD17FH2qd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Watch: &lt;a href="https://t.co/GvPAaXqvm3"&gt;https://t.co/GvPAaXqvm3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read: &lt;a href="https://t.co/xXll9EC6tc"&gt;https://t.co/xXll9EC6tc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learn more 🧵🪡&lt;br&gt;1/ &lt;a href="https://t.co/DI1vkneLI2"&gt;pic.twitter.com/DI1vkneLI2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 Local Node Prize! 🎉 (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1638947958912860160?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The search is on for a startup city in the &lt;a href="https://worldpopulationreview.com/country-rankings/global-south-countries?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;Global South&lt;/a&gt; to join &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/local-/refi-lisboa/r/recgtsQ4UANi2VAba"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt; in the Alpha Cohort of the Local Node Incubator. The ultimate aim is to grow a global network of local communities that build the foundations for a next-generation regenerative economy. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/3qLB47?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Apply here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are representing a city from the &lt;a href="https://worldpopulationreview.com/country-rankings/global-north-countries" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Global North&lt;/a&gt;, you can still submit an application to express your interest! The official applications for the Global North will be opening later this year. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In order to support this work, ReFi DAO is currently crowdfunding for a Local Node matching pool. We would be incredibly grateful if you &lt;a href="https://mirror.xyz/0x7340F1a1e4e38F43d2FCC85cdb2b764de36B40c0/FABiu5AhpAR6LBLZxlGSfjOrHsHYj2J8VT4QJWPxbpk?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;could collect the announcement post on Mirror&lt;/a&gt; as a historic NFT and support the emergence of key onramps for talent and capital into the regenerative economy!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mirror.xyz/0x7340F1a1e4e38F43d2FCC85cdb2b764de36B40c0/FABiu5AhpAR6LBLZxlGSfjOrHsHYj2J8VT4QJWPxbpk" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Collect on Mirror&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="regen-network-and-toucan-nct-to-regen-ledger-bridge-%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;Regen Network and Toucan: NCT to Regen Ledger bridge 🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;NCT is a carbon token backed by Verra's carbon credits, tokenized by &lt;a href="https://toucan.earth/"&gt;Toucan Protocol&lt;/a&gt;, and now available to bridge between &lt;a href="https://www.regen.network/"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt; and Polygon. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In April, NCT will be available for purchase on &lt;a href="https://app.regen.network/"&gt;Regen Marketplace&lt;/a&gt; and it can be redeemed and retired from &lt;a href="https://osmosis.zone/"&gt;Osmosis&lt;/a&gt;, offering more than just bridging.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://regennetwork.notion.site/A-Guide-to-Nature-Carbon-Ton-NCT-8204ea9d20d0436281f49b8fd1b3fbd2"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-42.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1340" height="815" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-42.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-42.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-42.png 1340w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://regennetwork.notion.site/A-Guide-to-Nature-Carbon-Ton-NCT-8204ea9d20d0436281f49b8fd1b3fbd2" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-big-week-for-refi-events-%F0%9F%8E%AA"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A big week for ReFi events! 🎪&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out some highlights from the awesome array of ReFi events that happened around the globe last week! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="greenpill-india"&gt;Greenpill India!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The enthusiasm surrounding &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiIndia"&gt;ReFi India&lt;/a&gt;'s &lt;a href="https://www.refiindia.com/green-pill-festival"&gt;Geenpill Festival&lt;/a&gt; requires no further explanation. Amazing locations, great vibes, and productive sessions. Check out some highlights below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GPF?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GPF&lt;/a&gt; Day 1 Highlights 6/8&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Post this breathtaking view, our &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regens&lt;/a&gt; gathered around under the night, starry sky to listen to the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GPF?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GPF&lt;/a&gt; hack keynote speaker, the force behind the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GreenPill?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GreenPill&lt;/a&gt; movement, the one &amp;amp; only &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@owocki&lt;/a&gt; 🧪&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here&amp;#39;s our very own &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/IrthuSuresh?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@IrthuSuresh&lt;/a&gt; welcoming him 🫶🏼🙌🏽 &lt;a href="https://t.co/NHTuwoGj3I"&gt;pic.twitter.com/NHTuwoGj3I&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Atlantis 🔱 (@AtlantisDAO1) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AtlantisDAO1/status/1638664686915792897?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-lisboa-emergence"&gt;ReFi Lisboa Emergence!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt;'s second event saw some big progress in the collaborative journey towards a network state to regenerate the earth, including the first use of the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1639009119460786176/photo/4"&gt;ReFi Local Node Canvas&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Mapping out a canvas for the first Local Node here at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiLisboa&lt;/a&gt; to test the network state hypothesis at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amazing folks from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@tdfinyourdreams&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ToucanProtocol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Cerulean_xyz?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Cerulean_xyz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RaizFarms?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@RaizFarms&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactMarket_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@impactMarket_&lt;/a&gt; and beyond. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lisbon is bumpin’! 👏 &lt;a href="https://t.co/X9j4VfVFm4"&gt;pic.twitter.com/X9j4VfVFm4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; jE ❤️ Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1639009119460786176?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-paris-blockchain-weekrefiparis-is-born-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;ReFi @ Paris Blockchain week --&amp;gt; #ReFiParis is born! 🌱&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supported by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt;, ReFi had an energetic side event to Paris Blockchain week.. From Café Philosophique discussions to ReFi Fundamentals &amp;amp; Tokenomics, an exciting community of French Regens came together. ReFi Paris is a go ✨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;A snapshot of heart-warming moments lived this week in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Paris?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Paris&lt;/a&gt; with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; fam. Thank you all that made it happen 🇫🇷 🥰&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MontyMerlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JeanneBloch?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@JeanneBloch&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/lettyprados?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@lettyprados&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/bjuglas?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@bjuglas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BudgetDynamic?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@BudgetDynamic&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MatthieuHayoz?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MatthieuHayoz&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/commonsstack?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@commonsstack&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ParisBlockWeek?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ParisBlockWeek&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Crystalchain_FR?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Crystalchain_FR&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MauriCGN?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MauriCGN&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cardashift?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@cardashift&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/BtNCgBWwZP"&gt;pic.twitter.com/BtNCgBWwZP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; carapilla.eth/carapilla.lens (@Carapilla) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Carapilla/status/1639570337737080832?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 25, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MowgliRegen"&gt;Emilia&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin"&gt;Monty&lt;/a&gt; also hosted the first ReFi DAO network mapping session, starting the foundation for building key intelligence on local actors, projects and institutions for regeneration. Check out the Alpha dashboard and apply to join 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/local-/refi-paris/r/rec0T6k5fdECX3Kzf"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-27-at-1.39.09-pm.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1558" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-27-at-1.39.09-pm.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-27-at-1.39.09-pm.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-27-at-1.39.09-pm.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-27-at-1.39.09-pm.png 2136w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/local-/refi-paris/r/rec0T6k5fdECX3Kzf"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi Paris Local Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/join-community" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Join Local Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤟 &lt;a href="https://www.economicdemocracy.us/"&gt;Center for Economic Democracy&lt;/a&gt; launches free &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://capture.dropbox.com/qRTwLt5gJdnygAD3"&gt;Economics for Emancipation&lt;/a&gt; course&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🦓 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Zebras_Unite"&gt;Zebras Unite&lt;/a&gt; - a member-owned movement creating the culture, capital &amp;amp; community for the next economy - outlines &lt;a href="https://medium.com/zebras-unite/the-future-we-co-create-imperfectly-4c9e985220e8"&gt;their vision for 2023&lt;/a&gt; and how to create a self-reflective working culture that doesn't suck (the life out of you).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🙌 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/loa_labs"&gt;LOA Labs&lt;/a&gt; shares their &lt;a href="https://medium.com/@LOA_Labs/loa-labs-better-world-blockchain-climate-thesis-d626790fc4a7"&gt;Better World Blockchain Climate Thesis&lt;/a&gt; - 9 bold solutions and notable projects for Web3 enabled climate action.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🐧 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol"&gt;Toucan Protocol&lt;/a&gt; released an excellent article on '&lt;a href="https://blog.toucan.earth/what-is-refi-regenerative-finance/"&gt;What is Regenerative Finance (ReFi)?&lt;/a&gt;' - one to share with friends and fam! &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We love hearing from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=refi-dao"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Most-updated-graph-without-links.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Most-updated-graph-without-links.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Most-updated-graph-without-links.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Most-updated-graph-without-links.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Most-updated-graph-without-links.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;🛞 &lt;a href="https://wheelco.in/"&gt;Wheel Coin&lt;/a&gt;: a Move2Earn app seeking to accelerate the adoption of green, low carbon mobility.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; ✳️ &lt;a href="https://www.hazelnet.io/"&gt;Hazel&lt;/a&gt;: an app bringing the public to the carbon-removal market and fight climate change with NFTs and game mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🪸 &lt;a href="https://www.coraltribe.io/"&gt;Coral Tribe&lt;/a&gt;: a platform for impact investing, tokenising shares and decentralising crowdlending.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;a href="https://joinseeds.earth/"&gt;SEEDS&lt;/a&gt;: tools to help people, businesses and movement regenerate our planet and encourage collaboration, cooperation and community building.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🟩 &lt;a href="https://cyberbox.art/"&gt;Cyber Box&lt;/a&gt;: an NFT Marketplace that helps people and companies to be carbon neutral. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="using-web3-to-build-for-a-regenerative-future"&gt;Using Web3 to build for a regenerative future&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/samueldelesque?lang=en"&gt;Samuel Delesque&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/oasaliving"&gt;OASA&lt;/a&gt; joins &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drew-simon/?originalSubdomain=ca"&gt;Drew Simon&lt;/a&gt; in the latest &lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/about"&gt;Crypto Altruism podcast&lt;/a&gt; to discuss the use of Web3 tools like DAOs in community-driven conservation and regeneration projects, as well as the potential of regenerative finance for building a more sustainable and equitable world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode84-oasa-using-web3-to-build-for-a-regenerative-future"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-43.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1358" height="822" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-43.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-43.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-43.png 1358w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode84-oasa-using-web3-to-build-for-a-regenerative-future" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gRD3ec3PulE"&gt;Crushing rocks to reverse climate change&lt;/a&gt;! - ft &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PeterOlivier"&gt;Peter Olivier of Undocarbon&lt;/a&gt; - This Week In ReFi ep. 30&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ep. 34 Carbon: &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oii2FxNOzrs"&gt;The Missing Link to Unlocking Value from Nature w. Open Forest Protocol (OFP)&lt;/a&gt; - Wild User Interviews Podcast (Wuipod) ep. 30&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="upcoming-refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;Upcoming ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi renaissance wherever you are! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-is-coming-to-hong-kong"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.web3festival.org/hongkong2023/home?lang=en-US"&gt;ReFi is coming to Hong Kong!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;12-15th):&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;a href="https://news.bitcoin.com/80-crypto-firms-interested-in-establishing-presence-in-hong-kong-official-says/"&gt;Hong Kong opening it's doors to crypto&lt;/a&gt;, the inaugural Web3 Festival look set to make a big splash. This four-day event is expected to see over 10,000 attendees! Alongside &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/arkreen_network"&gt;Arkreen Network&lt;/a&gt;, ReFi DAO is helping to co-organise and support a ReFi side event. Grab your tickets now, or if you wish to speak at this event, please reach out to &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/montybryant"&gt;Monty&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.web3festival.org/hongkong2023/home?lang=en-US"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/ReFi.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/ReFi.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/ReFi.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/ReFi.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/ReFi.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.web3festival.org/hongkong2023/home?lang&amp;#x3D;zh-US" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get Tickets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="blockchain-climate-summit-refi-house"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.climatesummit.world/"&gt;Blockchain Climate Summit ReFi House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;27-29, Austin TX): &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.flowcarbon.com/"&gt;Flowcarbon&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt; will host another ReFi centric event at the Consensus 2023.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Are you going to Consensus 2023?🌱&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flowcarbon x &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@CeloOrg&lt;/a&gt; are having a multi day ReFi House bringing together our network for thought leadership convos, workshops &amp;amp; demos on net zero goals, ESG, sustainability &amp;amp; blockchain!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tap our website to learn more👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/NgSBN6z5yY"&gt;https://t.co/NgSBN6z5yY&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/hwsGenxWQZ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/hwsGenxWQZ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Flowcarbon (@weareflowcarbon) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/weareflowcarbon/status/1639272696700710921?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 24, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.climatesummit.world/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Apply to join&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="liberating-structures-learning-journey-masterclass"&gt;&lt;a href="https://forms.gle/4zrygoUnieB85xDo9"&gt;Liberating Structures Learning Journey Masterclass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 21st, Virtual): &lt;/strong&gt;Wise Crowds from Regen Unite is organizing a training event for event organizers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSctNXtR7D4SmRe3rfErWPYonOWyLNSv_FQTDrh3D9pqxtmDSA/viewform"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-46.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1434" height="630" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-46.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-46.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-46.png 1434w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://forms.gle/4zrygoUnieB85xDo9" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Apply here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-turn-tend-spring"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regensunite.earth/event/the-turn-tend-spring-2023"&gt;The Turn: Tend Spring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 22nd, Virtual):&lt;/strong&gt; A digital earth day celebration of small groups in many places, doing small acts of regeneration at the same time. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regensunite.earth/event/the-turn-tend-spring-2023"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-47.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1392" height="670" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-47.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-47.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-47.png 1392w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regensunite.earth/event/the-turn-tend-spring-2023" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Join here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="collaborative-finance"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gqcca.notion.site/Collaborative-Finance-fefaea11d64e4b3b8c709bb0b9cb1519"&gt;Collaborative Finance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;May 22nd -28th, Austria :&lt;/strong&gt;Calling all Monetary theorists, Fintech disruptor, DeFi activists, Trade exchanges, and fellow regens to brainstorm and find new ways to redesign a collaborative monetary system. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gqcca.notion.site/Collaborative-Finance-fefaea11d64e4b3b8c709bb0b9cb1519"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Collaborative_Finance_Twitter_-Twitter_Post-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1125" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Collaborative_Finance_Twitter_-Twitter_Post-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Collaborative_Finance_Twitter_-Twitter_Post-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Collaborative_Finance_Twitter_-Twitter_Post-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Collaborative_Finance_Twitter_-Twitter_Post-.png 2000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gqcca.notion.site/Collaborative-Finance-fefaea11d64e4b3b8c709bb0b9cb1519" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Find out more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="venturing-in-refi-by-aera-force"&gt;Venturing in ReFi by AERA FORCE&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Venturing in ReFi with the latest investment ReFi investment update. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Psst... they will be investing in 1 or 2 more ReFi ventures in the next months. If you're building in the intersection of Web3 &amp;amp; climate, reach out to Alex &lt;a href="alexfilotimo@gmail.com"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://web3climate.substack.com/p/y1-investing-complete-venturing-in"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-44.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1308" height="818" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/image-44.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/image-44.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/image-44.png 1308w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://web3climate.substack.com/p/y1-investing-complete-venturing-in" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the article here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks for joining us on the journey, dear brothers and sisters in ReFi. Drink plenty of water, get plenty of rest, and do something nice for yourself today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-- Scott &amp;amp; the ReFiDAO fam&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hello ReFi fam! &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/esther-val/"&gt;Esther&lt;/a&gt; here (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Carapilla"&gt;@carapilla.eth&lt;/a&gt;) with the latest ReFi Roundup! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I have an international background in public policy, CSR/sustainability and partnerships. Interviewing &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.remotefulness.com/leyline-and-kris-tucker/?_gl=1*1svsrd*_up*MQ..*_ga*MTU1ODk1Mjk5LjE2ODA0MzI4MDg.*_ga_VQRK261NEG*MTY4MDQzMjgwNy4xLjAuMTY4MDQzMjgwNy4wLjAuMA.."&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kris Tucker&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; in 2021 inspired me to explore Web3 and ReFi&lt;/em&gt;👩‍🏫&lt;em&gt;. I joined &lt;a href="https://www.climatecoin.io/"&gt;Climatecoin&lt;/a&gt; and then impact projects like &lt;a href="https://impactscope.com/"&gt;ImpactScope&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://crystalchain.io/en/"&gt;Crystalchain&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.zerolabs.green/"&gt;Zero Labs&lt;/a&gt;. I'm also a proud ambassador for ReFi trailblazer &lt;a href="https://www.ethichub.com/en/"&gt;EthicHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;☕️&lt;em&gt;! I'm a &lt;a href="https://www.bcorporation.net/en-us/"&gt;B-Corp movement&lt;/a&gt; leader and currently pursuing the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://capitalinstitute.org/course-introduction-regenerative-economics/"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regenerative Economics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; course by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/john-fullerton-a5abbb4/"&gt;&lt;em&gt;John Fullerton&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;💫&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This week we will be exploring some foundational ReFi values and what diversity &amp;amp; inclusivity mean for this space. Ready? Let's go!&lt;/em&gt;🤸🏼‍♀️ 🏄🏼&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/_S2RJjT_PYAAg_U9DcMalhqlQoWMC2h9jYKdOhYEKn4SHZKaUtSMQrPYrqJ0c4UEGjgiFvPafzskbQpWhj3ZSBX9-qGRp18ZIDjxRMCeB2-espjPZwe_VYY5FHE7N5w9HT2TCAkoxM4CbXAGkiUhH9M" class="kg-image" alt="Imagen" loading="lazy" width="602" height="803"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;All are welcome - ReFi spirit in Davos&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-needs-to-happen-for-refi-to-deliver-on-its-diversity-and-inclusivity-promise-%F0%9F%A4%B2%F0%9F%8F%BE"&gt;What needs to happen for ReFi to deliver on its diversity and inclusivity promise? 🤲🏾&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Web3 holds the promise of an economic and governance infrastructure that is more diverse, equitable, and collaborative.&lt;strong&gt; ReFi can bring positive environmental and social outcomes for all, namely the Global South!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-challenge-of-complexity-%F0%9F%8C%BF%E2%9A%96%EF%B8%8F"&gt;The challenge of complexity 🌿⚖️&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi seeks to tackle complex global coordination failures like climate change, biodiversity loss and social injustice. Multidisciplinarity, diversity and inclusion are key to addressing this complexity. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a movement, we must consider all stakeholders, including minorities and vulnerable groups, in uniting crypto, climate, and policy experts to address global challenges!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here are some insights on Complexity from  &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tre-cates-054270/"&gt;Tre' Crate&lt;/a&gt;'s course on Regenerative Economies 👇🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-13-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Untitled-design-13-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Untitled-design-13-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Untitled-design-13-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-13-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-14-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Untitled-design-14-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Untitled-design-14-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Untitled-design-14-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-14-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;But is everyone aware, and is progress fast and deep enough? As &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandnewvoices/"&gt;Corrales Cachola&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://brandnewvoices.xyz/"&gt;Brand New Voices&lt;/a&gt; suggests, we must empower the voiceless, avoid top-down monologues, break silos, and challenge neocolonial attitudes️️ ️.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this vein, Web3 recruiter &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7045373483421167616?updateEntityUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afs_feedUpdate%3A%28V2%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7045373483421167616%29"&gt;Owen Healy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/owenhealyblockchaintalent/"&gt; shares some striking insights&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;em&gt;“In my Web2 career, reasons for leaving revolved around pay and career progression. In Web3, it’s the &lt;strong&gt;manager/founder, &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;false promises, concerns not being addressed, burnout, lack of training etc. Short-termism, manipulation and amateurishness&lt;/strong&gt; is widespread across the industry. Some 'communities' simply haven't a clue about what's going on behind the scenes.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/dfhCsURDVQNCmkdUdhNwFjNs0iLleOa16VC04d8yicxu7nJJk8I0Uj0xjTvHX8FE3iTjufillTfoso1QaE09aaXYK15pSWovvt-0KLqD_hlPtAi1WelXHWmhK9Pt3_BDtgVvSUUeG1OK24IjmEXtRc4" class="kg-image" alt="Image preview" loading="lazy" width="600" height="383"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;From short-term wealth to long-term value&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;I came across this eye-opening quote during my &lt;a href="https://www.cisl.cam.ac.uk/"&gt;Cambridge Institute on Sustainability Leadership&lt;/a&gt; course. The real challenge in fighting climate change and social injustice is encapsulated here:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/S5h-a4fvmDmH9oX5If_Owp8EdFrJMHwcGUmaDrBnJCfhHp84Zjsna78vru1BqT237eGHYhd_zGpKBZ_CtNtEzyWZaZDTpubHiK2zacejbwXUCYwSUQbgtS8hotsl5avCKXg-QL9lTK_Shxc51cPIZqU" class="kg-image" alt="We scientists don't know how to do that. #Selfishness vs ..." loading="lazy" width="569" height="421"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is compelling food for thought to refocus on key ReFi values like individual regeneration, systems-thinking, interdependence and net positive impact for all. At &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/EthereumDenver"&gt;ETH Denver&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mariekeflament/"&gt;Marieke Flament&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://near.org/blog/what-the-near-foundation-does/"&gt;Near Foundation&lt;/a&gt;'s CEO, gave a talk focused on “&lt;a href="https://events.ethdenver.com/eden23/attendease/networking/experience/a84edf0e-62d2-42fe-aa83-bd4470f7b1c7/bfcb750d-1e35-4869-a7fc-1d1359c20fdd"&gt;The Three Pillars of Sustainability: Diversity, Environment and Ethics&lt;/a&gt;”. She  highlighted the need for individual integrity in simple words: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;would your granny be proud of you? &lt;/strong&gt;👵 ...&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h3 id="moving-from-what-gets-most-attention-to-what-is-most-important-%F0%9F%A7%90"&gt;Moving from what gets "most attention" to what is "most important" 🧐&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;As &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tre-cates-054270/"&gt;Tre' Cates&lt;/a&gt; underlines, "Regenerative Firms" need to focus on “what is most important” i.e. the culture and underlying values, to achieve regenerative purpose, behaviours and health.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-12-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Untitled-design-12-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Untitled-design-12-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Untitled-design-12-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-12-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tre’ Cates - The Capital Institute course on Regenerative Economies&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;In ReFi, this refers to the &lt;strong&gt;inclusion of marginalized communities.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aimaragarciaonline/"&gt;Aimara García Cabezas&lt;/a&gt;, a non-tech Cuban, embraced Web3's diversity and decentralization but faced limitations due to the US restrictions on Cuba. She emphasizes the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@nemerie0x/from-invisibility-to-innovation-women-and-minorities-in-web3-industry-e40f6c6f89bd"&gt;obstacles faced by marginalized groups in Web3&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and the importance of tackling &lt;strong&gt;underrepresentation for a flourishing ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/events/theconversationroadmaponlinkedi7036977090990145536/comments/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Check out her talk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/mFpVZtMkz2MqTXd_d9ERZUdLI_rmCSoZLFF-WxFxUx0oSj-1QxiRFyRGyCsVn-feaqqjvidkUI5cF51rVdAnYuJraKdiVbAabpv8xkgVYHv6W4K83Etj_l46JH_h3ZMlXpKCLfTQtaCP0D4qV1xMRjw" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="602" height="733"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://medium.com/@nemerie0x/from-invisibility-to-innovation-women-and-minorities-in-web3-industry-e40f6c6f89bd"&gt;Aimara García Cabezas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Increasing the presence of minorities in web3 is essential for various reasons:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/RQ1ImxpFxVZ4r0GZgAGqD49dNJjwLYZGGIgtdL6xbBI0pD7cwBn36N595cEFJ3ZXhpka2RvTMlQ__tLyJ0bRwDUToYx_uOjwYIjT2hLfkV3J6v467Vso1d720BciDSz41kz_WBgHQduJQ7Div8TZq2s" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="602" height="416"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The WEF echoes this perspective as we highlighted in &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-56/"&gt;Roundup#59 on Scalable Carbon Markets&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="back-to-basics-towards-real-regeneration-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Back to basics: towards real regeneration 🌱&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;As noted, diversity and inclusion are key enablers in overcoming degenerative and neocolonial mindsets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-11-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Untitled-design-11-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Untitled-design-11-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Untitled-design-11-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design-11-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;For example, the Vatican&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;⛪🇻🇦 recently &lt;a href="https://www.americamagazine.org/faith/2023/03/30/indigenous-vatican-catholic-church-discovery-doctrine-americas-244997"&gt;denounced the Doctrine of Discovery&lt;/a&gt;, promoting &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/hashtag/?keywords=reconciliation&amp;amp;highlightedUpdateUrns=urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7048290475039973376"&gt;reconciliation&lt;/a&gt; with indigenous people. With this spirit, Irish bishops committed to restoring 30% of church grounds in accordance with the UN Conference on Biodiversity on &lt;a href="https://www.unep.org/un-biodiversity-conference-cop-15"&gt;COP15&lt;/a&gt; ✝️.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="conclusion-united-in-diversity-%F0%9F%97%A3%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Conclusion: United in diversity 🗣️&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's create safe spaces for inclusive conversation, avoid old power structures, and collaboratively work on &lt;strong&gt;“what's most important” &lt;/strong&gt;towards regenerating the world!🙏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="ieta-summit-eu-climate-policy-carbon-credit-integrity-%F0%9F%93%9C"&gt;IETA Summit: EU Climate Policy &amp;amp; Carbon Credit Integrity 📜&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/IETA"&gt;IETA&lt;/a&gt;'s European Climate Summit discussed EU carbon markets &amp;amp; climate regulations. &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/icvcm/"&gt;The Integrity Council for the Voluntary Carbon Market (ICVCM)&lt;/a&gt; launched its Core Carbon Principles for identifying high-integrity carbon credits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;👋 from Lisbon where we spent last week at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/IETA?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@IETA&lt;/a&gt;&amp;#39;s European Climate Summit to discuss EU carbon markets &amp;amp; climate regulations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Highlights included seeing &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ic_vcm?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ic_vcm&lt;/a&gt; launch its Core Carbon Principles for identifying high-integrity carbon credits... and seeing so many frens! &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ECS2023?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ECS2023&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/TMSZjT8YIr"&gt;pic.twitter.com/TMSZjT8YIr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Climate Collective (@clim8collective) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective/status/1644088361999814656?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 6, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="ecosapiens-raises-a-whopping-35m%F0%9F%8E%89"&gt;Ecosapiens Raises a whopping $3.5M🎉 &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ecosapiensxyz?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"&gt;Ecosapiens&lt;/a&gt; raises $3.5M🎉 for their project offering nature-themed NFTs that enable users to buy carbon credits, offsetting the environmental impact of blockchain technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;1/ BIG NEWS! We&amp;#39;ve raised $5M in total funding after closing a $3.5M seed round led by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Collab_Currency?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Collab_Currency&lt;/a&gt;. Welcome &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gmoneyNFT?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gmoneyNFT&lt;/a&gt; as advisor! &amp;amp; thanks to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BoostVC?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@BoostVC&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BraytonKey?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@BraytonKey&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MenloVentures?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MenloVentures&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/slow?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@slow&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/alumniventures?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@alumniventures&lt;/a&gt; for returning!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FOR EVERY RT WE&amp;#39;LL PLANT A 🌲&lt;a href="https://t.co/dtNF02FhAX"&gt;https://t.co/dtNF02FhAX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Ecosapiens (@ecosapiensxyz) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ecosapiensxyz/status/1643301677439541265?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 4, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-local-node-prize-ama-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi DAO Local Node Prize AMA 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/a&gt; hosts another Local Node Prize AMA to answer all the questions regarding the emergence of &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/announcing-the-refi-dao-local-node-prize/"&gt;Local Nodes as building blocks of the upcoming network state&lt;/a&gt;! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Want to share your questions, doubts and comments about Local Nodes? Join the next AMA happening tomorrow, April 12th at 3 PM UTC on LinkedIn! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.linkedin.com/events/refidaolocalnodeprizeama7050108283180789762/about/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;ReFi DAO Local Node Prize AMA! | LinkedIn&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;As a part of our vision of realizing a global regenerative economy, we are happy to host an ‘ask me anything’ session with our core team to share more details about the ReFi DAO Local Node Prize! If you’re interested in turning your local startup city into an impact DAO with a vision of regeneration…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://static.licdn.com/sc/h/al2o9zrvru7aqj8e1x2rzsrca" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D4D1EAQHBEnBrGExGcw/event-background-image-crop_720_1280/0/1680876798262?e&amp;#x3D;2147483647&amp;amp;v&amp;#x3D;beta&amp;amp;t&amp;#x3D;NFPtm0PfcmOzYZS0lDA_4oNW6f1DrmRfANY0ogJJp0g" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="full-house-at-the-event-organisers-guild-training-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;Full-house at the Event Organisers' Guild training 🤝&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/micaela_31416"&gt;Micaela Ruiz&lt;/a&gt;, curator and co-director of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/eth_barcelona"&gt;ETHBarcelona&lt;/a&gt; in 2022 gave incredibly inspiring training to the members of the Event Organizers Guild on how to organize a meaningful event.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Such an incredible training at the Event Organizers Guild with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/micaela_31416?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@micaela_31416&lt;/a&gt; today! ❤️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our hearts are full! A huge thank you to all the inspiring event organizers who joined. ☀️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stay tuned for the upcoming trainings friends. 🌱 &lt;a href="https://t.co/Xnp4IaSdwX"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Xnp4IaSdwX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Spring 🤝 ReFi DAO (@RefiSpring) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring/status/1643295806064058385?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 4, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1643613775172345857?s&amp;#x3D;20" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Check the recording here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="gitcoin-beta-round-is-coming-soon-%F0%9F%97%93-%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Gitcoin Beta Round is coming soon! 🗓 ️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; announces the upcoming Gitcoin Program Beta Round, another great chance to fund and support your favorite ReFi projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;📆SAVE THE DATE📆&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&amp;#39;re thrilled to announce the upcoming Gitcoin Program Beta Round!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Make sure to mark your calendars and join us in Funding What Matters 🫡&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉 Stay tuned for more exciting details in the coming weeks! &lt;a href="https://t.co/nveeKgEtxL"&gt;pic.twitter.com/nveeKgEtxL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Gitcoin (🤖, 💚) (@gitcoin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin/status/1643964805731205120?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 6, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;🐣 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt; announced a new partnership with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/googlecloud"&gt;Google Cloud&lt;/a&gt; to help sustainability-focused startups on Celo build &amp;amp; scale Web3 applications.&lt;br&gt;🤟&lt;a href="https://www.dclimate.net/"&gt;dClimate &lt;/a&gt;and &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/allcot-io/"&gt;ALLCOT IO&lt;/a&gt;  joined the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective"&gt;@clim8collective&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;br&gt;🐣 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Good_DAO"&gt;GoodDAO&lt;/a&gt; is voting to increase the rate of G$ UBI issuance for distribution on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;🤟 Launch of &lt;a href="https://mobile.twitter.com/R3WILDco"&gt;R3WILD&lt;/a&gt;, a decentralized platform for rewilding and restoring biodiversity. &lt;br&gt;🐣 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mentholprotocol/with_replies"&gt;Menthol Protocol &lt;/a&gt;will launch on Earth Day, joining the &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/hashtag/?keywords=buildwithklima&amp;amp;highlightedUpdateUrns=urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7049114043894165505"&gt;#buildwithKLIMA&lt;/a&gt; ecosystem by integrating the KlimaDAO aggregator for carbon retirements on the &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/hashtag/?keywords=polygon&amp;amp;highlightedUpdateUrns=urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7049114043894165505"&gt;#Polygon&lt;/a&gt; network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-14.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-14.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-14.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-14.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-14.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;✳️ &lt;a href="https://greenarks.org/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Green Arks Foundation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Protecting the world's lands for future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌐 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cambiatus.com/"&gt;Cambiatus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: an open-source platform to empower the creation of new organizations (DAOs and collaborative businesses) through social currencies using blockchain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔋 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.powerledger.io/"&gt;Power Ledger&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Building the operating system for the new energy markets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🐘 &lt;a href="https://mobile.twitter.com/R3WILDco"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;R3WILD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Restoring the planet through community ownership, one block of land at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🍁 &lt;a href="https://www.ivyprotocol.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ivy Protocol&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Enabling anyone to fund pre-certified climate projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-project" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="creating-an-equitable-data-economy-to-value-ecosystem-services-with-david-dao-of-gainforest-the-ownership-economy-podcast"&gt;Creating an Equitable Data Economy to Value Ecosystem Services, with David Dao of GainForest | The Ownership Economy Podcast&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jahedmomand/"&gt;Jahed Momand&lt;/a&gt; sits down with &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dwddao/"&gt;David Dao&lt;/a&gt;, founder of GainForest and PhD candidate at ETH Zurich, to talk about valuing natural assets with the participation of land stewards. They discuss ecosystem services, their economic contribution, ownership regimes, and an equitable future if ecosystem services are included in global GDP while also touching on data governance and ownership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe style="border-radius: 12px" width="100%" height="152" title="Spotify Embed: The Ownership Economy" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/4iq2QLf1YDiF1OZhX8giIk?utm_source=oembed"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-summit-with-rex-st-john-the-block-explorer-podcast"&gt;ReFi Summit with Rex St. John | The Block Explorer Podcast&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rex St. John shares his perspective about the current status of Regenerative Finance, the upcoming ReFi Summit in Seattle this May, and the intersection of cultural changes and technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;what is the state of the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; nation? we asked &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/rexstjohn?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@rexstjohn&lt;/a&gt; who is a deep thinker when it comes to ecosystems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;you’re going to want to hear his answers. listen 🎧 to episode #74&lt;br&gt;now - it’s for &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regens&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/degens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#degens&lt;/a&gt; alike! &lt;a href="https://t.co/xn8RROKcJE"&gt;https://t.co/xn8RROKcJE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Block Explorer Impact Podcast (@Block_Explore) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Block_Explore/status/1644115744760774656?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 6, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refispring.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-tokyo"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refi-tokyo.refi-japan.net/"&gt;ReFi Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 14th, Tokyo, Japan) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi TOKYO aims to be an event where people from all walks of life can deepen their awareness of ReFi, share their know-how, and encourage its growth in Japan and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://refi-tokyo.refi-japan.net/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;ReFi TOKYO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Japan-based event to promote ”ReFi” - approach that seeks to solve long-term global environmental and social problems using blockchain technology-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://refi-tokyo.refi-japan.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/cropped-%E7%B9%A7%EF%BD%A2%E7%B9%A7%EF%BD%BB%E7%B9%9D%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A8-6@2x-270x270.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi TOKYO - Japan-based event to promote ”ReFi” - approach that seeks to solve long-term global environmental and social problems using blockchain technology-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://refi-tokyo.refi-japan.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/%E7%B9%A7%EF%BD%A2%E7%B9%A7%EF%BD%BB%E7%B9%9D%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A8-6@2x.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-summit-digitizing-for-a-sustainable-future%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.de/e/refi-summit-digitizing-for-a-sustainable-future-tickets-607549455777"&gt;ReFi Summit: Digitizing for a sustainable future&lt;/a&gt;🤝&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 12th, Munich, Germany)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first big event hosted by the &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/12778967/"&gt;ReFi Munich community&lt;/a&gt;. The event unites stakeholders across ESG, Regenerative Finance, and Web 3.0 to encourage collaboration for sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.de/e/refi-summit-digitizing-for-a-sustainable-future-tickets-607549455777"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-15.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-15.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-15.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="eth-barcelona-%E2%98%80%EF%B8%8F"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/eth_barcelona"&gt;ETH Barcelona ☀️ &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(July 5th-7th, Barcelona, Spain)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The biggest ETH event in Spain. With a focus on education, innovation, art, and creating positive social impact. Empowering communities with blockchain education and tools for societal impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Calling all creators and artists! 📡👨‍🎤👨‍🎨&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply now to share your creations with us at ETHBarcelona 2023 👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/6TkAXb3chi"&gt;https://t.co/6TkAXb3chi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ETHBarcelona ( :D , :D ) (@eth_barcelona) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/eth_barcelona/status/1642842378674511878?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 3, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-first-regens-unite-newsletter-is-out"&gt;The first Regens Unite newsletter is out&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Super excited to present &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regen Unite&lt;/a&gt;'s new platform to stay connected and updated on the Regen movement's mission to grow a human permaculture "glocal" community&lt;strong&gt;! 🎉&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We&amp;#39;ve launched our newsletter! Get the latest updates on Regens Unite and the wider regen community.💚&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This first edition includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✨ New website&lt;br&gt;📚 The handbook&lt;br&gt;💃 Upcoming events&lt;br&gt;📅 The Regen Calendar&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; alpha results&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read &amp;amp; subscribe here!👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/TapR5sgC8v"&gt;https://t.co/TapR5sgC8v&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regens Unite (@regensunite) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite/status/1643349329069985794?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 4, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there Regens &lt;/em&gt;🌏&lt;em&gt;! &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mayazdentzel/"&gt;Maya Dentzel&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mayazdentzel"&gt;@mayazdentzel&lt;/a&gt;) here with a weekly ReFi Roundup. As a PhD researcher at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ucsb.edu"&gt;&lt;em&gt;UC Santa Barbara&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, I study the Web3 &amp;amp; climate ecosystem in the global political and ideological context and believe that social justice and moral commitments go before technological innovation. Besides academia, I am stoked on cross-institutional collaboration (we can't build a movement in the bubble of web3 alone!) and am honoured to serve on &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/press/2022/09/new-crypto-sustainability-coalition-to-investigate-potential-of-web3-technologies-in-fighting-climate-change/"&gt;WEF Crypto Sustainability Coalition&lt;/a&gt;'s working group on Web3 and climate action. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This edition focuses on the big picture of ReFi as a form of resistance in the realities of  finance capitalism. You can also find the latest news and updates in the ReFi world🌿. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Let's jump in! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/capitalism_isnt_working_credit_chris_isonpa.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="768" height="512" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/capitalism_isnt_working_credit_chris_isonpa.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/capitalism_isnt_working_credit_chris_isonpa.jpg 768w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ucl.ac.uk/bartlett/public-purpose/study/rethinking-capitalism"&gt;UCL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="recognizing-the-crisis-%F0%9F%93%89"&gt;Recognizing the crisis 📉&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's address the elephant in the room  –  financial capitalism screwed us over. The system based on constant expansion and extraction of every aspect of life is not working. The crisis nature of financial capitalism is evidenced by a common occurrence of bank collapses (check out &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-57/"&gt;last week's roundup&lt;/a&gt; on Banking Crisis &amp;amp; Economic Diversity). &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/2027.jpg.webp" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="465" height="279"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fbusiness%2F2023%2Fmar%2F15%2Fsvb-collapse-slow-rolling-crisis-blackrock-boss-larry-fink&amp;amp;psig=AOvVaw26pNpjLMSj5aBtT9rrhO_-&amp;amp;ust=1680394798233000&amp;amp;source=images&amp;amp;cd=vfe&amp;amp;ved=0CBAQjhxqFwoTCIiKk8u0h_4CFQAAAAAdAAAAABAD"&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a classic example of what &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Black_Swan:_The_Impact_of_the_Highly_Improbable"&gt;Nassim Taleb&lt;/a&gt; called  &lt;strong&gt;"Privatization of profits (high risk investment) and socialization of losses (bailout by taxpayer funds)"&lt;/strong&gt;. It negatively impacts communities, causing social issues, mental health problems, and environmental concerns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-is-financial-capitalism%F0%9F%A4%94"&gt;What is Financial Capitalism?🤔&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Financial capitalism is the reflection of the dominance of financial markets and complex financial instruments. &lt;a href="https://www.sps.ed.ac.uk/staff/donald-mackenzie"&gt;Donald Mackenzie&lt;/a&gt; shows that before the 1990s, finance was once considered marginal in economic theory. But now it is indispensable in an economic system. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Financial capitalism is best described as &lt;strong&gt;deregulation, accumulation by disposession, privatization and financialization. &lt;/strong&gt;In this system, anything not leading to profit maximization, like a clean environment or care work, is seen as an externality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bank collapses, extreme wealth inequlity, extractivism are NOT inevitable. Say it with me: &lt;strong&gt;We don't need to accept crises as normal. We can create a better system through commons.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="digital-commons-to-the-rescue%F0%9F%9B%9F"&gt;Digital commons to the rescue🛟&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s42438-021-00218-8"&gt;Bauwens and Jandríc&lt;/a&gt; define commons as: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;em&gt;“&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a shared resource that is produced, maintained, and protected by a community or a group of stakeholders, using their own norms and regulations”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blockchain's digital public infrastructure (DPI) can support commons-based peer production (CBPP) as a digital resistance. For example, as ReFi is converting capital into commons, it enables programmable value and promotes '&lt;a href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s42438-021-00218-8"&gt;generative markets&lt;/a&gt;' over extractive ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1416" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/image.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://wiki.p2pfoundation.net/Main_Page#/media/File:20220914_Bauwens_lecture.jpg"&gt;p2p foundation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://wiki.p2pfoundation.net/Main_Page#/media/File:20220914_Bauwens_lecture.jpg" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="but-be-aware-of-techno-solutionism-%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F"&gt;But be aware of techno-solutionism ⚠️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;However, we can't rely on Web3 alone. A belief that any problem, regardless of complexity, can be addressed by introducing a new tech tool is at the core of 'solutionism', the concept described by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/evgenymorozov?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"&gt;Evgeny Morozov&lt;/a&gt; in his book "&lt;a href="https://www.publicaffairsbooks.com/titles/evgeny-morozov/to-save-everything-click-here/9781610393706/"&gt;To save everything, save here&lt;/a&gt;" (who also has an academic newsletter on blockchain: &lt;a href="https://the-crypto-syllabus.com"&gt;The Crypto Syllabus&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He emphasizes the need for tech solutions to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"&lt;a href="https://www.publicaffairsbooks.com/titles/evgeny-morozov/to-save-everything-click-here/9781610393706/"&gt;engage users as citizens - rather than customers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; and prioritize self-conscious design with moral and political philosophy"&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="600" height="900" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-1.png 600w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Soure: &lt;a href="https://www.publicaffairsbooks.com/titles/evgeny-morozov/to-save-everything-click-here/9781610393706/"&gt;public affairs books&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="values-before-tech-%F0%9F%92%9A"&gt;Values before tech 💚&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The open-source software movement resisted the Internet's commercialization, challenging traditional capitalist production and intellectual property models, driven by a belief in a shared future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For this future, &lt;a href="https://read.dukeupress.edu/south-atlantic-quarterly/article-abstract/121/3/628/300930/Cooperativism-as-Contestation-to-Crypto?redirectedFrom=fulltext"&gt;Crandall and Vázquez&lt;/a&gt;  advocate for proper design principles:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“technology should be the tool that follows values, not the value-proposition in and of itself"&lt;/strong&gt;  &lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hope is that, when driven by the right values, blockchain infrastructure can help build coalitions of digital solidarity that collectively can pressure power relocation from private financial institutions to the public or commons domain. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-2.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="750" height="499" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-2.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-2.png 750w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="change-the-system-%F0%9F%94%84"&gt;Change the system 🔄&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As regens, we must continually remind and check ourselves to make sure we are adhering to some of ReFi's core esposued values: climate justice, community empowerment, power distribution, to name a few. &lt;strong&gt;To do this requires social realization before technological implementation. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission in ReFi is to avoid becoming financial capitalism, prevent Web3 from fostering wealth concentration, and prioritize regeneration through strong democratic institutions and digital commons 📣. 📣. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Explore the ReFi Ecosystem&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-update-global-network-state-pioneering-regenerative-economics-culture-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;ReFi DAO Update | Global Network State: Pioneering Regenerative Economics &amp;amp; Culture 🌍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/O0wnqoe0fkU?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="ReFi DAO Update | Global Network State: Pioneering Regenerative Economics &amp;amp; Culture 🌍"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Setting up a new embassy in Lisbon as the first ReFi DAO local Node, a key step in journey to create a Global Network State rooted in key startup cities worldwide..&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;👀&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coming soon: ReFi DAO Debates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Are you excited by the potential of Network States to create new structures for dealing with the challenges of our time? Or on the flip side, do you have concerns or see them as a regression? We want to hear from you! Please reach out to &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/montybryant"&gt;Monty&lt;/a&gt; to participate in an upcoming debate...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="australian-draft-bill-aims-to-create-nature-repair-market-%F0%9F%87%A6%F0%9F%87%BA"&gt;Australian draft bill aims to create 'Nature Repair Market' 🇦🇺 &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Australian government released a draft bill to establish a (world-first!) &lt;a href="https://www.dcceew.gov.au/environment/environmental-markets/biodiversity-market"&gt;nature repair market&lt;/a&gt; to achieve nature positive outcomes. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If passed, a nature repair market could attract funds for biodiversity. The nature repair market is a paradigm shift from the ‘compensation’ model of biodiversity markets in Australia. This would be a huge win for conservation! 🌿 🦘&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Landcare Australia welcomes the Nature Repair Market bill, which has been introduced by the Hon. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tanya_plibersek?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@tanya_plibersek&lt;/a&gt;, Minister for the Environment &amp;amp; Water. As this process evolves, we will support the opportunities to actively restore &amp;amp; protect Australia’s natural environment. &lt;a href="https://t.co/yj9WeZiv80"&gt;pic.twitter.com/yj9WeZiv80&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Landcare Australia (@LandcareAust) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/LandcareAust/status/1640951418172637184?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://carbon-pulse.com/197395/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Learn more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-terminology-101-%F0%9F%93%96"&gt;ReFi terminology 101 📖&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol"&gt;Toucan&lt;/a&gt; created a comprehensive guide of ReFi definitions that traces back the ideas studied by economists since 1916😱. It provides a useful visualization of conventional (i.e. extractive) vs regenerative systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Looking to understand the concept of Regenerative Finance (or &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;)?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&amp;#39;ve got something for you! Take a peek at &lt;a href="https://t.co/MFqB4wCfhg"&gt;https://t.co/MFqB4wCfhg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Toucan (@ToucanProtocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol/status/1641062902198140928?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.toucan.earth/what-is-refi-regenerative-finance/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the full blog post &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-weave-issue-on-regenerative-economy-%F0%9F%A7%A0"&gt;The Weave Issue on Regenerative Economy 🧠&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.theweavemagazine.earth"&gt;The Weave Magazine&lt;/a&gt; came out with a special issue on regeneration. It includes a discussion with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ceisenstein"&gt;Charles Eisenstein&lt;/a&gt; (the author of &lt;a href="https://charleseisenstein.org/books/sacred-economics/"&gt;Sacred Economics&lt;/a&gt; 📚) on human regeneration as a prerequisite to planetary regeneration and the idea of &lt;em&gt;Inner Economy. &lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-30-at-8.59.22-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1348" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-30-at-8.59.22-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-30-at-8.59.22-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-30-at-8.59.22-PM.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-30-at-8.59.22-PM.png 2026w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;The Weave&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://issuu.com/theweavemagazine/docs/tw_03_final?fr&amp;#x3D;sMjI5MTUzNzYwNjc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the magazine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="regenerative-business-tool-%F0%9F%8D%A9"&gt;Regenerative Business Tool 🍩 &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/DoughnutEcon"&gt;Doughnut Economics Action Lab&lt;/a&gt; launched a regenerative business tool for regulators and anyone who shapes public policy. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;How can policy-makers foster businesses based on the concepts of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/DoughnutEconomics?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#DoughnutEconomics&lt;/a&gt;?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today we’re launching “Regenerative business rising: How policy can create an economy led by a different kind of company” a tool which can be found here: &lt;a href="https://t.co/LO8zSRqeCj"&gt;https://t.co/LO8zSRqeCj&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(1/5) &lt;a href="https://t.co/gCdwn071L9"&gt;pic.twitter.com/gCdwn071L9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Doughnut Economics Action Lab (DEAL) (@DoughnutEcon) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/DoughnutEcon/status/1640678970738761732?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://doughnuteconomics.org/tools/207" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the framework here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="regen-network-grantee-report-is-out-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Regen Network Grantee Report is out 🌱&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regen.network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt;’s Community Fund Program was started to incubate and activate ideas and projects to regenerate Earth’s ecosystems. Check out their achievements and impact below👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;It’s here 🎉&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The 2022 Grantee Report from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RegenNetworkDev?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@RegenNetworkDev&lt;/a&gt; celebrates the dedicated &amp;amp; diverse work of 45 grantees/projects. Creating methodologies &amp;amp; developing &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ecoassets?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ecoassets&lt;/a&gt;, these grantees embody ecological &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regeneration?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regeneration&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;See their exceptional work👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/0b7g5rVWq5"&gt;https://t.co/0b7g5rVWq5&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/m7WRqK0aKB"&gt;pic.twitter.com/m7WRqK0aKB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regen Network (@regen_network) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network/status/1640730488343089152?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://regen-registry.s3.amazonaws.com/External+EOY+Grants+Report.pdf" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Full report&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="celo-europe-dao-proposal-%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%BA"&gt;Celo Europe DAO proposal 🇪🇺&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://forum.celo.org/"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt; has launched a Europe DAO proposal to help increase Celo’s footprint in the continent. The first season plan for Celo Europe consists of:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Testing different models to help Celo reach out to more web3 builders interested in working on the future of ReFi&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Establishing the baseline for DAO governance of the Celo Europe DAO&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactMarket_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@impactMarket_&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/EthicHub?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ethichub&lt;/a&gt;, &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TalentProtocol?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@TalentProtocol&lt;/a&gt; launched a proposal at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@CeloOrg&lt;/a&gt; forum to create the Celo Europe DAO, aiming to increase Celo&amp;#39;s footprint in Europe while empowering web3 builders and ReFi initiatives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read the proposal, comment, and support at &lt;a href="https://t.co/YyQCwSUfPJ"&gt;https://t.co/YyQCwSUfPJ&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/dDnS8jE3On"&gt;pic.twitter.com/dDnS8jE3On&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; impactMarket • $PACT (@impactMarket_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactMarket_/status/1641121438512955409?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://forum.celo.org/t/celo-europe-dao/5443" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the proposal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="hyphen-joins-climate-collective-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;Hyphen joins Climate Collective 🌍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/a&gt; is a leading coalition of stakeholders with the goal to unlock verifiable climate solutions at scale. This week the coalition was joined by &lt;a href="https://www.hyphen.earth/"&gt;Hyphen&lt;/a&gt; who is helping boost confidence in carbon market and achieve net-zero targets by building new digital tools to close the data gap. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We’re excited to see the new partnership opportunities unlocked by welcoming &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HYPHEN_AG?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@HYPHEN_AG&lt;/a&gt; to the Climate Collective, and look forward to collaborating with them to achieve a sustainable future. Welcome, friends 🌱 &lt;a href="https://t.co/2gjOWlHRHA"&gt;pic.twitter.com/2gjOWlHRHA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Climate Collective (@clim8collective) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective/status/1641466986658930689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 30, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=refi-dao"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-7.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-7.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-7.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-7.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-7.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;🏞 &lt;a href="https://www.betterverse.app/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bettervers&lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;/a&gt;: Building the world's charity aggregator on Web3 🌱 Donate, collect NFTs, track your donation, share with your friends and followers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✳️ &lt;a href="https://forumlumiar.my.canva.site/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fórum Popular de Cultura de Lumiar e Biorregião&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: a public interest collective integrating local culture, movements, and talent from the bioregion of Lumiar, São Pedro da Serra.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🚜 &lt;a href="https://www.sitealgae.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Impact Token&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: a blockchain enabled investment platform for sustainable algae protein projects around the world.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱&lt;strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/de_plan"&gt;de_plan proto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: tools to enable Web3 for planners, developers, regens, and environmentalists.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🟩 &lt;a href="https://co2bit.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co2Bit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Co2Bit has agreements with Sovereign Nation States and NGOs to use Co2Bitcoins (Co2B) to help finance environmental/humanitarian projects. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-podcast-teaser-refi-dao-update-keys-to-regeneration-with-rene-from-celo-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F-%F0%9F%93%A3"&gt;ReFi Podcast Teaser &amp;amp; ReFi DAO Update: Keys to Regeneration with Rene from Celo 🎙️ 📣&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/USIsnw19cuE?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Keys to Regeneration with Rene from Celo | ReFi Podcast Teaser &amp;amp; ReFi DAO Update 🎙️ 📣"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;jE&lt;/a&gt; sits down with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RegenRene"&gt;Rene&lt;/a&gt;, the CEO and founder of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt;. They discuss the current state of ReFi following the collapse of Silicon Valley Bank and its impact on the industry. Delve into Celo's origin story and explore the key interventions needed to ensure a bright future for ReFi, focusing on unlocking scalable growth and solving real-world problems. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;FULL BONUS EPISODE NOW LIVE on all major podcast platforms! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event&amp;#x3D;video_description&amp;amp;redir_token&amp;#x3D;QUFFLUhqbFlzVEFGLW1KcTRJR19qWnlGOWlWWllkLVBFd3xBQ3Jtc0ttYmRRQmttWWhQN0lOcEpkYXlOZTZYOXd4QWVLdERvVkFjT1BxbnNNV1lTdFRmbG9yTE1mMHBuWVlTRnZtOFh2M2NQdi02Yk1CVVpCNUQ4Qjk1cnRTeTJ5ZlFKZFRnbEpWRl80R2Y4aUExUGdzSUR6WQ&amp;amp;q&amp;#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fspotifyanchor-web.app.link%2Fe%2FVQggHtkYGyb&amp;amp;v&amp;#x3D;USIsnw19cuE" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen now!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="from-open-access-to-carbon-pollution-to-common-pool-resource-%F0%9F%92%A8-building-carbon-financial-infrastructure-with-toucan"&gt;From open access to carbon pollution, to common pool resource 💨: Building carbon financial infrastructure with Toucan &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ownereconomy"&gt;The Ownership Economy&lt;/a&gt; brought on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol"&gt;Toucan Protocol&lt;/a&gt; CEO and Founder &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/raphabenoi"&gt;Raphaël&lt;/a&gt; to chat about carbon finance, market dynamics, transparency, and the coordination infrastructure necessary to scale climate finance in this decade.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/3Tpp0oaFma78sp9wes8jK5"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.57.55-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="503" height="503"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/3Tpp0oaFma78sp9wes8jK5" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="education-as-a-catalyzer-of-mass-adoption-with-camila-ramos-%F0%9F%93%9A"&gt;Education as a catalyzer of mass adoption with Camila Ramos 📚&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;On episode 3 of &lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/17BecrtuFAQgQnFF8NPA1e"&gt;Last Mile DeFi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/marcusdotam"&gt;Marcus&lt;/a&gt; chats with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/camiinthisthang"&gt;Camila Ramos&lt;/a&gt; (writer and Web3 developer) about equal access to education and the opportunity for crypto to provide enhanced financial infrastructure and drive more prosperity for Latin Americans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/03-education-as-a-catalyzer-of-mass-adoption/id1677804336?i=1000606296919"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/FOV-rTWh2rMGLn06jwKWY.png.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1000" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/FOV-rTWh2rMGLn06jwKWY.png.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/FOV-rTWh2rMGLn06jwKWY.png.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/FOV-rTWh2rMGLn06jwKWY.png.jpeg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/FOV-rTWh2rMGLn06jwKWY.png.jpeg 2366w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/03-education-as-a-catalyzer-of-mass-adoption/id1677804336?i&amp;#x3D;1000606296919" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 podcasts on our radar:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/greenpill/id1609313639?i=1000606603169"&gt;Building a Coordi-nation&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/yaoeo"&gt;Primavera De Filippi&lt;/a&gt; - Green Pill Podcast ep. 101&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-block-explorer/id1583494136?i=1000604411007"&gt;Carbon Markets &amp;amp; Thallo with Hayley Moller&lt;/a&gt; - The Block Explorer ep. 73&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="upcoming-refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;Upcoming ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi renaissance wherever you are! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5861545351973026866-y.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="389" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5861545351973026866-y.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5861545351973026866-y.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5861545351973026866-y.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="rebuild-global-summit-2023"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.tickettailor.com/events/rebuild/843286"&gt;Re:build global summit 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 14th - 16th, Online): &lt;/strong&gt;tune in to the next re:build global online summit, uniting passionate re:builders worldwide in designing sustainable and resilient communities. With 70 Speakers including &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;John Ellisson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/samueldelesque"&gt;Samuel Delesque&lt;/a&gt;, and many other awesome Regens. &lt;a href="https://www.tickettailor.com/events/rebuild/843286"&gt;Grab tickets now&lt;/a&gt; and use discount code &lt;em&gt;REFIDAO23&lt;/em&gt; for a special discount! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/re-build-global---re-build-events---online-2023-1.png" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/re-build-global---re-build-events---online-2023-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/re-build-global---re-build-events---online-2023-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/re-build-global---re-build-events---online-2023-1.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/20-1.png" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/20-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/20-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/20-1.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/19-1.png" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/19-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/19-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/19-1.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.tickettailor.com/events/rebuild/843286" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Save your seat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="web3-splash-poolside-hub-opening"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/poolsidehub-refi-day-evening"&gt;Web3 Splash: Poolside Hub Opening&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 11 in Lisbon, Portugal🇵🇹):&lt;/strong&gt; an event co-oragnized by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactMarket_"&gt;Impact Market&lt;/a&gt;  and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideHub"&gt;Poolside Hub&lt;/a&gt; aims to give attendees an immersive tour through the story of regeneration as we redesign our systems of value to finally take care of people and the planet 🌍.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We are testing our theory of change at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt; in one of the most exciting startup communities in the world: &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Lisbon?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Lisbon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&amp;#39;re a sustainability pro, web3 advocate—or just someone who cares about the planet—come join us.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;April 11th is the world&amp;#39;s &lt;a href="https://t.co/amiAZBH8fd"&gt;https://t.co/amiAZBH8fd&lt;/a&gt;…&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; jE ❤️ Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1641481986828120085?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 30, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/poolsidehub-refi-day-evening" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="sustainable-blockchain-summit"&gt;&lt;a href="https://sbs.tech"&gt;Sustainable Blockchain Summit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 13th in Boston, MA🇺🇸):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/filecoingreen"&gt;Filecoin Green&lt;/a&gt; is organizing the Sustainable Blockchain Summit that brings together experts and enthusiasts in ReFi, Energy Systems, Carbon Markets, and Cryptoeconomics for discussions and networking. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The Sustainable Blockchain Summit is headed to Boston on April 13, 2023. 👏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thanks to our supporters &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/UNFCCC?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@UNFCCC&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mitecclub?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@mitecclub&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; sponsors &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HBAR_foundation?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@HBAR_foundation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ToucanProtocol&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HYPHEN_AG?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@HYPHEN_AG&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@clim8collective&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/blockdotgreen?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@blockdotgreen&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TheBostonDAO?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@TheBostonDAO&lt;/a&gt; for helping us bring this event to life. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/SBSBoston?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#SBSBoston&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/sFWBrPYodq"&gt;pic.twitter.com/sFWBrPYodq&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; filecoingreen (@filecoingreen) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/filecoingreen/status/1641099232533684228?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/sustainable-blockchain-summit-boston-tickets-502882624467?aff&amp;#x3D;sbstech" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get tickets here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="heart-masters-in-ibiza"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regeneratex.co/ibiza"&gt;Heart Masters in Ibiza&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 27-June 1st in Ibiza, Spain🇪🇸):&lt;/strong&gt; If you're feeling like going on a journey, check out Heart Masters event focused on regenerating systems of peace as whole human leadership and healing❤️‍🩹.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Our Heart Masters Ibiza journey is just around the corner! We&amp;#39;re thrilled to be gathering with our community in one of the most beautiful places on earth, embarking on a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regenerative?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regenerative&lt;/a&gt; journey of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/selfrediscovery?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#selfrediscovery&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/mindfulness?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#mindfulness&lt;/a&gt; of the environment, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/healing?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#healing&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;... &lt;a href="https://t.co/DoTFcam6Oq"&gt;pic.twitter.com/DoTFcam6Oq&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regenerate X (@RX_DHO) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RX_DHO/status/1641470922434437123?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 30, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gqcca.notion.site/Collaborative-Finance-fefaea11d64e4b3b8c709bb0b9cb1519" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Learn more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfind-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-ventureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="multiple-refi-jobs-at-flow-carbon"&gt;Multiple ReFi jobs at &lt;a href="https://www.flowcarbon.com/"&gt;Flow Carbon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.flowcarbon.com/jobs"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.35.16-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1176" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.35.16-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.35.16-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.35.16-PM.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-31-at-3.35.16-PM.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.flowcarbon.com/jobs" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;View positions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the ReFi Jobs platform for more! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2022/10/ReFiJobs.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;https://refijobs.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dmrv-function-importance-and-role-in-scaling-and-ensuring-accountability-in-vcm"&gt;dMRV: function, importance, and role in scaling and ensuring accountability in VCM&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;dMRV aka digital measurement, reporting, and verification tools have been on up and up. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The latest post by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dClimateDAO"&gt;dClimate&lt;/a&gt; demonstrates the limitations of traditional MRV methodologies and shows how digital MRV has the potential to be a more efficient, effective, and comprehensive approach to monitoring and evaluating climate change mitigation efforts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.dclimate.net/dmrv-what-is-it-how-it-works-and-why-it-is-essential-for-bringing-scale-and-accountability-to-the-vcm/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/dClimate-dMRV-tools-ecosystem-carbon-credits-01.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="675" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/dClimate-dMRV-tools-ecosystem-carbon-credits-01.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/dClimate-dMRV-tools-ecosystem-carbon-credits-01.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/dClimate-dMRV-tools-ecosystem-carbon-credits-01.jpg 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.dclimate.net/dmrv-what-is-it-how-it-works-and-why-it-is-essential-for-bringing-scale-and-accountability-to-the-vcm/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-to-look-out-for%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;What to look out for...👀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;⚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;As part of our working group on web3 and climate at WEF, we conducted in-depth interviews with ReFi leaders and wrote a whitepaper about using blockchain to scale climate action. The release date is late April (right around the Earth Day🌎) so stay tuned ;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hello! &lt;a href="flow.page/suanex"&gt;Susana González&lt;/a&gt; here with the latest ReFi Roundup. I am a ReFi advocate, head of Latam Partnerships for &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://impactscope.com"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ImpactScope&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; and honoured to bring you this week's news in ReFi and beyond. One important thing I'd like to share about myself is that I am Venezuelan, I like arepas and I have traditions and habits that tie me to a region. I am from the Global South and I want to share the concepts and ideas that differentiate what we have from the rest of the world. 🫓&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Let's go! &lt;/em&gt;🤸&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design--15--1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Untitled-design--15--1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Untitled-design--15--1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Untitled-design--15--1.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="refi-in-the-global-south-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;ReFi in the Global South 🌍&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;What concepts, ideas, and projects do we need to understand to disrupt our global mindset?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-global-south-and-web3-adoption-%F0%9F%92%BB"&gt;The Global South and Web3 adoption 💻&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The term Global South refers to socioeconomically disadvantaged countries, often in the South but excluding wealthier nations like Australia and New Zealand. Many were former colonies, now economically indebted to the Global North. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Web3 has come to &lt;a href="https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-what-s-happening-in-web3-across-africa"&gt;Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://new-narrative.com/2022/11/23/what-will-web3-bring-to-southeast-asia"&gt;Asia, &lt;/a&gt;and &lt;a href="https://cryptonews.com/exclusives/blockchain-technology-future-of-latin-americas-financial-system.htm"&gt;Latin America&lt;/a&gt; as an option to overcome complex bureaucracy, poverty, and low banking access. Regardless of a huge necessity, it is still in its early stages, and its adoption varies widely across regions and countries. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/szSKALIJ-deccover.webp" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/szSKALIJ-deccover.webp 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/szSKALIJ-deccover.webp 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/szSKALIJ-deccover.webp 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;The virtual world of Decentraland&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="levelling-the-playing-field-enabling-global-south-regeneration-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Levelling the playing field &amp;amp; enabling Global South regeneration 🌱&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To empower all classes and overcome outdated institutions, we need for Web3 to be more intuitive and genuine. &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dantedisparte/"&gt;Dante Disparte&lt;/a&gt;'s &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/agenda/2022/05/what-is-web3-why-care-future/"&gt;Davos 2022 article&lt;/a&gt; discusses how achieving the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) can restore economic balance and justice. Achieving these goals is crucial, and Web3 technologies can aid in reducing and eliminating poverty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What solutions does ReFi bring to address the issues in the Global South?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Refi-as-a-solution.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Refi-as-a-solution.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Refi-as-a-solution.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Refi-as-a-solution.png 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="stability-and-cost-%F0%9F%92%B5"&gt;Stability and cost 💵&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the Global South seeks stable options amid unreliable currencies, Web3 has gained traction in combating inflation in countries like Argentina, Venezuela, Afghanistan, and Nigeria. For example, &lt;a href="https://www.circle.com/en/customer-stories/gluwa-capital"&gt;Gluwa Capital&lt;/a&gt; leverages USD Coin (USDC) to bridge fintech lenders in emerging markets with investors, fostering financial inclusion, global prosperity, and simplified transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/mapped-worlds-highest-inflation-rates.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="1550" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/mapped-worlds-highest-inflation-rates.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/mapped-worlds-highest-inflation-rates.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/mapped-worlds-highest-inflation-rates.jpeg 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Elements Infographic: 2022 Inflation Rates in the World&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="local-empowerment-%F0%9F%9B%96"&gt;Local empowerment 🛖&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;By addressing critical needs and fostering self-sufficiency, numerous initiatives strive to empower local economies in various ways. For example, &lt;a href="https://giveth.io/project/njombe-innovation-academy-panvala-league"&gt;Njombe Innovation Academy&lt;/a&gt; aims to regenerate local economies, promote independence, and foster education, regenerative agriculture, and entrepreneurship. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KOEXSSZT3sI?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Realizing Visions - Social Innovation Academy (SINA),  a talent campus in Uganda"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;In ReFi, projects such as &lt;a href="https://www.web3beach.io"&gt;Web3Beach&lt;/a&gt; in Honduras, work to restore the social fabric through advocacy events, while &lt;a href="https://takataka.impactscope.com"&gt;Takataka Plastics&lt;/a&gt; in Uganda uses Dynamic proof NFTs to manage plastic waste efficiently. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Other projects like &lt;a href="https://pezesha.com"&gt;Pezesha&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.ethichub.com/es/"&gt;EthicHub&lt;/a&gt; support small businesses and farmers by connecting them with investors, and enhancing financial enablement in the Global South.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="language-barriers-%F0%9F%AA%A7"&gt;Language barriers 🪧&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Language barriers in the Web3 landscape limit the reach and implementation of content in non-English speaking countries, particularly in the Global South. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To address this issue, networks like &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regenlatam"&gt;Regen Latam&lt;/a&gt; host Twitter spaces in Spanish. The latest one included &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/marcusdotam"&gt;Marcus&lt;/a&gt; of the &lt;a href="https://fellowship.ethereum.foundation/"&gt;Ethereum Fellowship Program&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HumbertoBesso"&gt;Humberto&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xUrbanika"&gt;Urbánika&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Gallardo_Luchi"&gt;Lucia Gallardo&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/emergetechlab"&gt;Emerge&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/theaeternals"&gt;The Aeternals&lt;/a&gt; who shared their insights and discussed various challenges that can be solved with the help of ReFi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ImpactScope/status/1646574089316827146?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-19.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1154" height="676" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-19.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-19.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-19.png 1154w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Onboarding in multiple languages, as &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tuculturactg"&gt;Tucultura&lt;/a&gt; does, is crucial not only in Latin America but globally. Including content in indigenous and native languages is essential for broader accessibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="empowering-voices-for-inclusion-%F0%9F%94%88"&gt;Empowering Voices for Inclusion 🔈&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Education is vital for introducing Web3 to the Global South, which requires inclusion, diversity, and open dialogue. The ReFi movement aims to create safe spaces for sharing, allowing individuals to lead and amplify their voices. It is essential to recognize the Global South's unique challenges and leverage its people to build the foundations of independence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/local" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Explore the ReFi local communities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-hong-kong-launch-%F0%9F%8E%89"&gt;ReFi Hong Kong Launch &lt;strong&gt;🎉&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hong Kong is long known as Asia's financial capital. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin"&gt;Monty Bryant&lt;/a&gt; from the ReFi DAO team has flown all the way there to help launch &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiHongKong"&gt;ReFi Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This bustling hub attracts entrepreneurs, investors, and builders from across the Far East and it has great potential of becoming the ReFi capital of the region. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Incredibly exciting news here and we can't wait to see what's coming next! 👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="art" dir="ltr"&gt;🎉🎉🎉 &lt;a href="https://t.co/NDhR7ncFry"&gt;https://t.co/NDhR7ncFry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Hong Kong (@ReFiHongKong) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiHongKong/status/1647138522489556992?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 15, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="climate-collectives-1-year-anniversary-%F0%9F%8E%82"&gt;Climate Collective's 1-year Anniversary 🎂&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective"&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/a&gt; shares an update on its first year of operations and a proposal for follow-on funding focused on key pain points and opportunities identified in the current state of the web3 x climate sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We wanted to express incredible gratitude towards Climate Collective for all the generous support that made &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast"&gt;ReFi Podcast&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring"&gt;ReFi Spring&lt;/a&gt; a reality! Thank you and congratulations on the amazing job you are doing for the ecosystem. ❤️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Excited to see &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@clim8collective&lt;/a&gt; outline a strong plan for fostering the growing web3 climate ecosystem! &lt;a href="https://t.co/Ac5HGIdtBH"&gt;https://t.co/Ac5HGIdtBH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Phil Fogel (@Philfog) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Philfog/status/1647986551790481410?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 17, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://forum.celo.org/t/climate-collective-1-year-anniversary-heres-to-many-more/5585" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read the full update&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="good-dollar-reached-half-a-million-users-%F0%9F%92%B0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good Dollar Reached Half a Million Users 💰&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gooddollarorg/status/1646542925323550720?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Etweet%7Ctwtr%5Etrue"&gt;GoodDollar&lt;/a&gt; uses the interest generated from principal investments to fund &lt;a href="https://www.investopedia.com/terms/b/basic-income.asp"&gt;universal basic income&lt;/a&gt; and reward sponsors. They've recently reached 500k unique members worldwide, making a huge step for global financial inclusion! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;It&amp;#39;s official!🥳 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are more than 500k unique members across the globe!🌍💙&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The future looks bright!😎We are looking to grow even more! 🚀 &lt;a href="https://t.co/ZlgH5el0QS"&gt;pic.twitter.com/ZlgH5el0QS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; GoodDollar ( :D , :D ) (@gooddollarorg) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gooddollarorg/status/1646542925323550720?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 13, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-global-south-is-talking-to-the-ecosystem-%F0%9F%97%A3"&gt;The Global South is Talking to the Ecosystem 🗣&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/greenpill/id1609313639"&gt;Green Pill Podcast&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Owocki&lt;/a&gt; is reaching out to the regen community in the Global South for a new series of podcast episodes! Go ahead, jump on his tweet, and suggest some cool colleagues and projects to keep the convo going! 😄&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;i want to do a series of greenpill podcast episodes on regen x web3 projects in the global south.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;who should i talk to?&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Owocki.Ξth (🤖,💚) (@owocki) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki/status/1645437479078748160?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-next-ethereum-merge-%E2%9B%B0"&gt;The next Ethereum Merge ⛰&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/03/28/shapella-mainnet-announcement"&gt;Shapella&lt;/a&gt; is here, and this is the next Ethereum era. The work that began with &lt;a href="https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/merge/"&gt;the merge&lt;/a&gt; has finally reached the anticipated blockchain upgrade. The final historic milestone completes the multi-year transition to a full proof-of-stake network. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2023/04/12/ethereums-shanghai-upgrade-activates-starting-new-era-of-staking-withdrawals/?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;_hsmi=254375273&amp;amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-9rXe4aSUaDjIOdxKdDHgmxZHBNPEZE7I5iwjXOc9Yd9GMmSwKmHWGn0QpmFZjjjUk_LVw7lXyosaHwW69qZ_Qq6tZi3Q&amp;amp;utm_content=254375271&amp;amp;utm_source=hs_email"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-20.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1208" height="1042" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-20.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-20.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-20.png 1208w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2023/04/12/ethereums-shanghai-upgrade-activates-starting-new-era-of-staking-withdrawals/?utm_medium&amp;#x3D;email&amp;amp;_hsmi&amp;#x3D;254375273&amp;amp;_hsenc&amp;#x3D;p2ANqtz-9rXe4aSUaDjIOdxKdDHgmxZHBNPEZE7I5iwjXOc9Yd9GMmSwKmHWGn0QpmFZjjjUk_LVw7lXyosaHwW69qZ_Qq6tZi3Q&amp;amp;utm_content&amp;#x3D;254375271&amp;amp;utm_source&amp;#x3D;hs_email" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week-%F0%9F%93%A1"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week &lt;/strong&gt;📡&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.reuters.com/markets/europe/eu-moves-clarify-sustainable-investments-after-fund-downgrades-2023-04-14/"&gt;EU moves to clarify 'sustainable' investments after fund downgrades&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://celo.stake.id/#/proposal/88"&gt;Celo to Join Chainlink SCALE Program To Accelerate Ecosystem Growth&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloKenya/status/1647931764902359042?s=20"&gt;The Celo Africa DAO is officially launching!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://carbon-pulse.com/199026/"&gt;Blockchain networks announce partnership aiming to reignite crypto carbon trade&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/alanransil/2023/04/12/web3-projects-are-rebuilding-carbon-offsets-architecture-of-trust/?sh=769cca986ec0"&gt;Web3 Projects Are Rebuilding Carbon Offsets’ Architecture Of Trust&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-ideas-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content ideas or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next week's Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-16.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-16.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-16.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-16.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-16.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;🙌🏽 &lt;a href="https://giveth.io/"&gt;Giveth&lt;/a&gt;: Decentralized Altruistic Community using blockchain technology to make the world a better place. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🏘 &lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;Climate Collective:&lt;/a&gt; an effort driven by the Celo community to fight climate change by tokenizing rainforests and other carbon-sequestering assets. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌳 &lt;a href="https://www.gainforest.earth/"&gt;GainForest&lt;/a&gt;: a decentralized fund using artificial intelligence to measure and reward sustainable nature stewardship.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;⚡️ &lt;a href="https://www.energyweb.org/"&gt;Energy Web&lt;/a&gt;: a suite of open-source tools built on top of the Energy Web Chain, the world’s first public, enterprise-grade blockchain tailored to the energy sector&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🪵 &lt;a href="https://www.centree.org/"&gt;Centree&lt;/a&gt;: finances the protection of old-growth forests by turning them into investable, living assets.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="last-mile-defi-08-regenerative-ecosystems-for-latin-america-with-camila-rioja-%E2%99%BB%EF%B8%8F"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Last Mile DeFi 08: Regenerative Ecosystems for Latin America with Camila Rioja ♻️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/camila-rioja-384b3970/?originalSubdomain=br"&gt;Camila Rioja&lt;/a&gt;, who leads &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt;'s ecosystem development in Latin America, discusses her thesis on the region's high potential for technological innovation in this week's &lt;a href="https://marcus.mirror.xyz/NgCizgrHm4clqcsR_n1qWuvzy0GzhFC7QdTTw1SfPUc"&gt;The Last Mile podcast&lt;/a&gt;. She also highlights a "hacker" mindset born from resilience amid historical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read Marcus' &lt;a href="https://marcus.mirror.xyz/NgCizgrHm4clqcsR_n1qWuvzy0GzhFC7QdTTw1SfPUc"&gt;mirror&lt;/a&gt;, and listen on your&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/17BecrtuFAQgQnFF8NPA1e"&gt; Spotify&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/last-mile-defi/id1677804336"&gt;Apple&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9mZWVkcy5zaW1wbGVjYXN0LmNvbS9zQXFmVGZPaA"&gt;Google&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://last-mile-crypto.simplecast.com/"&gt;Simple Cast&lt;/a&gt;, or &lt;a href="https://lenster.xyz/u/marcus"&gt;Lens&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://marcus.mirror.xyz/NgCizgrHm4clqcsR_n1qWuvzy0GzhFC7QdTTw1SfPUc"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-21.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1000" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-21.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-21.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-21.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-21.png 2366w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podfollow.com/refi-podcast/view" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://podlink.to/moneypandaep6"&gt;Blockchain Adoption - Episode VI&lt;/a&gt; 💻 | The Money Panda, by &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elviskolawole/"&gt;Elvis Kolawole&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MAdMAoCNfI4"&gt;The Shapella Upgrade is a HUGE Unlock for ETH&lt;/a&gt; 🚀 | Bankless Weekly Rollups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode98-jennyco-building-the-worlds-first-healthcare-data-exchange-powered-by-web3"&gt;JennyCo - Building the world’s first Healthcare Data Exchange powered by Web3&lt;/a&gt; 👩‍⚕️| Crypto Altruism Podcast Episode 98&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="climate-week-in-san-francisco"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sfclimateweek.org"&gt;Climate Week in San Francisco&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Apr 17 - &lt;strong&gt;Apr 2&lt;/strong&gt;3 in San Francisco, USA and Virtual): &lt;/strong&gt;One of the most important series of events hosted by &lt;a href="https://climatebase.org/"&gt;Climatebase&lt;/a&gt;, gathering diverse climate organizations, leaders, and the broader community working at the intersection of climate action &amp;amp; innovation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://climatebase.org/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-18.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1528" height="546" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-18.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-18.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-18.png 1528w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sfclimateweek.org" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="eth-boston"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethboston.xyz/?utm_source=substack&amp;amp;utm_medium=email%7D"&gt;ETH Boston&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Apr 29 - &lt;strong&gt;Apr &lt;/strong&gt;30 in Boston, USA):&lt;/strong&gt; A surprise event by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ethboston?lang=en]"&gt;ETHBoston&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.thebostondao.com/"&gt;The Boston DAO&lt;/a&gt; at Boston University. A returning conference that had been absent since 2019. The in-person event will feature two stages of speakers and panellists, technology-specific workshops, networking events, and a hackathon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethboston.xyz/?utm_source=substack&amp;amp;utm_medium=email%7D"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/1500x500.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1500" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/1500x500.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/1500x500.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/1500x500.jpg 1500w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ethboston.xyz/?utm_source&amp;#x3D;substack&amp;amp;utm_medium&amp;#x3D;email%7D" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Sign up here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-good-tech-festival"&gt;&lt;a href="https://goodtechfest.com/washington-dc/"&gt;The Good Tech Festival&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 1 - May 4 in Washinton, USA)&lt;/strong&gt;: Good Tech Fest is a series of virtual and in-person gatherings happening every year around the world. This edition will be hosted in Washington and will include virtual attendance. Between their sponsors and speakers we find &lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.bonterratech.com/event/good-tech-fest-2023"&gt;Bonterra&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://goodtechfest.com/washington-dc/"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/GTF-DC-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1047" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/GTF-DC-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/GTF-DC-1.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/GTF-DC-1.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/GTF-DC-1.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://goodtechfest.com/washington-dc/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Book your ticket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="how-to-fundraise-on-gitcoin"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/"&gt;How to Fundraise on Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Apr 18, 3 PM UTC, Online - Zoom): &lt;/strong&gt;as the &lt;a href="https://grants.gitcoin.co/"&gt;Gitcoin Grants Beta Round&lt;/a&gt; is getting closer (starting on April 25th), join the next training of the Event Organizers' Guild where &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/a&gt;, source at ReFi DAO, will give an overview of the best tips to run successful fundraising on Gitcoin. Check the Tweet for more info. 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Less than 2 weeks until the start of the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; Beta Round! 🤯&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Want to learn how to successfully fundraise through Gitcoin? Join &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@climateXcrypto&lt;/a&gt; for a training at the Event Organizers Guild!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;📅 April 18&lt;br&gt;🕚 11 AM UTC or 🕒 3 PM UTC&lt;br&gt;📍 Zoom&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Calendar invite below 👇&lt;br&gt;/1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/npBpWjC5Kp"&gt;pic.twitter.com/npBpWjC5Kp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Spring 🤝 ReFi DAO (@RefiSpring) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiSpring/status/1646610561101070339?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 13, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-day-poolside-hub-in-lisbon-%F0%9F%92%BB%F0%9F%8C%AE%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Day @ Poolside Hub in Lisbon 💻🌮🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;On April 11th, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; organized the first ReFi Day during the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideCo"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Poolside Hub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Lisbon opening week! A full day of networking and deep connections with yoga, co-working and in-depth conversations all wrapped up by an &lt;strong&gt;evening session&lt;/strong&gt; hosted by ReFi Lisbon, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactMarket_"&gt;impactMarket&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams"&gt;Traditional Dream Factory&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are super excited to give you the first sneak peek at the incredible pics of the event! 🤫👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-66.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-66.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-66.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-66.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-66.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-68.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-68.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-68.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-68.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-68.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-69.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-69.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-69.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-69.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-69.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-76.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-76.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-76.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-76.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-76.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-79.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-79.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-79.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-79.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-79.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-83.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-83.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-83.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-83.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-83.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-87.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-87.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-87.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-87.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-87.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-44.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-44.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-44.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-44.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-44.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/plsd_prw-46.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/plsd_prw-46.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/plsd_prw-46.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/plsd_prw-46.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/04/plsd_prw-46.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make sure to follow ReFi Lisboa to stay up to date with the upcoming monthly events!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Follow ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic week friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there! &lt;/em&gt;👋&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Marcelo and Anna of ReFi Spring and ReFi DAO here with some great news on the event grants covering ReFi Spring Season 2 events and ReFi DAO Local Node Prize applications. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this article, we will cover the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Update on ReFi Spring Season 2 Grants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Next steps for ReFi DAO Local Node Prize Applications&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;What’s coming next for the Event Organizers’ Guild&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let’s go! 🚀&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-spring-season-2-grants"&gt;ReFi Spring Season 2 Grants&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are super excited to announce that we’ve allocated the first batch of the ReFi Spring Season 2 grants and we’d like to celebrate all the amazing event organizers! 👏 Read till the end to discover which event organizers where selected in the last batch of funding. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;em class="italic" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Celebrating the first 10 grantees to receive ReFi Spring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="tereza-bizkovamedellin-colombia-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B4"&gt;Tereza Bizkova - Medellin, Colombia 🇨🇴&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;During &lt;strong&gt;"Blockchain for Good? Medellín, meet ReFi!"&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova"&gt;Tereza Bizkova&lt;/a&gt; introduced ReFi and delved into particular blockchain applications for the first time in Medellín, Colombia. She achieved her goal of promoting and raising awareness about ReFi while highlighting its potential benefits for social good. Find out more about her successful event below! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $650&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Regenerative Finance is all about creating systems that regenerate their resource capacity over time. 🍃📈&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Yesterday, we hosted a great &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; event at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HASHHOUSECLUB?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@HASHHOUSECLUB&lt;/a&gt;  in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Medellin?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Medellin&lt;/a&gt; with the support of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt;. How did it go and what were the key takeaways? 👇 &lt;a href="https://t.co/nJRej7Grji"&gt;pic.twitter.com/nJRej7Grji&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Tereza Bízková (:D, :D) 🇨🇴 (@TerezaBizkova) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova/status/1638941735794651136?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="timothy-goudzandparamaribo-suriname-%F0%9F%87%B8%F0%9F%87%B7"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Timothy Goudzand - Paramaribo, Suriname &lt;/strong&gt;🇸🇷&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GoudzandT"&gt;Timothy Goudzand&lt;/a&gt;, founder of  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/INFINITRI_IO"&gt;Infinitri&lt;/a&gt;, is planning another exciting event - "Innovators Buzz", aimed at bringing together innovative thinkers in web3. The primary objective of this event, which is being organized for the second time, is to foster connections among web 3 enthusiasts and encourage them to envision a sustainable and resilient future for Suriname. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;Contacted Tim&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="cyrille-frank-teukamdouala-cameroon-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B2"&gt;Cyrille Frank Teukam - Douala, Cameroon 🇨🇲 &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tecyfra"&gt;Cyrille Frank Teukam&lt;/a&gt; is returning with the "Cameroon ReFi Talk Series" to establish connections between ReFi-related initiatives and promote their impact through collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="fr" dir="ltr"&gt;🌍📣 Rejoignez-nous pour un évènement captivant sur l'entreprenariat éco-responsable et la finance régénérative, soutenant les communautés locales ! 🌿💼&lt;br&gt;📅 Date: samedi 13 mai&lt;br&gt;⏰ Heure: 10h30 (heure de Douala)&lt;br&gt;📍 Lieu: Akwa, 2 églises, Hibis Academy, face station MRS &lt;a href="https://t.co/2sUoGpwqak"&gt;pic.twitter.com/2sUoGpwqak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Cyrille Frank TEUKAM 🌐 (@tecyfra) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tecyfra/status/1655979828498034689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;pictures and description in the ReFi Spring telegram group&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="kuzy-muvezwaharare-zimbabwe-%F0%9F%87%BF%F0%9F%87%BC"&gt;Kuzy Muvezwa - Harare, Zimbabwe 🇿🇼 &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KuzyTheAwsomest"&gt;Kuzy Muvezwa&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/builtndifferent"&gt;BuiltDifferent&lt;/a&gt; organizing "ReFi 101" – an event intended to gather individuals interested in Web 3, as well as developers, enthusiasts, and founders who are eager to learn and incorporate ReFi technology in Africa. This event is a fantastic opportunity to gain valuable insights and make significant strides towards the future of ReFi technology, while contributing to the development of the ecosystem&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;look for a contact to get in touch with Kuzy&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="showncape-town-south-africa-%F0%9F%87%BF%F0%9F%87%A6"&gt;Shown - Cape Town, South Africa 🇿🇦&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make sure to keep up with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRegennshawn"&gt;Shawn&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ixoworld"&gt;IXO&lt;/a&gt; as he leads the way in ReFi innovation at "ReFi Autumn Cape Town 2023" in South Africa. The event is designed to spark discussions on Web3 and ReFi among unemployed youth by uniting a coalition of organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;feature this event coming up&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/reficapetown/status/1676862478108467200"&gt;https://twitter.com/reficapetown/status/1676862478108467200&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="felix-fritschreichenau-an-der-rax-austria-%F0%9F%87%A6%F0%9F%87%B9"&gt;Felix Fritsch - Reichenau an der Rax, Austria 🇦🇹&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second edition of Solarpunk Now! organized by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/FelixFritsch2"&gt;Felix Fritsch&lt;/a&gt; at the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CCommonsHub"&gt;Crypto Commons Hub&lt;/a&gt; has been an absolute success. Featuring agricultural IoT initiatives, permaculture training sessions, solarpunk art and design, all with a focus on ReFi, the event has fostered deep connections between the participants. Make sure to check out how it went! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Solarpunk Now has ended, but its results remain ingrained in the Hub - Our new FarmBot is ready to plant! &lt;a href="https://t.co/uqe80XVa2F"&gt;pic.twitter.com/uqe80XVa2F&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Crypto Commons Association (@CCommonsHub) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CCommonsHub/status/1645008410428026882?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="adaeze-okaforlagos-nigeria-%F0%9F%87%B3%F0%9F%87%AC"&gt;Adaeze Okafor - Lagos, Nigeria 🇳🇬 &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="Aida_Regen"&gt;Adaeze&lt;/a&gt; is a passionate leader from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refibysouth"&gt;ReFi by South&lt;/a&gt;, who is currently at the forefront of organizing the impactful event, "Educating Nigeria Women in Climate and Web 3". The event will focus on crucial topics such as extreme weather conditions, climate adaptation policies, and bridging the gender-based digital divide. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;ask if they are planning any event&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="susanne-zapel%C3%A3o-shauna-butterlylisboa-portugal-%F0%9F%87%B5%F0%9F%87%B9"&gt;Susanne Zapelão &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly - Lisboa, Portugal 🇵🇹&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi Lisboa has been organizing regular monthly events to gather the ReFi community and build strong relationships between people sharing the mission of  regeneration. Congratulations to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SZapelao"&gt;Susanne Zapelão&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly for the wonderful organization! Check out the pictures of the latest ReFi Day event! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;It was an amazing Day at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/PoolsideLisbon?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#PoolsideLisbon&lt;/a&gt; Opening Week with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiLisboa&lt;/a&gt;! 🎉 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@climateXcrypto&lt;/a&gt;'s Regeneration talk, yoga &amp;amp; meditation workshops, to the Networking lunch &amp;amp; DJ night—big thanks to everyone involved! 🙌&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stay tuned to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideCo?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@PoolsideCo&lt;/a&gt; for upcoming events! ✨ &lt;a href="https://t.co/uFwpdcOJo7"&gt;pic.twitter.com/uFwpdcOJo7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Poolside, Web3 ecosystem (@PoolsideCo) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideCo/status/1647204459347312641?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 15, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="kennedy-nganganairobi-kenya-%F0%9F%87%B0%F0%9F%87%AA"&gt;Kennedy Ng'ang'a - Nairobi, Kenya 🇰🇪&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/shambanetwork"&gt;Shamba Network&lt;/a&gt;, a startup led by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KennedyWNganga"&gt;Kennedy Ng'ang'a&lt;/a&gt; is working to building measurement, reporting, and verification (MRV) tools accessible to small farmers. Adter the successful gathering of last year, Kennedy is organizing the second edition of ReFi Kenya. The event will introduce local farmers to ReFi principles and foster the development of projects on the ground.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;future: add this one: &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiKenya/status/1678754213776756737"&gt;https://twitter.com/ReFiKenya/status/1678754213776756737&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And add it to the event page&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="wrapping-up-refi-spring-season-2-grants"&gt;Wrapping up ReFi Spring Season 2 Grants!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are excited to announce the last batch of grantees that will be receiving support for ReFi Spring Season 2 Event Grants! We have received over 70 applications, and we are incredibly grateful to have the chance to support the ReFi movement through IRL events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="karla-c%C3%B3rdoba-brenescosta-rica-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B7"&gt;Karla Córdoba-Brenes - Costa Rica 🇨🇷&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verano ReFi Costa Rica 2023 will bring ReFi to the rural areas first, prioritizing events organized by CofiBlocks and Verdes in Poás de Alajuela and Monteverde. These regions traditionally experience a lack of educational opportunities, especially those related to technology, impact and innovation. There will also digital events focused on women and organized by Ruta Ruda, with the aim to create new opportunities for women to free themselves from workplace harassment by learning web3 tools and co-creating ReFi-inspired collaborative businesses. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add this one &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and article in English: &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/visiting-refi-costa-rica/"&gt;https://blog.refidao.com/visiting-refi-costa-rica/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="es" dir="ltr"&gt;El pasado 23 y 24 de junio de 2023 se llevó a cabo el I Encuentro ReFi Costa Rica 2023, con la participación de +30 personas y organizaciones que impulsan las finanzas regenerativas desde todos los rincones de nuestro país. &lt;a href="https://t.co/2fjGCx3E5v"&gt;https://t.co/2fjGCx3E5v&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/dbmzY2ICbJ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/dbmzY2ICbJ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— ReFi Costa Rica 🌱 (@ReFiCostaRica_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiCostaRica_/status/1676054871026409473?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;July 4, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="machuche-simaliketanzania-%F0%9F%87%B9%F0%9F%87%BF"&gt;Machuche Simalike - Tanzania 🇹🇿&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through the Rangi Chanya event community members will be able to be onboarded to web 3 discover different opportunities for them to not only earn a living but also simultaneously take part in impacting their community positively. But also through the dApp they will get a chance to add value to their impact and personal lives through incentives (such as the plastic credits) and have more power to run their lives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;organizer: Simalike @chatafisha Organizer's Twitter: @machuche_&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $625&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Our first ever &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; event in Tanzania was nothing short of successful! We were joined by the local government, regenerators as well as students from Ndumbwi primary school who might be the smartest and most environmentally woke kids we ever met! Thread 🧵: &lt;a href="https://t.co/e72uOOQzAc"&gt;pic.twitter.com/e72uOOQzAc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— CHATAFISHA (@Chatafisha) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Chatafisha/status/1660548807354974208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="javier-delgadomargarita-venezuela-tbd-%F0%9F%87%BB%F0%9F%87%AA"&gt;Javier Delgado - Margarita, Venezuela (TBD) 🇻🇪&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Javier Delgado (https://twitter.com/polkajavier1) of Vostadg (twitter.com/vostadg) will be creating partnerships with indigenous communities, women's groups, LGBTIQ+ community and other minorities. We will have a live sign language translator, we will also include public schools and high schools as well as community brigades, housewives and the general public, our event is meant to be inclusive at all times.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $625&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Here we are the first &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiVenezuela?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@RefiVenezuela&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/twist_studio?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@twist_studio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thanks for all the support &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/asilodigital?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@asilodigital&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; @RefiSpring &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ETHVenezuela?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ETHVenezuela&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/web3beach?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@web3beach&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ImpactScope?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ImpactScope&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/kZAhme1mDD"&gt;pic.twitter.com/kZAhme1mDD&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Susana González (@SuaNex) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SuaNex/status/1669726712618180611?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;June 16, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-local-nodes-prizewhat%E2%80%99s-coming-next"&gt;ReFi DAO Local Nodes Prize - What’s coming next?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Local-Node-Map-1-.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Local-Node-Map-1-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Local-Node-Map-1-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Local-Node-Map-1-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Local-Node-Map-1-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;First of all, thank you for applying to become a ReFi DAO Local node. We are incredibly grateful to receive your application. Our team is currently reviewing all the applications as they come in. To make it easier for you to know the status of your application to become a ReFi DAO Local Node, we have created this public document in Notion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BUTTON: CHECK THE STATUS OF YOUR APPLICATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://refispring.notion.site/7b980c30b0b146648942b7eb2706f7a9?v=f7b6c36cab104f27adf899a71707a239"&gt;ReFi DAO Local Node Prize (public)&lt;/a&gt;*&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here's what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Our team is reviewing applications with a number of external advisors before assessing eligibility.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If you are eligible and have a strong application, we will invite you to create a Gitcoin grant to raise funds for your emerging Local Node under the upcoming Beta round with full support from the ReFi DAO and Commons Stack community.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If you are eligible but your application needs work, we will recommend next steps, such as meeting with other founders, going deeper into local problems, and building local partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If you are not eligible, we will explain exactly what you need to do to meet the criteria as outlined in our announcement. LINK THE MIRROR HERE&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="next-steps-for-the-refi-dao-local-node-prize"&gt;Next Steps for the ReFi DAO Local Node Prize&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have applied for the ReFi DAO Local Node Prize, be sure to attend the upcoming AMA on LinkedIN on Wednesday, April 12 at 4 pm London time. This is an excellent opportunity to learn more about the prize and ask any questions you may have.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="what%E2%80%99s-coming-next-for-the-event-organizers%E2%80%99-guild"&gt;What’s coming next for the Event Organizers’ Guild?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rewrite and put emphasis on the last event!!!!!!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Last week we had a full house at the Event Organizers' Guild as have John Ellison of ReFi DAO gave a training on how to successfully fundraise Gitcoin.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The engaging training covered the main aspects on how to write and present a grant, how to run a promotional campaign and the importance of building a strong community. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/18.04.2023_09.21.30_REC.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1219" height="671" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/18.04.2023_09.21.30_REC.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/18.04.2023_09.21.30_REC.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/18.04.2023_09.21.30_REC.png 1219w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Next week we will have the last session at the Guild, to reflect on what we learned and collect feedback for future trainings coming up later this year.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;INSERT BANNER&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us on Tuesday, at 3 PM UTC&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add invite link.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Happy Belated Earth Day  Regens! 👋&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.gaoa.work/?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;Gabriel&lt;/a&gt; here, a knowledge worker focused on high-impact research to &lt;/em&gt;simplify complex system theories by implementing &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1643807549257560065?s=20"&gt;an emergent framework&lt;/a&gt; for maximazing the potential of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1648656402125316099?s=20"&gt;organizations and the people within them&lt;/a&gt;. I'm&lt;em&gt; experimenting in the intersection of Web3, Cognitive Science and the Creator Economy with the vision of fostering the &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/accordplace"&gt;future of work&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/gaoanetwork?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;Integral Education&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this week's edition, we'll be diving into the human component of ReFi&lt;/em&gt;, building upon how &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-55/"&gt;the infinite game of ReFi&lt;/a&gt; is shifting the paradigm&lt;em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;and as always, we'll be sharing top news, events, and jobs from the ReFi world and beyond. Let's jump right in. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/collective-consciousness-1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1456" height="816" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/collective-consciousness-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/collective-consciousness-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/collective-consciousness-1.png 1456w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;with Midjourney.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="shifting-paradigms-with-refi-%F0%9F%8C%8C-%F0%9F%92%9A"&gt;Shifting paradigms with ReFi 🌌 💚&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our current economic system, rooted in the Industrial Revolution, is driven by financial profit maximization above all other measures. This extractive approach is harming people and planet - from widespread environmental degradation to increasing inequality. Recognizing and addressing these issues is crucial for creating a more sustainable and equitable future. To get there we require a shift in our economic values and practices, a shift in collective consciousness...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="collective-consciousness-%F0%9F%A7%A0"&gt;Collective Consciousness 🧠&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collective consciousness refers to the shared beliefs, values, attitudes, and knowledge that exist within a particular society or group of people. It is the idea that &lt;strong&gt;individuals within a group are connected to one another&lt;/strong&gt; and that their thoughts, feelings, and behaviors are influenced by the collective beliefs and experiences of the group. Collective consciousness plays a significant role in shaping the way we view ourselves and the world around us, and can influence our perceptions, decisions, and actions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our collective vision for a regenerative and collaborative economy is not only necessary but also achievable. &lt;strong&gt;By shifting our collective consciousness and adopting new paradigms&lt;/strong&gt;, we can create a more sustainable and equitable future for all, moving towards a new economy that optimizes for lasting positive impact. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;wait, it&amp;#39;s all cross-pollination?!&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/DAO?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#DAO&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/NetworkState?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#NetworkState&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/unEdr3b4LI"&gt;https://t.co/unEdr3b4LI&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/Z6pmbst5w1"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Z6pmbst5w1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; gaoa.eth (@gaoa97) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1633159547589386240?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 7, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="new-paradigms-%F0%9F%94%AD"&gt;New paradigms 🔭&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;New paradigms are emerging that are based on regenerative and collaborative practices. ReFi is at the forefront of this shift, with visions to create organizations that prioritize the well-being of &lt;u&gt;all&lt;/u&gt; living systems. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1634023710721183744?s=20"&gt;Decentralized Autonomous Regenerative Ecosystems&lt;/a&gt;? 👀&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MycoPunks?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MycoPunks&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Treegens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Treegens&lt;/a&gt;, the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Beegens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Beegens&lt;/a&gt; fly through, the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/SolarPunks?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#SolarPunks&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MoonPunks?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MoonPunks&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/TheFairies?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#TheFairies&lt;/a&gt; too, the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Regens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Regens&lt;/a&gt; unite &amp;amp; together… we take flight, as we share the light. ✨2/12&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; TreeDjinn.eth (@TreeDjinn) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TreeDjinn/status/1648336339933478913?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mirror.xyz/gaoanetwork.eth/collection" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read Our Collective Story&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="thinking-in-systems-%F0%9F%95%B8"&gt;Thinking in systems 🕸&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Co-creation, co-existence, and cooperation are at the heart of the ReFi paradigm. As &lt;strong&gt;systems thinkers&lt;/strong&gt;, we begin to see ourselves not as separate individuals but &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-55/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;as part of a larger whole&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 1990, &lt;a href="https://gaoa.notion.site/The-Fifth-Discipline-The-Art-Practice-of-The-Learning-Organization-597698c836124c72a2e36813ea234945"&gt;Peter Senge&lt;/a&gt;, a systems scientist and a professor of management at MIT, published &lt;a href="https://gaoa.notion.site/The-Fifth-Discipline-The-Art-Practice-of-The-Learning-Organization-597698c836124c72a2e36813ea234945"&gt;The Fifth Discipline: The Art and Practice of the Learning Organization&lt;/a&gt;. The Fifth Discipline became essential reading for those interested in systems thinking and management. A framework that came out of Senge's work is &lt;strong&gt;the iceberg model&lt;/strong&gt; of systems thinking. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an example, projects like &lt;a href="https://www.digitalgaia.earth/?ref=blog.refidao.com#How-it-works"&gt;Digital Gaia&lt;/a&gt; are working to ignite a regenerative agricultural revolution from the bottom up, using open science and AI to empower the world’s 1 billion farmers and land stewards with decentralized tools to measure and monetize their regenerative performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;gm deep divers &lt;a href="https://t.co/bI5MmNdPvQ"&gt;https://t.co/bI5MmNdPvQ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; gaoa.eth (@gaoa97) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1594852913712869377?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;November 22, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="ready-for-the-shift-%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;Ready for the shift? 🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We all have a part to play in making our world better, and it starts with becoming conscious system thinkers! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With ‘inner’ change work which supports us to; explore our own entanglement in the power-over culture perpetuating these harmful societal structures; cultivate healthier relationships with ourselves, each other and other-than-humans; and to co-create the healthy, transformative, and just cultures our hearts long for.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/cc-1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1456" height="816" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/cc-1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/cc-1.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/cc-1.png 1456w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;with Midjourney.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAframework/status/1647880594406379520?s&amp;#x3D;20" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Check out the 7 signs of system thinkers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="update-on-the-refi-nation-state-%F0%9F%94%B5"&gt;Update on the ReFi Nation State 🔵&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A network of on-the-ground ReFi communities is emerging in full swing. Globally distributed but connected with common culture, ethos, and mission, a ReFi CoordiNation is getting closer day by day 🙌🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Starting with simple meet-ups and events, successful local nodes will go on to acquire land and other real-world assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The ambition is not to create new borders but to work alongside existing nation-states as an accelerant to a regenerative future&lt;br&gt;--&amp;gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/CoordiNation?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#CoordiNation&lt;/a&gt; 👀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/15 &lt;a href="https://t.co/YtlrO2acS3"&gt;pic.twitter.com/YtlrO2acS3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Monty Merlin Bryant 🧙✨ (@MontyMerlin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin/status/1648337452845895680?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="from-medellin-colombia-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B4"&gt;From Medellin (Colombia) 🇨🇴&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Parce, get ready for the next &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; chapter!🚀💐 Go follow &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiMedellin&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="https://t.co/mX0mNnXete"&gt;https://t.co/mX0mNnXete&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/DuDCF5tttt"&gt;pic.twitter.com/DuDCF5tttt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Tereza Bízková (:D, :D) 🇨🇴 (@TerezaBizkova) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova/status/1649591552295968772?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="to-lagos-nigeria-%F0%9F%87%B3%F0%9F%87%AC"&gt;To Lagos (Nigeria) 🇳🇬&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; Lagos is in the house! 👏 👏 👏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Local Node in Nigeria&amp;#39;s largest city will be focusing its efforts on urban solutions for sustainable food and energy farming to tackle the challenge of the increasing demand for food.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Let&amp;#39;s meet the founders! 🚀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/C5avLLfFxM"&gt;pic.twitter.com/C5avLLfFxM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 Local Node Prize! 🎉 (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1649574940822355969?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="to-hong-kong-%F0%9F%87%AD%F0%9F%87%B0"&gt;To Hong Kong 🇭🇰&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="art" dir="ltr"&gt;🎉🎉🎉 &lt;a href="https://t.co/l75TnRqCBk"&gt;https://t.co/l75TnRqCBk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Hong Kong (@ReFiHongKong) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiHongKong/status/1650433927117455360?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 24, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="to-south-africa-cape-town-%F0%9F%87%BF%F0%9F%87%A6"&gt;To South Africa (Cape Town) 🇿🇦&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; Cape Town is here! 🎉&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Cape Town Local Node will be working on creating a digital platform to visualize resource flows and inefficiencies, improving access to sustainable resources, conserving biodiversity, upskilling youth &amp;amp; more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Time to meet the founders! 👇&lt;br&gt;/1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/akAh8QtF3C"&gt;pic.twitter.com/akAh8QtF3C&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 Local Node Prize! 🎉 (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1649577703962722304?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="and-progressively-the-rest-of-the-world-%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;And progressively the rest of the world... 🌍&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;This map will be the foundation of a global regenerative economy. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cities are Schelling Points for talent &amp;amp; capital. This is where we onboard them into &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rural areas are where we deploy capital to protect and regenerate land on-chain w/ &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/dMRV?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#dMRV&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LFG &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; fam!🌎🌍🌏 &lt;a href="https://t.co/fFERxNebvn"&gt;pic.twitter.com/fFERxNebvn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; jE ❤️🌍🙏🏼 Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1649689673084596225?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="accelerating-collective-intelligence-%F0%9F%A4%AF"&gt;Accelerating Collective Intelligence 🤯&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today’s world has geometrically increasing inputs and a hyper-connectivity among them. Our ability to process this on our own is often overwhelming.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Talented, motivated individuals should be able to create and grow scalable businesses wherever they choose. To support these efforts, we need to build&lt;strong&gt; communities of support and knowledge-sharing&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GAOAnetwork/status/1648656402125316099?s=20"&gt;We believe&lt;/a&gt; that, through self-organization and democratization, the world can become a better place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Where ever you come from, whatever your background, there is a place for you in this story.&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Regeneration?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Regeneration&lt;/a&gt; is a symphony. Find your instrument and come join one of the 33 current &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; communities across the globe&lt;br&gt;--&amp;gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/baLEY0Lnrw"&gt;https://t.co/baLEY0Lnrw&lt;/a&gt; 💚&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/17 &lt;a href="https://t.co/i3gPBnFCzH"&gt;pic.twitter.com/i3gPBnFCzH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Monty Merlin Bryant 🧙✨ (@MontyMerlin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin/status/1648337480570249216?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-in-giveth-%F0%9F%AA%99"&gt;ReFi DAO in Giveth 🪙&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi DAO is currently fundraising through &lt;a href="https://giveth.io/"&gt;Giveth&lt;/a&gt; for a match funding pool for Gitcoin&lt;/strong&gt;. We invite you to join us on this journey toward a brighter future, any contributions are highly appreciated. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Hey &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regens&lt;/a&gt;! ☀️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are raising $12,5k in donations for a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/BetaRound?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#BetaRound&lt;/a&gt; match funding pool to support the emergence of Local Nodes! 🎉&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For every dollar donated via &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Giveth?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Giveth&lt;/a&gt;, we will donate a dollar to the pool (up to 12,5k).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wait, what? 🤯👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/t12A8FbQGO"&gt;https://t.co/t12A8FbQGO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;/1&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 Local Node Prize! 🎉 (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1648847256081297408?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 20, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="forests-at-your-fingertips-%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;Forests at your fingertips! 🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OpenForest_"&gt;Open Forest Protocol&lt;/a&gt; announced the official launch of the OFP Ecosystem Explorer!! You can now access any forest project from around the world on an interactive map interface 🤩 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌳🌲 Introducing the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OpenForest_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@OpenForest_&lt;/a&gt; Ecosystem Explorer &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Forests at your fingertips 🌎&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The worlds first forest ecosystem interface built on a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/blockchain?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#blockchain&lt;/a&gt;👉&lt;a href="https://t.co/c16CcDJfKK"&gt;https://t.co/c16CcDJfKK&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/k7UYy359nz"&gt;pic.twitter.com/k7UYy359nz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Open Forest Protocol (OFP) (@OpenForest_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/OpenForest_/status/1648312231489314818?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="earth-day-plant-more-trees"&gt;Earth Day = plant more trees&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens"&gt;Treegens &lt;/a&gt;returned by planting 2,000 mangrove trees during Earth Day last Friday. Psst.. they will also be participating in the next Gitcoin Beta round 🌳.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Happy Earth Day &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Treegens?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Treegens&lt;/a&gt;🌎&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Have touched tree today? ?💚&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TreeDjinn?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@TreeDjinn&lt;/a&gt; planted 2,000 mangrove Baby Treegens, which is 1 per follower for &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@thetreegens&lt;/a&gt; and more 🌱&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LET&amp;#39;S GROWWW,🌳&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Earthday2023?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Earthday2023&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/Tgr6Eqe1Tu"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Tgr6Eqe1Tu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Treegens (🌱,🌳) #GitcoinBeta (@thetreegens) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens/status/1649963510645022721?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="biological-systems-engineering"&gt;Biological Systems Engineering&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/valley_dao/status/1648273242476388354?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1648273242476388354%7Ctwgr%5E0e2ce71d034e53705b2bb46f33e194d36a98eb54%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.refidao.com%2Fp%2F28a31e23-166a-4b50-841a-c10ca0e4d0c4%2F"&gt;Valley DAO,&lt;/a&gt; a Synthetic Biology DAO, launches its token to support and fund Synbio research and development. This brings us closer to a Solarpunk future, where technology harmoniously coexists with nature ☀️.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;2/ So why is Synbio so awesome? For starters, it can help us create sustainable and eco-friendly technologies (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; -friendly). Imagine using bacteria to clean up oil spills, or engineering plants to absorb excess carbon dioxide from the atmosphere. &lt;a href="https://t.co/ub5UK9RLw2"&gt;pic.twitter.com/ub5UK9RLw2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ValleyDAO 🧬+🦠=✨🌍 (@valley_dao) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/valley_dao/status/1648273244095496192?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="ultragreen-money-%F0%9F%A6%87%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;Ultragreen Money 🦇🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most of us are likely familiar with the &lt;a href="https://ultrasound.money/"&gt;ultrasound money&lt;/a&gt; meme that &lt;a href="https://www.bankless.com/"&gt;Bankless &lt;/a&gt;and beyond advocate for. &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;Celo &lt;/a&gt;has put out their thesis and actions towards &lt;strong&gt;Ultragreen Money&lt;/strong&gt;. While Celo follows suit in burning a portion of each transaction like Ethereum’s Ultrasound Money, Ultragreen Money &lt;strong&gt;will also direct an additional portion of each transaction towards the purchase and retirement of carbon offsets&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com/celo-org/governance/blob/main/CGPs/cgp-0001.md"&gt;selected through governance&lt;/a&gt; by the Celo ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🦇🌳 Announcing Ultragreen Week!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Did you know Earth Day marks Celo’s 3-year mainnet anniversary?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To celebrate, we’re excited to kick-off the official launch of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/UltragreenWeek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#UltragreenWeek&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Check out the full rundown 🧵↓&lt;a href="https://t.co/IZwE5HOyJy"&gt;https://t.co/IZwE5HOyJy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Celo (@CeloOrg) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg/status/1647992064318251008?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 17, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.celo.org/ultragreen-money-c677e7508abb"&gt;Ultragreen Money&lt;/a&gt; introduced a refined Celo tokenomics and contributor rewards framework. The Ultragreen Proposal &lt;a href="https://forum.celo.org/t/core-devs-call-on-cip-ultragreen-celo/5387"&gt;CIP-52&lt;/a&gt; introduces a revised structure for how base fees are utilized in which a portion is burned (similar to Ethereum) and another portion is used to purchase carbon offsets that align with Celo’s commitment to sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-29.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1563" height="874" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-29.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-29.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-29.png 1563w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;In short, &lt;a href="https://forum.celo.org/t/core-devs-call-on-cip-ultragreen-celo/5387"&gt;CIP-52&lt;/a&gt; makes it so that every Celo transaction supports climate positive action!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ultragreen.money/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Join the twitter fam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-30.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-30.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-30.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/image-30.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-30.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youcould.info/wecoulddao"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WeCould DAO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: supporting the co-creation of sustainable projects that create a lasting positive impact on our planet and society.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧪 &lt;a href="https://www.valleydao.bio/"&gt;ValleyDAO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: an open, global community collectively financing and democratizing the governance of synthetic biology technologies to protect the future of our planet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🪸 &lt;a href="https://www.coraltribe.io/"&gt;Coral Tribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: curating opportunities for users to invest in climate projects &amp;amp; earn a return.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.openearth.org/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Earth Foundation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Open-source tech for our planet - building digital architecture to scale climate action. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌲 &lt;a href="https://www.veritree.com/"&gt;Veritree&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: connecting businesses with verified tree planting projects to restore our planet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="crypto-altruism-fiat24decentralized-identity-self-custody-and-financial-inclusion"&gt;Crypto Altruism : Fiat24 - Decentralized identity, self-custody, and financial inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In&lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode99-fiat24-decentralized-identity-self-custody-and-financial-inclusion"&gt; episode 99 of Crypto Altruism Podcast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://gatherverse.org/gv2023/speakers/karen-shidlo/"&gt;Karen Shidlo from Fiat24&lt;/a&gt; discusses decentralized digital identities, Soulbound tokens, centralized exchange challenges, self-custody, and financial inclusion through digital currencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode99-fiat24-decentralized-identity-self-custody-and-financial-inclusion"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/60103d3eeea7a74ecd224670/5ef9e9ff-5e36-4b6c-886d-49e7cbeccc57/Ep99-SM-Release.png?format=750w" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2560" height="1440"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podfollow.com/refi-podcast/view" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=opmc7-QM1zo&amp;amp;t=1s"&gt;Regens Unite with Xavier Damman and Leen Schelfhout &lt;/a&gt;🌍  |&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/0l6aXWC94dd0RA3tkKfxjd"&gt; Green Pill Podcast&lt;/a&gt; episode 106&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="collective-healing-social-justice-global-well-being-%F0%9F%92%BB"&gt;Collective Healing, Social Justice, Global Well-Being 💻&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 12th / Online):&lt;/strong&gt; The &lt;a href="https://www.unesco.org/en"&gt;UNESCO &lt;/a&gt;Routes of Enslaved Peoples Project and the Global Humanity for Peace Institute from &lt;a href="https://www.uwtsd.ac.uk/global-humanity-for-peace/"&gt;University of Wales Trinity St David (UWTSD)&lt;/a&gt;, are jointly hosting an exciting international webinar series entitled: New Perspectives on Collective Healing, Social Justice and Well-Being.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Thomas is a speaker in the webinar: New Perspectives on Collective Healing, Social Justice and Well-Being, with researcher &amp;amp; educator Dr. Joy DeGruy, who has spent years of research to develop the theory of Post Traumatic Slave Syndrome. 5/11 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/9AM?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@9am&lt;/a&gt; PST &lt;a href="https://t.co/HMFzst4DOF"&gt;https://t.co/HMFzst4DOF&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/1bqN2LAreP"&gt;pic.twitter.com/1bqN2LAreP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Thomas Hübl (@ThomasHuebl) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ThomasHuebl/status/1650235672173707270?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://uwtsd-ac-uk.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_OcO5w8owS9KjfBlabP9_0w#/registration" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register for the ZOOM webinar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="expanded-states-of-consciousness-%F0%9F%92%BB"&gt;Expanded States of Consciousness 💻&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 9th - May 17th / Online): &lt;/strong&gt;This summit is designed to create a &lt;strong&gt;profound journey and transformative learning experienc&lt;/strong&gt;e for anyone interested in expanded states of consciousness and their &lt;strong&gt;potential for our individual and collective healing&lt;/strong&gt;, spiritual evolution and awakening. This includes practitioners, clinicians, researchers, guides, coaches and other helping professionals, researchers, and the general public.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-28.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="919" height="847" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-28.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-28.png 919w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.expandedstatesworldsummit.com/home-Ar8jC?r_done&amp;#x3D;1" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;register now for FREE!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="regens-unite-gathering-reminder-%F0%9F%94%88"&gt;Regens Unite Gathering  (Reminder) 🔈&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 26th - May 27th. Brussels, Belgium):&lt;/strong&gt; In case you missed it in our previous roundups, you are invited to the 2nd edition of Regens Unite Brussels, where it all started in May 2022. &lt;strong&gt;A gathering for co-ops, DAOs, climate activists, artists, and citizens to meet, establish new relationships, and unite.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here's a recap of the 1st edition  👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;8/ Sovereignty Workshop at the &lt;a href="https://t.co/1f6y00e18n"&gt;https://t.co/1f6y00e18n&lt;/a&gt; event, 20-May-2022&lt;br&gt;Here we are in the Citizen Corner of Brussels, transformed into a magnificent, temporary autonomous zone, by the enthused work of the Regens Unite gathering’s core team and its supporters. &lt;a href="https://t.co/n0LJGrPhMI"&gt;pic.twitter.com/n0LJGrPhMI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; George Pór #StandWithUkraine (@technoshaman) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/technoshaman/status/1536757726151319552?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;June 14, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-26.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1122" height="608" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-26.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/image-26.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-26.png 1122w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regensunite.earth/event/regens-unite-brussels-2023" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Attend to the 2nd edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="agilists4planet-%F0%9F%8E%AA"&gt;Agilists4Planet  🎪 &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Apr 21st - Apr 22nd):&lt;/strong&gt; The Agility Impact community held its first Virtual Conference to build awareness and impact on Planetary Challenges with Agility. The planet is calling for our help and now more than ever &lt;strong&gt;we need a human-centric approach&lt;/strong&gt;, a “we” approach to these complex challenges, such as social, environmental, economic and so much more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Let’s leverage the action around &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; to greenpill these agile nerds!&lt;br&gt;Agilists are often tech literate so I’ll be trying to get them some wallets and passports&lt;br&gt;Join me and host some sessions about gitcoin, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt;,  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@regen_network&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@regensunite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/GJB4HZRMw5"&gt;https://t.co/GJB4HZRMw5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Jeremy (@gospelofchange) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gospelofchange/status/1649145646559948803?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 20, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="save-miami-%F0%9F%8E%AA"&gt;Save Miami 🎪&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(April 22nd, Miami):&lt;/strong&gt; The Panel included Geospatial Information Interoperability for Nature Based Solutions (NBS) and multi-stakeholder collaboration discussing how to drive citizen action and participation through game design, incentives and community effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Kickoff! &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/savemiami?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#savemiami&lt;/a&gt; climate collabothon opening remarks from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SolutionsSilvio?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@SolutionsSilvio&lt;/a&gt; ft. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Mjerle?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Mjerle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/tD4Ogj8vVJ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/tD4Ogj8vVJ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Miami | 🌴🐬🦩 (@ReFiMiami) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMiami/status/1649834996117413890?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2022/11/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emsee-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-communityem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="beyond-the-tragedy-of-the-commons-a-path-to-cooperative-coordination-by-rob-morris"&gt;Beyond the Tragedy of the Commons: A Path to Cooperative Coordination by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/recipromancer?s=20"&gt;Rob Morris&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-24.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="716" height="500" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/image-24.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/image-24.png 716w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traditional, rigid hierarchical institutions are failing us. They incentivise self-interested behaviour, pitting us against each other, and leading to large, seemingly-intractable problems. &lt;strong&gt;At the heart of the problem is the tension between collective interest and individual self-interest.&lt;/strong&gt; This is a problem famously described as "&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gaoa97/status/1639222990692048896?s=20"&gt;the tragedy of the commons&lt;/a&gt;", which proposes that (without coordination) humans sharing a public resource will each act selfishly, depleting that resource. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read on to find out how &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/recipromancer?s=20"&gt;Rob Morris&lt;/a&gt; thinks we can do better...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://fundaomental.substack.com/p/beyond-the-tragedy-of-the-commons" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read more...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watch this video to learn more about how &lt;a href="https://civilizationemerging.com/media/the-metacrisis-with-daniel-schmachtenberger-part-1/"&gt;Daniel Schmachtenberger&lt;/a&gt; frames this, and the &lt;a href="https://civilizationemerging.com/media/the-metacrisis-with-daniel-schmachtenberger-part-1/"&gt;meta-crisis&lt;/a&gt; problem with exquisite clarity in his series, “The Third Attractor”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8XCXvzQdcug?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="In Search of the Third Attractor, Daniel Schmachtenberger (part 1)"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;🟢&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/roundup-55/"&gt;Harmony &lt;/a&gt;= Individual Coherence + Collective Coordination...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/working-in-harmony.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1456" height="816" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/working-in-harmony.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/working-in-harmony.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/working-in-harmony.png 1456w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;with Midjourney.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a regenerative weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there Regens! &lt;/em&gt;🌱&lt;em&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mayazdentzel"&gt;Maya&lt;/a&gt; here, an academic researcher and digital ethnographer of web3 and climate. I'm excited to be back this week to share some exciting news from my working group at &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/press/2022/09/new-crypto-sustainability-coalition-to-investigate-potential-of-web3-technologies-in-fighting-climate-change/"&gt;WEF Crypto Sustainability Coalition&lt;/a&gt; – we have recently published a comprehensive whitepaper on blockchain for scaling climate action &lt;/em&gt;🎉&lt;em&gt; So in this week's roundup we will cover a snapshot summary of the publication, and as always, the top news and developments from across the world of Regenerative Finance (ReFi). Let's get into it! &lt;/em&gt;🤓&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/blockchain-for-scaling-climate-action"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-27-at-5.34.22-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1780" height="1300" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-27-at-5.34.22-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-27-at-5.34.22-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-27-at-5.34.22-PM.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-27-at-5.34.22-PM.png 1780w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="blockchain-for-scaling-climate-action-%F0%9F%A6%8B"&gt;Blockchain for Scaling Climate Action 🦋&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;When most people think of cryptocurrency, they may immediately conjure up images of volatile prices, scams, and questionable use cases. And while it's true that this has played a prominent role in crypto's history, there is more to the story than meets the eye. Beneath the surface is a technology that has the potential to be a game-changer in the fight against climate change and other pressing global issues. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The key to unlocking this potential is understanding how blockchain and other decentralized technologies can be &lt;u&gt;harnessed in the right way&lt;/u&gt; and building the right &lt;u&gt;partnerships&lt;/u&gt; to make it happen. But how can we speed this process up? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-wef-crypto-sustainability-coalition"&gt;The WEF Crypto Sustainability Coalition&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Made up of over 30+ key partners, The World Economic Forum (WEF) announced the launch of the Crypto Sustainability Coalition in September 2022. The aim has been to investigate how Web3, crypto, and blockchain technologies can be utilised to achieve positive climate action, support research &amp;amp; development, share best practices, and influence positive regulation on climate-related matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out the &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/working-group/WEF-Crypto-Sustainability-Coalition/r/recAFA1XV8rh6hjDR"&gt;working group dashboard on ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/em&gt;👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.refidao.com/community/working-group/WEF-Crypto-Sustainability-Coalition/r/recAFA1XV8rh6hjDR"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;WEF Crypto Sustainability Coalition | ReFi Working Group&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;A cross-sector coalition to investigate how Web3 and blockchain tools can be utilised to achieve positive climate action.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://softr-prod.imgix.net/applications/315eb8e9-290e-4a79-a55d-826970df6cd7/assets/c616c43f-de22-4ad8-b857-f44f1718f278.png?rnd&amp;#x3D;1678209594579" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi Working Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v1/16/16/1682949600000/Y9LVCde_Zx-x6pm8qhLEdA/2zSlHmrQ4iP3JCj3qMbQOypVFVLBO4SlwN5orBxalJlzNY2iDx_I3yUtrP82Ji2fru-Kko3Frhj1WBdCISJtOFiybtA5EG186SlPQe1LwNE/DzUokiiK5zkA_MyUa2ry9RxHK8OjGXkR1llNR1UW0HY" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, after 7 months of research, the working group has just published a comprehensive whitepaper on blockchain for scaling climate action. Let's dive in to key findings 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Get insights from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/annalerner?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@annalerner&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/michaelmezz?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@michaelmezz&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@clim8collective&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/johnx25bd?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@johnx25bd&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ToucanProtocol&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/e_cheikos?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@e_cheikos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Hayley_L_Anna?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Hayley_L_Anna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mayazdentzel?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@mayazdentzel&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/wef?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@wef&lt;/a&gt; on how blockchain technology can support meaningful climate action &amp;amp; real-world use cases.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read more ↓&lt;a href="https://t.co/azdlyNhTL0"&gt;https://t.co/azdlyNhTL0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Celo 🦇 🌳 (@CeloOrg) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg/status/1651663257017413656?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 27, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="more-funding-less-warming-%F0%9F%92%B0"&gt;More funding, less warming 💰&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have interviewed 23 leaders and experts in the ReFi sector and collected over 60 survey responses 📃.  This paper investigates how blockchain is incentivizing a planet-positive economy focused on financing regeneration and climate action at scale. It is particularly urgent as trillions more dollars of climate finance investment are needed to maintain the 1.5°C pathway set by &lt;a href="https://www.ipcc.ch/sr15/#:~:text=Limiting%20warming%20to%201.5°C%20implies%20reaching%20net%20zero,particularly%20methane%20(high%20confidence)."&gt;IPCC&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.18.51-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1286" height="1038" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.18.51-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.18.51-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.18.51-PM.png 1286w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The trillions of dollars needed vs actual flows | &lt;a href="https://www.climatepolicyinitiative.org/publication/global-landscape-of-climate-finance-2021/"&gt;Climate Policy Initiative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="why-blockchain-x-refi-%F0%9F%A7%90"&gt;Why Blockchain X ReFi? 🧐&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blockchain can provide the necessary infrastructure to combat climate change at speed and scale. Specifically, the whitepaper identified:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;💪 Blockchain can strengthen trust and ambition in climate negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;📈 Blockchains and digital Measurement, Reporting, &amp;amp; Verification (MRV) technologies can improve market transparency and credibility.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💸 Digital carbon markets can funnel more money to project developers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌱 Digitization democratizes access to climate action.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.23.21-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1556" height="553" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.23.21-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.23.21-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-1.23.21-PM.png 1556w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/blockchain-for-scaling-climate-action"&gt;WEF&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;ReFi intersects with climate technology, sustainable development, climate finance, economics, regenerative practices, impact investment and climate justice – to name a few 🌿&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h3 id="industry-trends-%F0%9F%93%8A"&gt;Industry trends  📊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The current market development is headed in the right direction, utilizing cutting-edge blockchain technology for climate-focused innovations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌍 Web3 incentives strengthen existing climate initiatives (e.g. &lt;a href="https://climateactiondata.org"&gt;Climate Action Data Trust&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🏢 Companies have a growing focus on climate impact and more ambitious net-zero commitments (e.g. &lt;a href="https://consensys.net/blog/press-release/cop27-leading-technology-companies-launch-ethereum-climate-platform-initiative-to-address-ethereums-former-proof-of-work-carbon-emissions/"&gt;Ethereum Climate Platform&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;📡 Emerging digital MRVs unify the market (e.g. renewable energy certificates by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/all_infra"&gt;Allinfra&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;👩🏽‍💻 Data ownership and interoperability are key features of the industry (e.g. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HYPHEN_AG"&gt;Hyphen&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤝 ReFi prioritizes the role of community and collaborative culture (e.g. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/moss_earth"&gt;Moss&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.ethichub.com/es/"&gt;EthicHub&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Climate impact orgs 🤝 Global South&lt;br&gt;A recently published &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/wef?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@wef&lt;/a&gt; paper finds that 15% of companies leveraging blockchains to scale climate action are based or have offices in the Global South&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read the paper 👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/Tr6UBXUWl1"&gt;https://t.co/Tr6UBXUWl1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Toucan (@ToucanProtocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol/status/1651466317684264966?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 27, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-challenges-%F0%9F%AB%A3"&gt;The challenges 🫣&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;But it's not easy, there are several challenges that we need to tackle to fully maximize blockchain for scaling climate action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🚀 Implementation at scale requires unprecedented speed and coordination &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;📰 The blockchain industry is facing serious reputational challenges &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;👩‍🏫 Complexity and education gaps in the space persist &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🔎 Real-world impact goes before digital engagement &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;👩‍⚖️ ReFi suffers from regulatory uncertainty &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The World Economic Forum &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/wef?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@wef&lt;/a&gt; published a white paper titled Blockchain For Scaling Climate Action, where our CEO &amp;amp; Co-Founder Dana Gibber was mentioned when talking about the importance of constructive regulation to enable responsive digital climate innovation at scale.⚖️&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Flowcarbon (@weareflowcarbon) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/weareflowcarbon/status/1650963330465427469?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 25, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="recommendations-and-whats-next-%F0%9F%94%AE"&gt;Recommendations and what's next 🔮&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;All in all, the speed and scale of adoption will depend on constructive regulation. To get there, the blockchain industry should learn from the evolution of the climate industry, build multi-stakeholder partnerships and focus on scaling responsibly. Developing these partnerships, alongside educational campaigns &amp;amp; effective storytelling, will deepen institutional ties and accelerate progress. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-2.04.14-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1751" height="390" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-2.04.14-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-2.04.14-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-2.04.14-PM.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-2.04.14-PM.png 1751w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/blockchain-for-scaling-climate-action"&gt;WEF&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;In summary, ReFi founders, investors, and buidlers need to stay laser-focused on solving real-world problems and providing evidence-based, measurable impact to ensure industry momentum and credibility. Let's level up! 💪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.weforum.org/whitepapers/blockchain-for-scaling-climate-action" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read full white paper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-is-live-on-gitcoin-%F0%9F%8E%89"&gt;ReFi DAO is live on Gitcoin 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to realize a global regenerative economy rooted in startup cities all around the globe. With this long-term goal, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/a&gt; is supporting the emergence of a network of regenerative villages in strategic startup cities in 2023 with the belief that regeneration begins within 🧘‍♀️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We are LIVE on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;a href="https://t.co/5CryTjtlkB"&gt;https://t.co/5CryTjtlkB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&amp;#39;re on a mission to build a global regenerative economy rooted in startup cities around the world 🌍&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&amp;#39;re also hosting our first Featured Round supporting local &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; economies in 18 cities—primarily in the global south.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; /1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/NhVIOL4trm"&gt;pic.twitter.com/NhVIOL4trm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 #GitcoinBeta (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1650873125264056323?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 25, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks for being part of our journey and supporting us along the way 🙏🏼&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/round/1/0xaa40e2e5c8df03d792a52b5458959c320f86ca18/0xaa40e2e5c8df03d792a52b5458959c320f86ca18-243" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="gitcoin-coordination-game-%F0%9F%95%B9%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Gitcoin coordiNATION game 🕹️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Together with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/greenpillglobal"&gt;Green Pill&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://metacrisis.xyz/"&gt;Metacrisis.xyz&lt;/a&gt;, and others, ReFi DAO is hosting a four-day coordiNATION game rooted in a multitude of cities across the globe. The aim is to onboard new donors, funders, and projects into the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; ecosystem - for the &lt;a href="https://grants.gitcoin.co/"&gt;Beta grants round&lt;/a&gt; and beyond 💫  &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/Gitcoin-CoordiNATION"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come get involved&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/Gitcoin-CoordiNATION"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5942736357174656674-y.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="640" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5942736357174656674-y.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5942736357174656674-y.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/telegram-cloud-photo-size-4-5942736357174656674-y.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/Gitcoin-CoordiNATION"&gt;https://www.refidao.com/Gitcoin-CoordiNATION&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/hK2RLWmx-rA?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Gitcoin coordiNATION game is LIVE! 🎉 | Green Pill, Regens Unite, Metacrisis.xyz &amp;amp; ReFi DAO! 🌏🌍🌎"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/Gitcoin-CoordiNATION" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Join the game...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-hippies-nft-collection-has-dropped-%F0%9F%8E%89"&gt;ReFi Hippies NFT collection has dropped&lt;strong&gt; 🎉&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/loa_labs"&gt;LOA Labs&lt;/a&gt; launched the &lt;a href="https://medium.com/@LOA_Labs/refi-hippies-a-sustainable-nft-collection-on-stargaze-7e34d50df03e"&gt;ReFi Hippies NFT collection&lt;/a&gt; as part of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt;'s Earth Day drop with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/StargazeZone"&gt;Stargaze NFT platform&lt;/a&gt; 🌍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;✌️🏾Snag your &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFiHippie?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFiHippie&lt;/a&gt;, now minting!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Created by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/loa_labs?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@loa_labs&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BlackArtistFND?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@BlackArtistFND&lt;/a&gt; for the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/EarthDay?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#EarthDay&lt;/a&gt; NFT Drop with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/StargazeZone?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@StargazeZone&lt;/a&gt; and Regen Network 💫 &lt;a href="https://t.co/krFcHboXOc"&gt;https://t.co/krFcHboXOc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regen Network (@regen_network) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network/status/1649517119032426496?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 21, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-at-consensus-%F0%9F%8F%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi at Consensus 🏙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CoinDesk"&gt;CoinDesk&lt;/a&gt; brought together a hand-selected mix of DeFi, ReFi, and Institutional participants to sit around tables and discuss how blockchain can accelerate climate action. Regens had a strong presence &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/consensus2024"&gt;Consensus 2023&lt;/a&gt; with talks by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dave_fortson"&gt;Dave Fortson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/filecoingreen"&gt;Filecoin Green&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://consensys.net/blog/press-release/cop27-leading-technology-companies-launch-ethereum-climate-platform-initiative-to-address-ethereums-former-proof-of-work-carbon-emissions/"&gt;Ethereum Climate Platform&lt;/a&gt; 🌿&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;LOA’s &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dave_fortson?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@dave_fortson&lt;/a&gt; took the stage yesterday with some better world blockchain experts to unpack ESG, climate and blockchain.  🎤🌎 &lt;a href="https://t.co/vtMuSYFOHW"&gt;pic.twitter.com/vtMuSYFOHW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; LOA LABS (@loa_labs) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/loa_labs/status/1651983376285302784?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;“At Regen Network, we fundamentally believe that it’s our moral obligation to build a nature-positive future by 2030.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/erde_kette?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@erde_kette&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Consensus2023?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Consensus2023&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CoinDesk?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@CoinDesk&lt;/a&gt;’s Projects to Watch &lt;a href="https://t.co/5GSUoCODl4"&gt;pic.twitter.com/5GSUoCODl4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Regen Network (@regen_network) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network/status/1651971960295813120?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 28, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-regulation-%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%E2%9A%96%EF%B8%8F"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi &amp;amp; Regulation 👩‍⚖️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BL4SG_"&gt;The Blockchain Law for Social Good Center&lt;/a&gt; has launched the Earth month celebration by featuring insights on policy and regulation by key thinkers in the ReFi space 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;📢 More R&amp;amp;R (&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regulation?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regulation&lt;/a&gt;) from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/BL4SG?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#BL4SG&lt;/a&gt; Advisory Board Member, Cathy Mulligan &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/API_Economics?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@API_Economics&lt;/a&gt;! &lt;a href="https://t.co/48rtrtn7AL"&gt;pic.twitter.com/48rtrtn7AL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; The Blockchain Law for Social Good Center (@BL4SG_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/BL4SG_/status/1651722839974891520?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 27, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🇪🇺 The &lt;a href="https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/press-room/20230414IPR80133/crypto-assets-green-light-to-new-rules-for-tracing-transfers-in-the-eu"&gt;EU Parliament&lt;/a&gt; has voted in favor to pass the &lt;a href="https://kpmg.com/de/en/home/insights/2023/04/markets-in-crypto-assets-regulation.html"&gt;MiCA (Markets in Crypto-Assets Regulation)&lt;/a&gt; crypto framework.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤟 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin"&gt;ReFi Medellín&lt;/a&gt; becomes a new local node.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ToucanProtocol"&gt;Toucan &lt;/a&gt;launched the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RuspiTorpi/status/1649380815011213313?t=vuya6G8fyBb3wrb3ulg5TQ&amp;amp;s=19"&gt;Polygon and Cosmos NCT bridge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-ideas-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content ideas or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📈 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://particula.earth/en/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Particula&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: The First Data Platform For Digital Environmental Assets.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛢 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.carbonpath.io/"&gt;CARBONPATH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Permanently shutting down old oil and gas wells to keep millions of tonnes of carbon dioxide and methane in the ground.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧥 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.crowdmuse.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.crowdmuse.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;rowdmuse&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Digi-physical modular fashion collectibles for communities.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌱 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://plantgang.xyz/#/home"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PlantGang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: A decentralized community of researchers, educators, and explorers documenting nature onchain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏞 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.changeblock.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change block&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Making the creation and trading of environmental credits efficient, effective, and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="next-generation-quadratic-funding-with-joel-miller-%F0%9F%92%B0"&gt;Next Generation Quadratic Funding with Joel Miller 💰&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tune in to episode #109 of the Green Pill podcast with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Kevin Owocki&lt;/a&gt; to learn about &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CS_Synthesist"&gt;Joel Miller&lt;/a&gt;'s (PhD candidate at the University of Illinois Chicago) research on pluralistic quadratic funding, collusion resistance, and incentivization across social differences 💻.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ueQDnq-J2mY?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Next Generation Quadratic Funding with Joel Miller"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/greenpill/id1609313639" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-goes-into-making-carbon-with-nori%F0%9F%8E%A5"&gt;What goes into making carbon with Nori...🎥&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how carbon removal memes get made and how Gordon Ramsay can help you create a waste biomass lifecycle analysis in a rare ~video~ episode of Reversing Climate Change with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nori"&gt;Nori&lt;/a&gt; 🌊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6PuA_vxkILo?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="(A video podcast!) What goes into making a carbon removal meme?—w/ Nori&amp;#39;s Memelab"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="web3-grants-for-regen-projects-gitcoin-activation-station"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/web3-fundraising"&gt;Web3 Grants for Regen Projects: Gitcoin activation station&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 4th, online)&lt;/strong&gt;: ​Together with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/curvelabs"&gt;Curve Labs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt; is hosting an evening to talk about an exciting way to fundraise for your impact project through the magic of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;'s quadratic funding mechanism 🪄&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/web3-fundraising"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-28-at-8.47.33-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1859" height="927" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-28-at-8.47.33-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-28-at-8.47.33-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-28-at-8.47.33-PM.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-28-at-8.47.33-PM.png 1859w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/web3-fundraising" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="future-horizon-232"&gt;&lt;a href="https://futurehorizon.to/events/fh20232/"&gt;Future Horizon 23.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(June 8-11, Portugal 🇵🇹) &lt;/strong&gt;Experience four magical days filled with connection, community, and impact. 30+ dialogue-focused talks and panels, workshops, and co-labs. Thematic pods and focus areas. Musical acts and live performances. An immersive art program 🎨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/801706408?h=32e1afb886&amp;amp;app_id=122963" width="426" height="240" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen title="Future Horizon 23.2 Sintra"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://futurehorizon.to/events/fh20232/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="annual-global-sociocracy-conference"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sociocracyforall.org/sociocracy-conference-2023/"&gt;Annual Global Sociocracy Conference&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(May 4-5, online) &lt;/strong&gt;Join to learn the successes, challenges, and visions for a galaxy built on principles of equity, justice, and empowerment ✊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;May the 4th (and 5th) be with you! Let&amp;#39;s get together to learn about Sociocracy and join forces to become a force for good. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join us for an out-of-this-galaxy Sociocracy conference: &lt;a href="https://t.co/dJ09sKWwO2"&gt;https://t.co/dJ09sKWwO2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Sociocracy?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Sociocracy&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MayThe4thBeWithYou?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MayThe4thBeWithYou&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Sharedpower?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Sharedpower&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/powerdistribution?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#powerdistribution&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/GFgauPsLfH"&gt;pic.twitter.com/GFgauPsLfH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Sociocracy For All (@Sociocracy4All) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Sociocracy4All/status/1651701711189299203?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 27, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.sociocracyforall.org/sociocracy-conference-2023/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get tickets here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-4.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfind-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-ventureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;New gigs listed on &lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;ReFiJobs&lt;/a&gt;! 👇👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/job/902802-founding-engineer-de_plan"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-5.53.25-PM.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1458" height="330" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-5.53.25-PM.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-5.53.25-PM.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/Screenshot-2023-04-29-at-5.53.25-PM.png 1458w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;https://refijobs.com/job/902802-founding-engineer-de_plan&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;⚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;Thank you for reading! To conclude I wanted to highlight the quote by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Gallardo_Luchi"&gt;Lucía Gallardo&lt;/a&gt; on the true purpose of ReFi: &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;"&lt;em&gt;ReFi is about stripping away the consumptive or extractive nature of a lot of our capitalist financial instruments, systems, services and reimagining them to be regenerative."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic week friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AI is eating the world...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are at a major turning point in history. The largest corporations are accelerating their extractive business models through the assistance of large language models like ChatGPT. Over the last three months, 1500+ AI startups have emerged ingesting enormous amounts of data across text, image and video...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The problem is: These AI models are proprietary black boxes serving a small number of corporations who already have multi-trillion dollar market caps. As users we cannot inspect these algorithms let along govern them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In its current form, AI is only going to serve to accelerate the complex web of crises across climate change, biodiversity collapse and social injustice. This 'metacrisis' is growing in severity and complexity and we as a regenerative movement are losing out...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VH0_HV93_nM?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Digital Gaia — A network of AI co-pilots for a regenerative economy TL;DR"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="ai-for-regeneration-%F0%9F%A4%96-%F0%9F%8C%8D-%F0%9F%93%88"&gt;AI for Regeneration 🤖 + 🌍 = 📈&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this special episode, I have the great pleasure of interviewing my good friend &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rkauf/"&gt;Rafael Kaufman&lt;/a&gt; from Digital Gaia. Rafael is a leading AI engineer with a background at Google who has teamed up with &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nedharvey-digitalgaia/"&gt;Ned Harvey&lt;/a&gt; (Harvard MBA, former Managing Director of &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/rocky-mountain-institute/"&gt;RMI&lt;/a&gt;). Together, they are building a network of AI co-pilots to accelerate the transition to a regenerative economy. They are starting first and foremost in agriculture with a 'Large Land Model' for the entire planet's agriculture and agroecology. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With very little capital to date they have managed to build a fully functioning prototype that leverages the power of large AI models to assist a number of regenerative agriculture pilots around the world. Backed by Cerulean Ventures and Aera Force DAO, Digital Gaia is now fundraising on Gitcoin in the climate solutions round.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/-CaB2orgibg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Digital Gaia Canvas Demo"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href=" https://bit.ly/digitalgaia" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support Digital Gaia on Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="empowering-the-underdogs-%F0%9F%90%B6"&gt;Empowering the underdogs 🐶&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;These large models are made up of smaller models that help us understand the health of our soil and the possible interventions for regeneration. It provides local land stewards, land owners and project developers with the AI superpowers of Big Tech but does so in a &lt;em&gt;very&lt;/em&gt; different way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital Gaia is creating &lt;em&gt;open&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;governable &lt;/em&gt;AI systems that allow &lt;em&gt;anyone&lt;/em&gt; to inspect the models, assumptions and conclusions. In this way, we are able to lean into the powerful network effects created by the self-replicating AI models that gather intelligence from a huge amount of inputs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Given these AI co-pilots are being deployed in regenerative farms all around the world, this  approach allows a farmer with limited resources to understand &lt;em&gt;all&lt;/em&gt; of the intelligence across the entire network of regenerative farmers utilizing Digital Gaia. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a total game changer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://bit.ly/digitalgaia" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Learn more about Digital Gaia&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="breaking-apart-the-black-box-%F0%9F%97%83"&gt;Breaking apart the black box 🗃&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this episode, we cover the issues with the black box AI model, the risks presented by AI, and how it can be redesigned to accelerate the transition to a regenerative economy. Rafael spent six years at Google developing AI models and understand the powers and challenges of AI like very few in the regenerative finance space...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital Gaia is currently &lt;a href="https://bit.ly/digitalgaia"&gt;fundraising on Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; and is looking for collaborators across the regenerative agriculture, DeSci, AI and engineering landscape. They are a very conscious team of experienced leaders dedicated to rethinking land management, data usage, and incentive structures for a regenerative planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rafael has also been a contributor on ReFi DAO with his recent Mirror post "Regeneration: A strategic view" where he shows a completely different approach for building a scaleable, trustworthy regenerative economy using open data, AI and web3. If you're in ReFi and haven't read this yet, you're missing the edge...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://mirror.xyz/0x7340F1a1e4e38F43d2FCC85cdb2b764de36B40c0/-ijUF0RfXqL1WesyFvgU8zsepyP0QeXCaJjKnwYsYzA?ref&amp;#x3D;refi-dao"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Regeneration: a strategic view 🌍 📃&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;A strategic view of regeneration:current challenges, toolkit for strategic regenerative investment, and 7 steps to implement a regeneration strategy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://mirror.xyz/icon/favicon-32x32.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://mirror-media.imgix.net/nft/OFfVUuv0FxdF4QYjfwtNM.png?h&amp;#x3D;null&amp;amp;w&amp;#x3D;null&amp;amp;auto&amp;#x3D;compress" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="data-ml-regeneration"&gt;Data, ML &amp;amp; regeneration&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital Gaia is using advanced data analytics and machine learning techniques to optimize soil, water, and nutrient use while reducing environmental impact. They are working to create a system that empowers regenerative agriculture and helps farmers make better decisions that are more sustainable and regenerative for the environment, while also improving their bottom line.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Raphael, the Co-founder and CTO of Digital Gaia, has a background in applied mathematics and computational neuroscience and has worked for over 16 years in tech, including 6-years at Google, where he focused on search engine advertising and optimization. Raphael's interest in regenerative agriculture led him to co-found Digital Gaia with Ned Harvey, , where he is working to bring AI-powered solutions to the agriculture sector. 🌾&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Their mission is to create digital co-pilots for farmers that can help them increase yields, improve crop health, and reduce the use of harmful chemicals. By leveraging cutting-edge technology and data-driven insights, Digital Gaia aims to revolutionize the agriculture industry and create a more sustainable future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="get-involved-with-digital-gaia"&gt;Get involved with Digital Gaia&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here's how you can get involved:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Visit the &lt;a href=" www.digitalgaia.earth"&gt;Digital Gaia website&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about their mission and how they plan to achieve their goals. You can find out more about their innovative approach to regenerative agriculture and the impact they're having on the industry. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="👉 www.digitalgaia.earth" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Dive deeper into Digital Gaia&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Consider contributing to their Gitcoin grant before May 9th! By contributing, you'll be supporting the development of AI co-pilots for the regenerative economy. Your donation will go directly towards helping Digital Gaia create more sustainable solutions for the agriculture industry. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://bit.ly/digitalgaia" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Donate to Digital Gaia on Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spread the word! Share this post with your friends and family and encourage them to support Digital Gaia as well. You can also follow them on social media to stay up to date on their progress.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/AYM9p" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Click to tweet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;AI is eating the world...🤖☠️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fortunately folks like &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/_rkauf?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@_rkauf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nedleeharvey?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@nedleeharvey&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/_digitalgaia?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@_DigitalGaia&lt;/a&gt; have just given smallholder farmers AI superpowers. 🧠🧑🏽‍🌾🦾&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read post 📖 &lt;a href="https://t.co/NenqZa409p"&gt;https://t.co/NenqZa409p&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Watch TL;DR 👀 &lt;a href="https://t.co/HL8Pdnsy6j"&gt;https://t.co/HL8Pdnsy6j&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Listen 🎧 &lt;a href="https://t.co/l31fF1D8Li"&gt;https://t.co/l31fF1D8Li&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1/ 🧵&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; jE ❤️🌍🙏🏼 Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1653763623226060800?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 3, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="collaborate-to-regenerate-%F0%9F%8C%8E"&gt;Collaborate to regenerate 🌎&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's work together to create a more sustainable future. With the help of AI co-pilots like Digital Gaia, we can make a difference and create a better world for generations to come. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Go forth &amp;amp; REGENERATE!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or as Jimi says "LFGROWWWWW"!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post Except example&lt;/strong&gt;: Gratitude collection &amp;amp; Soulbound token applications in ReFi + the latest news, updates, jobs and events in ReFi and beyond!‌&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hello there, Regens!🌴‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/simplyQueenLee?t=pQiTdjJWfU1ptPxKJzvQrA&amp;amp;s=09"&gt;Lydia&lt;/a&gt; here, Strategic Communications Specialist — advocate of Web3 for sustainable impact through the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/_Web3Woman?t=q5vIPn77o3l4Zb-3igrnnQ&amp;amp;s=09"&gt;Web3 Woman Hub&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this week's edition of the Roundup, we'd be exploring the AI possiblities for a Regenerative Economy.                                                    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Screenshot_20230507-073414-2.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="720" height="526" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/Screenshot_20230507-073414-2.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Screenshot_20230507-073414-2.png 720w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Regenerative AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="emerging-technologies-for-regenerative-economy"&gt;Emerging Technologies For Regenerative Economy &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the global technological scene approaches the era of AI led innovations, it has become increasingly important to explore the potential of Regenerative AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regenerative AI is an emerging field that focuses on developing artificial intelligence (AI) systems that can learn and adapt to new situations, similar to how biological systems regenerate and adapt to changes in their environment.‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regenerative technologies presents the future of global technological advancements for a sustainable future. To fully achieve the key goals of the Regenerative Economy, it's important that we explore fully the potential of technology in the pursuit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="technology-for-regenerative-economy"&gt;Technology for Regenerative Economy&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Technology has played a critical role in the progress made so far for the Regenerative Economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since the inception of Bitcoin, blockchain technology has evolved from a digital currency to a broader platform for decentralized applications. Today, blockchain technology has been immensely beneficial in the promotion of the Regenerative Economy by providing facilitating &amp;amp; scalable technologies for projects to build ReFi solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The goals for a Regenerative Economy is necessary, achievable and potentially more possible by the invent of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At its core, the key feature of the Regenerative AI are :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;!--kg-card-begin: markdown--&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Flexibility **:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;  as opposed to the traditional AI systems designed to carry out specific tasks, Regenerative AI can adapt to new and changing system, as well as recover from failures and adapt to changing systems, making them suitable to carry out tasks like natural language processing, autonomous vehicle driving and so on.  
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Sustainability **:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt; Regenerative AI can be designed to maximize resources and reduce waste making them more sustainable than traditional AI system that gulps resources and produce alot of waste.
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Innovation **:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt; Regenerative AI systems are capable of learning and adapting to new systems, allowing them develop new solutions to problems. This makes them ideal for research and development. 
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!--kg-card-end: markdown--&gt;&lt;h2 id="regenerative-ai-%F0%9F%8C%BF-%E2%80%8C%E2%80%8C"&gt;Regenerative AI. 🌿 ‌‌&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the core of AI developments is the potential for intelligence, learning and automation, — all of which are immensely beneficial for the Regenerative Economy, but Regenerative AI presents even more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rather than develop intrinsically flawed and biased forms of AI, ReFi projects can leverage the already existing Web3 solutions and the emerging AI technologies to develop a thinly intersected Web3-Regenrative AI that can map, model, adapt and monitor the regeneration of Earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For instance, imagine a global network of soil and water sensors augmenting broad spectrum satellite remote sensing or a transparent Blockchain secured data network of over a million smartphones and drones with eyes on earth — this is the real motherlode of Big data, — a whole-planet full-spectrum dashboard gathering intelligence on living systems in real time, constantly available to observe, track and.analyze by any ReFi conscious individual or institution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now imagine this motherlode of data being fed into a Regenerative algorithm that embodies natural intelligence, nature’s co-operating instructions and 40,000 years of indigenous wisdom gleaned from indigenous peoples (less than 5% of global population) now stewarding 80% of Earth’s remaining biodiversity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will be nothing short of revolutionary — a living learning machine and will pilot the global pursuit for Regenerative Revolution, across the whole diversity of living systems and species: from whole bioregions to the hidden life of the soil; and from blue whales to beneficial bacteria, will be profoundly illuminating and radically transformative in a myriad of ways almost impossible to predict.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To achieve the major goals for the Regenerative Economy, we must apply natural intelligence, nature’s guiding principles, and indigenous wisdom gleaned from 40,000 years of home planet observation and ecological niche experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regenerative AI presents before us an opportunity to focus this natural, indigenous intelligence to protect, restore and regenerate damaged ecosystems and life-support systems across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Call to Action link?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyond"&gt;&lt;em&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="1-day-is-left-till-the-gitcoin-beta-round-ends-%E2%8C%9B%EF%B8%8F"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 day is left till the Gitcoin Beta Round ends! ⌛️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Did you already donate to other ReFi projects in the current Gitcoin round? If so, thank you! If not, don't worry - you can still contribute until tomorrow. Let's show our community friends some love and support!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="solid-world-is-setting-the-rule-of-play-for-forward-carbon"&gt;Solid world is setting the rule of play for forward carbon&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq"&gt;Solid World&lt;/a&gt; proudly introduces &lt;a href="https://www.solid.world/crisp"&gt;CRISP&lt;/a&gt;, a game-changing Carbon Risk Identification and Scoring Principles framework for the Voluntary Carbon Market. As a public good under a creative commons license, CRISP promotes transparency and collaboration by assessing 5 key risk factors in carbon credit deals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       ‌‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Learn more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="can-bitcoin-play-a-part-in-regeneration-%F0%9F%8C%B1-%F0%9F%90%9F"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Can Bitcoin play a part in regeneration? 🌱 🐟&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's amazing to find out that green Bitcoin mining can energize hydroponic garden and fish hatcheries too!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="also-on-our-radar-this-week"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also on our radar this week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;3-5 bulletpoint newsbites&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;🐣 Cool ReFi project did this cool thing this week &lt;em&gt;+ &amp;lt;link&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🤟 Cool news or update about something &lt;em&gt;+ &amp;lt;link&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="a-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-website-view-more"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;                 &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;  View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;feel free to cast some votes of your own and pick the top 5 but try to exclude ones that already been mentioned in the past 2/3 roundups so fresh projects are showcased&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;e.g. ⛳ ️&lt;a href="https://future.quest/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Quest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: a play-and-earn ecosystem committed to fixing our future. Part game, part launch pad for public good quests for our planet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="top-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="its-all-about-gitcoin-and-quadratic-funding"&gt;It's all about Gitcoin and Quadratic funding&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       Upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Podcast Episode Title (with Link) | Podcast Name + Host&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;e.g.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yTxY5kAfHKc&amp;amp;t=1s"&gt;Hypercerts.xyz with Holke Brammer&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🏛️ | Greenpill episode #43 with Kevin Owocki&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;1-2 headline newsbites with short and snappy narration&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="get-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-online-view-more"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;                 &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;  View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;Showcase ReFi Spring + other ReFi or Climate related events, meet-ups, webinars, or twitter spaces (3-6 max!)&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;! Please try not to repeat events from the previous week !&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       Upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;Pick a couple events from &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; and add any additional events you come across that are not already listed using this form: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event"&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;e.g.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="european-climate-summit"&gt;European Climate Summit&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(28 - 30 March in Lisbon, Portugal)&lt;/strong&gt;: Discuss carbon markets with experts, tackling challenges and collaboration for net-zero emissions across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Register for &amp;lt;link!&amp;gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;image&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-successful-regeneration-game-%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;A successful regeneration game 🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       ‌‌             ‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-jobs-%F0%9F%91%A9%F0%9F%8F%BD%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;ReFi Jobs 👩🏽‍🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="find-your-next-gig-at-a-leading-refi-venture-view-more"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Find your next gig at a leading ReFi venture...&lt;/em&gt;                 &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;  View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;Look for any new job postings on &lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;https://refijobs.com/&lt;/a&gt; (3-5 featured jobs) - if no new jobs then remove this section!&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;New gigs listed on &lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/"&gt;ReFiJobs&lt;/a&gt;! 👇👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;Screenshot each job and post them individually below while linking directly to the page!&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;e.g:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       Upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/job/773102-head-of-community-glo"&gt;https://refijobs.com/job/773102-head-of-community-glo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       Upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://refijobs.com/job/772394-social-media-and-messaging-lead-refi-spring"&gt;https://refijobs.com/job/772394-social-media-and-messaging-lead-refi-spring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the ReFi Jobs platform for more! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                                                                       Upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-newsletters-%F0%9F%97%9E"&gt;ReFi Newsletters 🗞&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="see-other-amazing-newsletters-from-the-refi-community"&gt;&lt;em&gt;See other amazing newsletters from the ReFi Community.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;NOTE - only include this section if there are any newsletters you find that have particularly interesting or unique content to share or if there is a new newsletter to feature&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some of the awesome newsletters that caught our attention this week:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;e.g: &lt;a href="https://web3climate.substack.com/p/venturing-in-refi-24"&gt;Venturing in ReFi #24&lt;/a&gt; by Aera Force - &amp;lt;&lt;em&gt;Description of the newsletter and what makes this edition interesting or unique&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌             ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="for-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-future"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌                        ⚫&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;friendly closing statement from author - could be a nice closing message or an intresting quote etc..&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;‌              &lt;a href="unsafe:javascript:void(0)"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;‌&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;a nice closing image&amp;gt;As&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there Regens! 🌱 &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/usama_LFC"&gt;Usama&lt;/a&gt; here! As a technical writer from the Global South who has been working in the Web3 space for the past year, I've had the privilege of working closely with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/commonsstack"&gt;Commons Stack&lt;/a&gt;.  I'm excited to be brining you the latest ReFi Roundup where we will explore the new concept of 'Non-Fungible Plants (NFPs)' as well as the top news and developments in the world of ReFi. Lets dive in!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-44.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-44.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-44.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-44.png 1024w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="going-green-with-nfps-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Going Green with NFPs 🌱&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introducing &lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/non-fungible-plants/"&gt;Non-Fungible Plants (NFPs)&lt;/a&gt; - the innovative climate-solutions project at the intersection of nature and technology!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before the internet, people used nature to communicate. For thousands of years, people have been carving symbols and messages into tree bark as a means of marking territory or conveying messages. For example, &lt;a href="https://www.atlasobscura.com/articles/did-native-americans-bend-these-trees-to-mark-trails"&gt;Native American tribes in North America&lt;/a&gt; often used tree carvings to mark trails, signal danger, or indicate where food could be found. It's fascinating how we've always been so connected to nature!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-42.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1333" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-42.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-42.png 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;A marker tree (Source: &lt;a href="https://www.atlasobscura.com/articles/did-native-americans-bend-these-trees-to-mark-trails"&gt;Atlas Obscura&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, by using Non-Fungible Tokens (NFTs), we're elevating this connection by combining technology with nature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NFPs combine real plants 🌿 and digital NFTs 🖼️ to create a new format for data storage that is literally carbon-absorbing. By using DNA data storage technology, digital files can be stored in plants in a way that never goes obsolete and can survive millions of years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-16.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="768" height="480" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-16.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-16.png 768w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The problem with traditional data storage methods is that they are energy-intensive and contribute to carbon emissions, which contribute to climate change. Moreover, digital files are at risk of being lost forever when technology becomes obsolete. The solution is NFPs - a climate-positive alternative to traditional data storage methods that absorbs carbon while storing digital files in plant genomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-37.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="918" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-37.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-37.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-37.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/image-37.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/"&gt;Traditional Vs NFP storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="how-does-nfps-work-%F0%9F%A7%AC"&gt;How does NFPs work?  🧬&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital data (0s and 1s) is converted into the language of DNA (A, T, C, G), and then transferred into plant genomes using proprietary processes. The result is a "biological backup" of an NFT that does not involve accessing private keys to NFTs or presenting any risk to NFT owners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NFPs represent a futuristic climate solution that combines art and science and promotes abundance over scarcity by working with plants' natural ability to pollinate and reproduce. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="grow-your-own-cloud-pioneering-the-future-of-green-data-%F0%9F%8C%BF"&gt;Grow Your Own Cloud: Pioneering the Future of Green Data 🌿&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;NFPs are the future of sustainable data and &lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/"&gt;Grow Your Own Cloud&lt;/a&gt; (GYOC) is leading the way! Using cutting-edge technology, they convert digital data to DNA, synthesize DNA, and create plant vectors for generations of NFPs. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-14.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="700" height="656" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-14.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-14.png 700w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Team behind GYOC&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;With NFPs, GYOC is growing a link between the worlds of Web3 and WebTree🌳 - the perfect harmony between the digital and natural world. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join them in supporting their experimental project &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/NFPGarden"&gt;NFP Garden&lt;/a&gt; and be part of the future of sustainable technology. Interested in joining our innovative climate-solutions project that combines nature and technology? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a look at the tweet below and leave a comment to get involved! 👇🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We&amp;#39;re looking for people who are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NFT owners&lt;br&gt;2. Love experimental art 🎨&lt;br&gt;3. Love nature 🌱&lt;br&gt;4. Are hungry to change the world 🗺&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drop a comment👇🏽Drop a like 👍 Tag a fren 👯‍♂️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want to collaborate with you to create something mind-blowing 🤯&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GitcoinBeta?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GitcoinBeta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/X5NWojJqsy"&gt;pic.twitter.com/X5NWojJqsy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Non-Fungible Plants 🌱 Gitcoin Beta (@NFPGarden) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/NFPGarden/status/1651566415382454273?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 27, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/non-fungible-plants/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Explore more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 id="non-fungible-plantsthe-future-of-green-data-storage-%F0%9F%8C%B1"&gt;Non Fungible Plants - The Future of Green Data Storage? 🌱&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before the internet, people used nature as a means to communicate. For thousands of years, symbols and messages were carved into tree bark as a means of marking territory or conveying messages. With the introduction of the modern digital technologies, this ancient practice has been lost of course. But now, connecting the digital and natural worlds, an exciting innovation look set to revive this connection in a surprising way...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-problem-of-big-data"&gt;The problem of BIG data&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The exponential growth of digital data is one of the defining features of the modern era with vast amounts of information being created, stored, and shared every day. However, this growth is not without consequences, particularly when it comes to the environment. The ongoing energy consumption required to power this data-driven world is substantial, and it is increasing at an alarming rate. Additionally, the hardware infrastructure required to store and process all of this data has a significant impact on the environment, with the production of electronic devices and their disposal contributing to pollution and e-waste. As our reliance on digital technologies continues to grow, it is essential to find sustainable solutions to mitigate their impact on the environment and ensure a sustainable future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="introducing-non-fungible-plants"&gt;Introducing Non Fungible Plants&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/"&gt;Grow Your Own Cloud&lt;/a&gt; (GYOC) is an exciting new green biotech company developing new clean data solutions utilising DNA data storage through plants!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; is leading the way! Using cutting-edge technology, they convert digital data to DNA, synthesize DNA, and create plant vectors for generations of NFPs. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Non Fungible Plants 'NFPs' combine real plants 🌿 and digital NFTs 🖼️ to create a new format for data storage that is literally carbon-absorbing. By using DNA data storage technology, digital files can be stored in plants in a way that never goes obsolete and can survive millions of years!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-37.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="918" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-37.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-37.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-37.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/image-37.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://growyourown.cloud/"&gt;Traditional Vs NFP storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;By converting digital data bits into the language of DNA (A, T, C, G), and transfering this into plant genomes using a new proprietary processes. The result is a "biological backup" of an NFT that does not involve accessing private keys to NFTs or presenting any risk to NFT owners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NFPs represent a futuristic climate solution that combines art and science and promotes abundance over scarcity by working with plants' natural ability to pollinate and reproduce. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As we marvel at the rapid advancements in modern digital technologies, it's easy forget the sophistication of nature's technology that has been refined and crafted over millions of years. While we often view these two worlds as entirely separate, new innovations are combining them in unexpected ways, creating new connections between modern technology and the natural world. Let's explore 'Non Fungible Plants'...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="thank-you-for-supporting-refi-dao-in-gitcoin-beta-round-%F0%9F%91%8F"&gt;Thank You for supporting ReFi DAO in Gitcoin Beta Round ! 👏&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;🎉 Thank you to all the amazing individuals who contributed to &lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/round/1/0xaa40e2e5c8df03d792a52b5458959c320f86ca18/0xaa40e2e5c8df03d792a52b5458959c320f86ca18-243"&gt;ReFi DAO &lt;/a&gt;during the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; grants! Your support means the world to us as we work towards our mission of realizing a global regenerative economy rooted in startup cities around the globe 🚀&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We are incredibly grateful for all the people that supported the emergence of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; Local Nodes, our grant, and all the other amazing projects during the past &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GitcoinBeta?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GitcoinBeta&lt;/a&gt; Round. 🙏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We feel truly inspired to be on this regeneration journey with you all. 🌱&lt;br&gt;/1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/ZZhU3NVeMb"&gt;pic.twitter.com/ZZhU3NVeMb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 #GitcoinBeta (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1656367109771784210?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;🎉 Congratulations to the incredible team at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin"&gt;ReFi Medellin&lt;/a&gt; for securing the top position in the latest &lt;a href="https://grants.gitcoin.co/"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; grant round. This is a fantastic accomplishment and we can't wait to see the positive impact they will make on the local community through their innovative work!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Congrats to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cryptochimba?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@cryptochimba&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiMedellin&lt;/a&gt; team for placing FIRST in  the latest and greatest &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; grant round. Extending &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; to Colombia. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The smartest funders all know where to find the best Bandeja Paisa in the world!&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Adam Carver (@adamcarv) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/adamcarv/status/1656328673111289856?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="huge-congratulations-to-all-the-awesome-climate-solution-projects-%F0%9F%8C%B1-%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;Huge congratulations to all the awesome Climate Solution projects 🌱 🚀&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌳WE DID IT TREEGENS🌳&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Still in shock to see just how much support we have gotten over the last 2 weeks. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;💚SO MUCH LOVE FOR ALL THE:💚&lt;br&gt;🎰Degens&lt;br&gt;🌱Regens&lt;br&gt;🌳Treegens&lt;br&gt;🌞Solarpunks&lt;br&gt;🌚Lunarpunks&lt;br&gt;🐝Beegens&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Congrats to the top 10 Climate Solutions projects too! 👏 &lt;a href="https://t.co/lE1Fd3wj92"&gt;pic.twitter.com/lE1Fd3wj92&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Treegens (🌱,🌳) #GitcoinBeta (@thetreegens) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens/status/1656305033355616256?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-summary-of-key-refi-topics-discussed-by-ivy-protocol-%F0%9F%8D%81"&gt;A summary of key ReFi topics discussed by Ivy Protocol 🍁&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A great recap from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ivy_protocol"&gt;Ivy Protocol &lt;/a&gt;of the development around ReFi and the carbon market, highlighting &lt;a href="https://www.microsoft.com/de-de/"&gt;Microsoft&lt;/a&gt;'s plan to sequester 5,000 tonnes of CO2 in 20 years and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/southpoleglobal"&gt;South Pole's &lt;/a&gt;report on significant trends in the Voluntary Carbon Market, and much more...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌍🌼 As the world celebrated Earth Day in April, the VCM, NBS, and ReFi industries saw an abundance of activity, both big and small. Our team at Ivy has handpicked the top 8 moments that caught our eye, each with its unique impact on the planet. &lt;a href="https://t.co/cJaSND3XBd"&gt;pic.twitter.com/cJaSND3XBd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Ivy (@ivy_protocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ivy_protocol/status/1655541065779232769?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 8, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="topl-short-story-building-impactful-web3-solutions-with-giveth%E2%80%99s-mateo-daza-%F0%9F%93%B0"&gt;TOPL short story: Building Impactful Web3 Solutions With Giveth’s Mateo Daza 📰&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; One of ReFi DAO contributors, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova"&gt;Tereza&lt;/a&gt;, wrote an inspiring story about &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mateodazab"&gt;Mateo Daza&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Givethio"&gt;Giveth&lt;/a&gt;'s Lead Engineer, who co-founded QuillaLabs for blockchain education and is active in EthColombia. With his Web3 and Ethereum Smart Contract expertise, Mateo is driven to use technology for public benefit and economic transformation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Loved interviewing &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mateodazab?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@mateodazab&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; inspiration. 👏 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;We can finally break away from the harmful narrative that one person’s gain must come at another’s loss. We’ll be playing a better game of life in the future, and that’s what excites me the most.&amp;quot;&lt;a href="https://t.co/xHfqB7pH9N"&gt;https://t.co/xHfqB7pH9N&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Tereza Bízková (:D, :D) 🇨🇴 (@TerezaBizkova) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova/status/1658102984059031553?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 15, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-45.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-45.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-45.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-45.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-45.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;🛞 &lt;a href="https://wheelco.in/"&gt;Wheel Coin&lt;/a&gt;: a free app that rewards you for traveling more sustainably.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌅 &lt;a href="https://www.sunrisestake.com/"&gt;Sunrise Stake&lt;/a&gt;: climate positive staking on solana.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌾 &lt;a href="https://www.thelexicon.org/"&gt;The Lexicon&lt;/a&gt;: a US-based NGO that uses evidence-based storytelling, strategy, and mobilization to build conscious movements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💡 &lt;a href="https://open-civics.super.site/"&gt;Opencivics&lt;/a&gt;: a consortium of civic innovators devoted to public service by facilitating a collaborative civic innovation ecosystem. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌳 &lt;a href="https://callirius.com/"&gt;Callirius&lt;/a&gt;: enable financing for high-quality climate solutions through a data-driven, science-backed, and well-regulated framework.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%8C%8D-bridging-the-gap-refi-innovation-for-global-challenges"&gt;🌍 Bridging the Gap: ReFi &amp;amp; Innovation for Global Challenges&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;🎧 Don't miss &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/a&gt;'s inspiring presentation at &lt;a href="https://fintechandfunding.com/"&gt;FFCON23&lt;/a&gt;, where he dives into how the regenerative finance movement is driving social, cultural, and technological innovation to solve the world's most pressing issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SVTpj81J_S4?start=142&amp;feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="FFCON23:  Keynote - Regenerate Earth"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/SVTpj81J_S4" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="measuring-climate-impact"&gt;Measuring Climate Impact&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;📣 Don't miss out an exciting discussion with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/LucasZgr"&gt;Lucas Zaehringer&lt;/a&gt;, project lead at &lt;a href="https://veritytracking.com/"&gt;Verity Tracking&lt;/a&gt;, as he talks about tracking emissions and reducing carbon intensity in complex value chains like biofuels and agricultural commodities. Learn about the various methods used to reduce carbon emissions and the challenges faced in collecting and verifying sustainability claims.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Oprqzpm5ch0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Measuring Climate Impact: Verifiable Traceability Solution for Carbon &amp;amp; Sustainability Markets"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&amp;#x3D;Oprqzpm5ch0&amp;amp;t&amp;#x3D;1063s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="turning-the-six-strings-of-regenerative-finance"&gt;Turning the Six Strings of Regenerative Finance&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get ready to be inspired! 🤩 Tune in to watch &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gregory_landua"&gt;Gregory Landua&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt; in action as he strums the six strings of regenerative finance. 🎸 Plus, catch the latest updates from Regen Network!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/kvVWpHA6k5g?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Turning the Six Strings of Regenerative Finance: A One Year Update - Gregory Landua -SBS Boston 2023"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&amp;#x3D;kvVWpHA6k5g" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rangi-chanya-regenerating-our-earth-refi-dar-es-salaam"&gt;Rangi Chanya: Regenerating our Earth (ReFi-Dar es Salaam)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(20 May in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania)&lt;/strong&gt;: A community event aimed at raising awareness on regenerative concepts and sustainability practices in Dar es Salaam. Join us in exploring the power of recycling and sustainable circular economies to create a more resilient future. Let's empower our local community to take action and make a positive impact on the world!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-25.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="948" height="644" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-25.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-25.png 948w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/skvdw45s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-spring-harare-refi-101"&gt;ReFi Spring Harare: ReFi 101&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(20 May in Harare, Zimbabwe)&lt;/strong&gt;: Join us at ReFi Spring Harare: ReFi 101, where we explore the powerful concept of regenerative finance and its role in creating sustainable economic systems that promote well-being for both people and the planet. Discover the latest advancements in technology and learn from local climate and environment experts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-24.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-24.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-24.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refi-spring-harare-refi-101-tickets-622462170107" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="refito-monthly-meetup"&gt;ReFiTO Monthly Meetup&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(24 May in Torronto, Canada) &lt;/strong&gt;Join us for ReFi Toronto, a recurring monthly event series designed to educate and inform the community about Regenerative Finance, Economics, and Web3. Explore diverse topics, from Circular Economics to Agritech and ReFi, and collaborate with like-minded individuals to create a sustainable and equitable economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-26.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-26.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-26.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refito-tickets-613467617157" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="meetup-on-biodiversity-and-resilience-for-regeneration-%F0%9F%8C%B1%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;Meetup on Biodiversity and Resilience for Regeneration 🌱🌍&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico"&gt;GreenPillMexico&lt;/a&gt; meetup on Biodiversity and Resilience was a huge success! A green revolution is on the rise as a community comes together to promote regenerative practices that nurture the planet and create a more sustainable future. 🌻&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌿🌊🌎✨&lt;br&gt;1/5 Inspiring photos from the Green Pilled Yucatan Peninsula&amp;#39;s first Meetup of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@GreenPillMexico&lt;/a&gt; on &amp;#39;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Biodiversity?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Biodiversity&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Resilience?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Resilience&lt;/a&gt;&amp;#39;! People gathered together to promote practices to regenerate the planet. Let&amp;#39;s create a more sustainable future. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Regeneration?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Regeneration&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/7xAu7gxgBs"&gt;pic.twitter.com/7xAu7gxgBs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Green Pill México (@GreenPillMexico) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico/status/1655321851646582788?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 7, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-munich-1st-refi-summit-%E2%9B%B0"&gt;ReFi Munich 1st "ReFi Summit" ⛰&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first major ReFi Munich event was a blast! Over 100 attendees, including ReFi investors, startups, and builders met at the beautiful &lt;a href="https://www.muenchen.mini/de_DE/home/content/aktionen-angebote/mini-pavillon.html"&gt;Mini Pavilion&lt;/a&gt; at the heart of Munich. The event includes insightful presentations by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/senken_io"&gt;Senken&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://callirius.com/"&gt;Callirius&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AgOperal"&gt;Operal AG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.water150.io/"&gt;Longhouse Foundation&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/de_ostrom"&gt;Ostrom&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-43.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="896" height="1254" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-43.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-43.png 896w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;⚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;As we wrap up, let's reflect on a quote by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/johndoerr"&gt;John Doerr&lt;/a&gt; that packs a powerful punch to remind us that the shift towards sustainability is crucial not only for the health of our planet but also for the economy. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;"Green technologies - going green - is bigger than the Internet. It could be the biggest economic opportunity of the 21st century."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-41.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="512" height="512"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Nature &amp;amp; Tech (Generated via Designer AI)&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic week friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hi Regens, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Foliage201"&gt;Cate&lt;/a&gt; here! 👋  I am a student of anthropology, communications manager at &lt;a href="https://www.openforestprotocol.org"&gt;Open Forest Protocol&lt;/a&gt;, and passionate GenZ advocate for climate action through emerging technologies. Today, we are exploring how &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Generation_Z"&gt;generation-Z&lt;/a&gt; can play a crucial role in integrating ReFi into our society and economy as we transform how we interact with people and the planet. &lt;/em&gt;✨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/gen-z-future-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1536" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/gen-z-future-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/gen-z-future-1.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/gen-z-future-1.jpg 1536w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;A future on a healthy planet- AI generated&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="time-for-the-re-generation-%F0%9F%8C%B1-%E2%9C%8A"&gt;Time for the Re-Generation 🌱 ✊&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collectively, we are at a unique moment in history. We have the monumental challenge of diverting course from the collapse of our environment and societies, yet we also have a generational opportunity to design &amp;amp; implement entirely new structures, systems, and policies. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generation Z will be a pivotal part of this transition. They are the future thinkers, creators, policymakers, and innovators of our planet. They are the first generation to grow up with a full knowledge of climate change and they will be the first generation to fully experience the scale of its impacts. They recognise the urgency to act now before it is too late. ✊🏽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/climate-activist-.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1333" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/climate-activist-.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/climate-activist-.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/climate-activist-.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/climate-activist-.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;So how might we create inclusive pathways for GenZ-ers into the world of ReFi and who are some of the Gen-Z ReFi leaders paving the way?  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%92%9A-mayarefi-phd-researcher-and-ethnographer"&gt;💚 Maya - ReFi PhD Researcher and Ethnographer&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mayazdentzel"&gt;Maya&lt;/a&gt;, who was always aware of climate change and sees humans as responsible for a thriving Earth, entered the crypto realm in 2019. She became fascinated with blockchain's potential beyond finance and is now a regenerative finance researcher at UC Santa Barbara.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;“We need more educational initiatives to appeal to all generations and cut through bad press. &lt;/em&gt;G&lt;em&gt;et out of the ReFi bubble and go talk to people in 'traditional' industries, be patient and avoid jargon.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/photo_2023-05-18-16.19.04-1.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="640" height="640" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/photo_2023-05-18-16.19.04-1.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/photo_2023-05-18-16.19.04-1.jpeg 640w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%92%9A-nikocommunity-manager-at-ecosapiens"&gt;💚 Niko - Community Manager at Ecosapiens&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nikokatsuyoshi?lang=en"&gt;Niko,&lt;/a&gt; an economics student at Harvard with a large TikTok following, delved into crypto and Web3 in 2020. He was inspired by blockchain's potential for social and environmental good. Niko is now the community manager at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ecosapiensxyz"&gt;Ecosapiens&lt;/a&gt;, emphasizing the need for clear communication and personal discussions to engage more GenZ in ReFi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;“Most young people want to make a meaningful difference against climate change, but  don’t know how to outside of activism. When I discovered ReFi, I felt empowered to make that difference for the first time.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/1626548251408-1.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="448" height="448"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%92%9A-montyproduct-content-lead-refi-dao"&gt;💚 Monty- Product &amp;amp; Content lead, ReFi DAO&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Having a mother who was pivotal in kickstarting the green consumer movement of the 1980s, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin"&gt;Monty&lt;/a&gt;’s drive to act for a positive climate future has been the foundation of his upbringing. He discovered ReFi during his final years of university, where he saw his interests in technology, economics, and sustainability converge. Monty began building his startup &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PeoplePowerFi"&gt;PeoplePower&lt;/a&gt; as part of his master's degree and thereafter connected with ReFi DAO where he now heads product development and content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"We have an incredible opportunity to build a regenerative future where humans, nature, and technology coexist in harmony. It is this mission that ignites a fire within me and fills me with a deep sense of purpose. I am acutely aware of the challenges we face, but I am equally inspired by the awesome people and organisations working on the solutions."&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/photo_2023-05-19-07.53.51-1.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="640" height="640" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/photo_2023-05-19-07.53.51-1.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/photo_2023-05-19-07.53.51-1.jpeg 640w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="we-need-more-gen-z-regens-%F0%9F%92%9A"&gt;We need more Gen Z regens 💚&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As global warming accelerates, the urgency to act grows. By improving education, communication, and opportunities for Gen-Z in ReFi, we can draw more future influencers to this area. They're certainly interested, we just need to spread the word! 🔈&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/#/portal/signup/free" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Invite Gen Z to join ReFi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/news.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="441" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/news.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/news.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/news.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/news.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%8E%89-the-first-refi-dao-forum-kicks-off-this-week"&gt;🎉 The first 'ReFi DAO Forum' kicks off this week!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join us on Wednesday, May 24th at 16.00 WET for a live, interactive, and first-of-it's-kind forum discussion about ReFi DAO’s governance roadmap and emerging community organisation structures. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://lu.ma/refi-dao-forum"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;ReFi DAO Forum · Zoom · Luma&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Join us on Wednesday, May 24th at 16.00 WET for a live forum discussion about ReFi DAO’s governance roadmap now that we have supported the early formation of 19 local nodes in startup cities all…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://lu.ma/apple-touch-icon.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format&amp;#x3D;auto,fit&amp;#x3D;cover,dpr&amp;#x3D;2,quality&amp;#x3D;85,width&amp;#x3D;1000,height&amp;#x3D;500/event-covers/1c/61173f25-24b8-41c3-a044-d2664d6a53c5" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/refi-dao-forum?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register to attend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%A4%A9-curve-labs-and-kolektivo-published-a-dmrv-research-report"&gt;🤩 Curve Labs and Kolektivo published a dMRV research report&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Featuring major ReFi players such as &lt;a href="https://www.regen.network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.openforestprotocol.org"&gt;Open Forest Protocol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.gainforest.earth"&gt;GainForest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://nori.com"&gt;Nori&lt;/a&gt;, and more, &lt;a href="https://docsend.com/view/avd6hzqqhfs2hp2p"&gt;this document&lt;/a&gt; shares the ins and outs of each custom MRV methodology in one place. An incredible resource for the future development of nature-based assets!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;"One cannot prove the unmeasured"&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;1/6 One cannot prove the unmeasured: For &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; projects, Measurement, Reporting and Verification methodologies are crucial 📏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In collaboration with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/curvelabs?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@curvelabs&lt;/a&gt;, we publish an &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MRV?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#MRV&lt;/a&gt; research report 📜 👇&lt;a href="https://t.co/3E8gx7BRgu"&gt;https://t.co/3E8gx7BRgu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Kolektivo (@Kolektivo) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Kolektivo/status/1659157195462701057?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%9A%80-solid-world-launched-their-crisp-scored-liquidity-pool"&gt;🚀 Solid World Launched their CRISP-scored Liquidity Pool&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq"&gt;Solid World DAO &lt;/a&gt;launched their inaugural &lt;a href="https://solidworldhq.medium.com/solid-worlds-crisp-scored-pools-explained-6fc2514c2b50"&gt;CRISP-scored liquidity pool&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xPolygonLabs"&gt;Polygon Labs&lt;/a&gt;, aiming to address major challenges in the sector by enabling carbon project developers to access much-needed funding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Carbon credits actors can now access transparently priced, high-quality supplies, initiating with &lt;a href="https://verra.org/"&gt;Verra&lt;/a&gt; mangrove pools to enhance carbon sequestration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;1/7 Today is the day! Solid World is excited to announce the launch of our inaugural CRISP-scored liquidity pool on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xPolygonLabs?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@0xPolygonLabs&lt;/a&gt;, a game-changing initiative set to transform the landscape of the Voluntary Carbon Market. 🌍🚀 &lt;a href="https://t.co/fKZwXgxmI5"&gt;pic.twitter.com/fKZwXgxmI5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Solid World (@solidworldhq) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq/status/1659228847412244481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%9A%A8its-officially-official-we-are-heating-up-wayyy-too-fast"&gt;🚨Its Officially Official: We are Heating Up Wayyy too Fast&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to a &lt;a href="https://library.wmo.int/index.php?lvl=notice_display&amp;amp;id=22272#.ZGzW2KXMJD9"&gt;scientific report&lt;/a&gt; of the &lt;a href="https://library.wmo.int/index.php?lvl=notice_display&amp;amp;id=22272#.ZGzW2KXMJD9"&gt;World Meteorological Organization &lt;/a&gt;published by &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-65602293"&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, researchers say there's now a &lt;strong&gt;66% chance we will pass the 1.5C global warming threshold between now and 2027. &lt;/strong&gt;Continued rising emissions coupled with the El Nino effect are shooting us quickly toward breaking a threshold of temperature, and climate effects, where there is no going back.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's take this as motivation to keep building 📢&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/bbc-2.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1896" height="1377" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/bbc-2.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/bbc-2.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/bbc-2.jpeg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/bbc-2.jpeg 1896w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next week's Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/projects-of-the-week-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="522" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/projects-of-the-week-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/projects-of-the-week-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/projects-of-the-week-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/projects-of-the-week-.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-58.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-58.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-58.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-58.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-58.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most-voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌳 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://gaiarefi.com/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gaia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: A pioneer in environmental investing on the blockchain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🟩 &lt;a href="https://www.mentholprotocol.com/"&gt;Menthol Protocol&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: the first Multi-chain sustainable Ecosystem making Web3 the first climate-positive industry.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💨 &lt;a href="https://carbonable.io/"&gt;Carbonable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;technological partner for companies to execute their carbon contribution strategy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🪙 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://cascadiacarbon.com/index.html"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cascadia Carbon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: tokenizing carbon-negative assets with CODEX, an evergreen investment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚡️ &lt;a href="https://www.jasmine.energy/"&gt;Jasmine Energy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: building climate asset markets that are accessible and transparent for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote Away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;‌ ‌‌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Project &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/refi-podcasts.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="435" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/refi-podcasts.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/refi-podcasts.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/refi-podcasts.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/refi-podcasts.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="%E2%99%BC-nori-podcast-reversing-climate-change-w-kevin-smith"&gt;♼ Nori Podcast: Reversing Climate Change w/ Kevin Smith&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rmkenyon"&gt;Ross&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nori?lang=en"&gt;Nori&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/the_english_butcher/?hl=en"&gt;Kevin&lt;/a&gt;, butcher and owner of &lt;a href="https://beastandcleaver.com/"&gt;Beast and Cleaver&lt;/a&gt;, sit down for a discussion about meat- more specifically, how we can ensure meat production is sustainable and the benefits of small, local scale operations for finding your favourite cut.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/s3e41-whole-animal-butchery-nose-to-tail-eating-climate/id1321759767?i&amp;#x3D;1000613495243" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen To The Episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/nori-sc.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1584" height="600" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/nori-sc.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/nori-sc.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/nori-sc.png 1584w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="other-%F0%9F%94%A5-podcasts-on-our-radar"&gt;Other 🔥 Podcasts on our Radar:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://pod.link/1609313639"&gt;Our 1000-Year Struggle Over Technology and Prosperity with Simon Johnson&lt;/a&gt; 🏛️ | Greenpill episode #114 with Kevin Owocki&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cryptoaltruism.org/blog/crypto-altruism-podcast-episode103-metis-and-nuvo-decentralized-digital-idenity-and-data-ownership-in-a-data-driven-world"&gt;Metis &amp;amp; Nuvo - Decentralized digital identity and data ownership in a data-driven world &lt;/a&gt; 🆔️ | Crypto Altruism Podcast Episode 103&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/refi-events-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="527" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/refi-events-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/refi-events-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/refi-events-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/refi-events-.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-59.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1000" height="339" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-59.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-59.png 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-summit-seattle"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refisummit.org"&gt;ReFi Summit Seattle &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(24th - 25th of May, Seattle, USA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Regens will descend on the Emerald City for ReFi Summit Seattle, the largest stand-alone Web3 + Climate + Energy + Governance Summit in North America!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://refisummit.org" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get Your Tickets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://refisummit.org"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Home - ReFi Summit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;ReFi Summit is the largest stand-alone Web3 + Climate + Energy + Governance Summit in North America. Our objective is to unite the community for two days, in person, in Seattle and mobilize our collective talent to solve the world’s most pressing challenges using Web3 technologies. Buy your Early Bi…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://refisummit.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cropped-icon-270x270.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi Summit - Gather. Innovate. Create.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://refisummit.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/cropped-logo.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refito-in-toronto"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refito-tickets-613467617157?ref=blog.refidao.com"&gt;ReFiTO in Toronto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(23rd of May, Toronto, Canada)&lt;/strong&gt; Join the monthly meetup of ReFi Toronto to be a part of a community engaging with and learning about regenerative finance!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refito-tickets-613467617157?ref&amp;#x3D;blog.refidao.com" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Check it out&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/https---cdn.evbuc.com-images-488335289-1401375356433-1-original.20230408-192324-1.jpeg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/https---cdn.evbuc.com-images-488335289-1401375356433-1-original.20230408-192324-1.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/https---cdn.evbuc.com-images-488335289-1401375356433-1-original.20230408-192324-1.jpeg 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add Event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="local-node-activations-the-first-refi-medell%C3%ADn-event"&gt;Local Node Activations: The First ReFi Medellín Event&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to our friends from the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin"&gt;ReFi Medellín&lt;/a&gt; Local Node for organizing their first IRL event, connecting with the local community. The first of many to come. 👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;First ReFi Medellin event ✅&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A lot more coming soon… &lt;a href="https://t.co/nhkqKgghcm"&gt;pic.twitter.com/nhkqKgghcm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi Medellín (🌳, 🌱) GITCOIN BETA ROUND (@ReFiMedellin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin/status/1659638858940555288?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 19, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="two-refi-events-in-tanzania"&gt;Two ReFi Events in Tanzania!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The incredible teams behind &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiTanzania"&gt;ReFi Tanzania&lt;/a&gt; successfully organized two events in Dar es Salaam and Njombe on May 20th! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Dar es Salaam event, organized by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Chatafisha/status/1660548807354974208"&gt;Catafisha&lt;/a&gt;, connected the local government, regenerators as well as students from Ndumbwi primary school and covered topics such as waste upcycling &amp;amp; management, deforestation and carbon emissions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Our first ever &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; event in Tanzania was nothing short of successful! We were joined by the local government, regenerators as well as students from Ndumbwi primary school who might be the smartest and most environmentally woke kids we ever met! Thread 🧵: &lt;a href="https://t.co/e72uOOQzAc"&gt;pic.twitter.com/e72uOOQzAc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; CHATAFISHA (@Chatafisha) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Chatafisha/status/1660548807354974208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The event in Njombe, organized by the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nia_org"&gt;Njombe Innovation Academy&lt;/a&gt;, connected the local community through &lt;a href="https://www.liberatingstructures.com/2-impromptu-networking/"&gt;impromptu networking&lt;/a&gt; and discussions at the intersection of regeneration and finance. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Learning and reflecting about 8 forms of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/capital?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#capital&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;br&gt; What capitals are we optimising for? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Listening from local &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/regen?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#regen&lt;/a&gt; initiatives and observing all 8 capitals flowing &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;amp; discovering local positive deviants: what behaviours and practices make regeneration possible? &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/DAD?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#DAD&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/PEhv1MPHyJ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/PEhv1MPHyJ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Njombe Innovation Academy (@nia_org) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/nia_org/status/1660679650459238400?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/refi-thanks.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="434" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/refi-thanks.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/refi-thanks.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/refi-thanks.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/05/refi-thanks.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;"Young people should be at the forefront of global change and innovation. Empowered, they can be key agents for development and peace." &lt;strong&gt;Kofi Annan, the seventh Secretary-General of the UN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic weekend friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text&amp;#x3D;Just%20reading%20the%20latest%20%23ReFiRoundup%20from%20%40ReFiDAOist%21%20Check%20it%20out%20for%20the%20latest%20updates%2C%20events%2C%20and%20jobs%20in%20%23ReFi%20and%20beyond..%20🌱%20https%3A%2F%2Fblog.refidao.com%2F&amp;amp;original_referer&amp;#x3D;https://clicktotweet.com&amp;amp;related&amp;#x3D;tweetdripapp" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there Regens! &lt;/em&gt;👋 &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KaicAnna"&gt;Anna&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin"&gt;Monty&lt;/a&gt; here with the latest ReFi Roundup! We'll focus on the highlights of the Gitcoin Beta Round, and recap the most exciting news at the intersection of climate, web 3 and beyond. Let's dive right in! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Untitled-design-164-.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1800" height="895" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/Untitled-design-164-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/Untitled-design-164-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/Untitled-design-164-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Untitled-design-164-.png 1800w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h1 id="gitcoin-retrospectivethe-beta-round-%F0%9F%8C%9F"&gt;Gitcoin Retrospective - The Beta Round 🌟&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.imf.org/en/Publications/fandd/issues/2021/12/Global-Public-Goods-Chin-basics"&gt;Public goods&lt;/a&gt; play a vital role in promoting the well-being and progress of societies. Yet in our current national economies, they are often underfunded and managed inefficiently. The &lt;a href="https://www.gitcoin.co/blog/introduction-to-grants-protocol"&gt;Gitcoin Grants Stack&lt;/a&gt; and the magic of &lt;a href="https://wtfisqf.com"&gt;quadratic funding&lt;/a&gt; provide an exciting new way of funding public goods and it's supporting whole ecosystems of new projects and initiatives. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-purple"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;❓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For newbies - What is Gitcoin Grants?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gitcoin Grants is a quarterly program led by the &lt;a href="https://gov.gitcoin.co/"&gt;Gitcoin DAO&lt;/a&gt; and powered by &lt;a href="https://wtfisqf.com"&gt;quadratic funding&lt;/a&gt; to help impact projects raise funds. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://support.gitcoin.co/gitcoin-knowledge-base/gitcoin-grants-program-1/what-is-a-grant"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;After a successful &lt;a href="https://www.gitcoin.co/blog/the-gitcoin-program-alpha-round-results-recap"&gt;Alpha Round&lt;/a&gt; at the beginning of this year, the journey towards collaborative and decentralized funding protocol with the evolving &lt;a href="https://www.gitcoin.co/grants-stack"&gt;Gitcoin Grants Stack&lt;/a&gt; continued. Even with sky-high gas fees on Ethereum Mainnet, the &lt;a href="https://www.gitcoin.co/blog/announcing-the-gitcoin-grants-beta-round"&gt;Beta Round&lt;/a&gt; concluded last week with over $600,000 being donated to public goods! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-49.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="600" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-49.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-49.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-49.png 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Within this round, there were a multitude of core and featured sub-rounds, each with matching funding provided by an array of awesome sponsors, including the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ethereum"&gt;Ethereum Foundation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gnosischain"&gt;Gnosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/supermodularxyz"&gt;Supermodular&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tecmns"&gt;Token Engineering Commons&lt;/a&gt;, just to mention some. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let's have a look at some of our favourite ReFi-related highlights and results. 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Web3 Community &amp;amp; Education&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Climate Solutions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Metacrisis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ReFi DAO Local Nodes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-55.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="919" height="603" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-55.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-55.png 919w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://gitcoin-grants.streamlit.app/"&gt;https://gitcoin-grants.streamlit.app/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="community-takes-center-stage-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;Community Takes Center Stage  🪩&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gitcoin embraced the awesome power of connection and collaboration by reintroducing the Web3 Community and Education round. It had the largest number of grantees - more than 200, and the second largest amount of total donations of over $300k!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Special congratulations to &lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/greenpill/id1609313639"&gt;GreenPill Podcast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TrustedSeed"&gt;Trusted Seed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/IMPACTOPIAearth"&gt;Impactopia&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt; for being some of the top-funded ReFi-aligned projects of this round! 🎉👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi DAO was fortunate enough to take part in the Web3 Community and Education round, with a grant supporting the emergence of Local Nodes around the globe. THANK YOU for all the incredible support, we are super grateful to be on this journey of regeneration with you. 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;We are incredibly grateful for all the people that supported the emergence of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; Local Nodes, our grant, and all the other amazing projects during the past &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/GitcoinBeta?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#GitcoinBeta&lt;/a&gt; Round. 🙏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We feel truly inspired to be on this regeneration journey with you all. 🌱&lt;br&gt;/1 &lt;a href="https://t.co/ZZhU3NVeMb"&gt;pic.twitter.com/ZZhU3NVeMb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🌍 #GitcoinBeta (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1656367109771784210?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="accelerating-climate-solutions-%F0%9F%8C%B1%F0%9F%93%88"&gt;Accelerating Climate Solutions 🌱📈&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;With one of the highest matching pools of $350k and 104 projects included, the Climate Solutions round gathered projects working on actively reducing greenhouse gas emissions (GHGs) or building foundational infrastructure for web3-based climate solutions. The Climate round received huge support from the community, gathering over $40k in donations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-53.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1796" height="820" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-53.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-53.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-53.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-53.png 1796w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Special congratulations to our friends from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens"&gt;Treegens&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AtlantisDAO1"&gt;Atlantis&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solarpunkdao"&gt;Solarpunk DAO&lt;/a&gt; for the amazing results achieved during the Beta Round. Sending loads of support! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌳WE DID IT TREEGENS🌳&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Still in shock to see just how much support we have gotten over the last 2 weeks. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;💚SO MUCH LOVE FOR ALL THE:💚&lt;br&gt;🎰Degens&lt;br&gt;🌱Regens&lt;br&gt;🌳Treegens&lt;br&gt;🌞Solarpunks&lt;br&gt;🌚Lunarpunks&lt;br&gt;🐝Beegens&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Congrats to the top 10 Climate Solutions projects too! 👏 &lt;a href="https://t.co/lE1Fd3wj92"&gt;pic.twitter.com/lE1Fd3wj92&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Treegens (🌱,🌳) #GitcoinBeta (@thetreegens) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens/status/1656305033355616256?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="confronting-the-crisis-of-crisis-%F0%9F%92%8A"&gt;Confronting the Crisis of Crisis 💊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inspired by the conversations between &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/owocki"&gt;Kevin Owocki&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/DanielSchmacht1"&gt;Daniel Schmachtenberger&lt;/a&gt; on the &lt;a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/greenpill/id1609313639"&gt;GreenPill podcast&lt;/a&gt; and the creation of &lt;a href="metacrisis.xyz"&gt;metacrisis.xyz&lt;/a&gt;, the Metacrisis round gathered projects fighting the totality of risk that our specie and planet are facing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;a href="forum.metacrisis.xyz (https://forum.metacrisis.xyz/t/creating-a-strong-attractor-for-addressing-the-metacrisis/466)"&gt;metacrisis&lt;/a&gt; highlights how the different crises humanity is currently experiencing are all interconnected and mutually dependent. These crises arise from the mismatch between our technological abilities, social systems, and fundamental values.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/WVEP0zAK-xQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="The Metacrisis with Daniel Schmachtenberger | Part 1 | Green Pill #26"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/round/1/0x8aa06b3b8cac2970857f4e0fd78f21dc01aade94"&gt;Metacrisis featured round&lt;/a&gt;, with a match funding pool of $25k and 69 participating projects was supported with 600 donations for a total of over $17k. Congratulations to &lt;a href="https://giveth.io/"&gt;Giveth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/round/1/0x8aa06b3b8cac2970857f4e0fd78f21dc01aade94/0x8aa06b3b8cac2970857f4e0fd78f21dc01aade94-5"&gt;Iris&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/mycelia"&gt;diosDAO&lt;/a&gt; for placing in the top 3 by number of donations, check out below for the full results! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://paragraph.xyz/@metacrisisxyz/metacrisis-match-funding-round-results"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Metacrisis Match Funding Round Results&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;The first Metacrisis match funding round run by metacrisis.xyz, a project of Supermodular, has concluded!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://paragraph.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Metacrisis Match Funding Round Results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://paragraph.xyz/_next/image?url&amp;#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fpapyrus_images%2F651963ba9ef7d36cfdefb0eb4b45b7cf.png&amp;amp;w&amp;#x3D;640&amp;amp;q&amp;#x3D;75" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;The first Metacrisis match funding round run by &lt;a href="https://t.co/uNsZcZegOg"&gt;https://t.co/uNsZcZegOg&lt;/a&gt;, a project of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/supermodularxyz?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@supermodularxyz&lt;/a&gt;, has concluded! Read the post at &lt;a href="https://t.co/JS6GfBuHXe"&gt;https://t.co/JS6GfBuHXe&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/Icsjr5oxlg"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Icsjr5oxlg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Stephen Reid ☯️ (@lunarpunk_0x) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/lunarpunk_0x/status/1656958677641830401?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 12, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-local-nodes-as-a-featured-round-%F0%9F%97%BA%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Local Nodes as a Featured Round 🗺️&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;For this latest Gitcoin round, we were excited to launch a dedicated &lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/?ref=blog.refidao.com#/round/1/0x64aa545c9c63944f8e765d9a65eda3cbbdc6e620"&gt;featured round for ReFi Local Nodes&lt;/a&gt; with $25k of match funding supplied from the ReFi DAO treasury. It has been incredible to see these Local Nodes coming together, activating their communities, and working towards the shared goal of local regeneration on the ground. 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-purple"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;❓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is a ReFi Local Node?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ReFi DAO aims to support a diverse and decentralized network of regionally-based local communities that share a mission to regenerate earth using the most powerful tools of our time. Going one step further, these communities may wish to become a ‘ReFi Local Node’—a local impact DAO that is fully autonomous yet connected to the network as a whole. Starting with simple meet-ups and events, local nodes may go on to acquire land and other real-world assets with the aim of growing a locally-based regenerative economy and community.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, without further ado, it's time to announce the matching results of the ReFi Local Node Round! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Social-Media-Post-1-23--1.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="836" height="1292" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/Social-Media-Post-1-23--1.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/Social-Media-Post-1-23--1.png 836w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check the full table &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1m4k2SpWC6LGAj79YojSGOcZFDVe4TSg3D0-Ch1GOHM0/edit#gid=1379920874"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;All the Local Nodes will be invited to join the co-creation of a Local Node cohort that will provide an array of tools and support for helping to launch successful Local Nodes. More about this coming soon. 🎊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, a special congratulations to the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin"&gt;ReFi Medellín&lt;/a&gt; Local Node for reaching the highest amount of donations in this featured round! 🎉🎉🎉  To celebrate their achievement, we will feature ReFi Medellín and their unique vision of regeneration in a professionally produced video and a special episode of the upcoming ReFi Podcast series dedicated to Local Nodes - coming soon! 👀&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Congrats to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cryptochimba?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@cryptochimba&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiMedellin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiMedellin&lt;/a&gt; team for placing FIRST in  the latest and greatest &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; grant round. Extending &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; to Colombia. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The smartest funders all know where to find the best Bandeja Paisa in the world!&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Adam Carver (@adamcarv) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/adamcarv/status/1656328673111289856?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 10, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would also like to celebrate &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiSanJose"&gt;ReFi San José&lt;/a&gt; for placing second by number of donations! 👏👏👏  To get a taste of the beautiful communities forming around ReFi San José, we invite you to read this inspiring article. 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://refisanjose.substack.com/p/welcome-to-refi-san-jose"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Welcome to ReFi San José!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;A ReFi Lab from Costa Rica to the world / Proud node of ReFi DAO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac166018-d538-4cd8-806e-78753186563e%2Fapple-touch-icon-1024x1024.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi San José | Costa Rica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;ReFi San José&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1200,h_600,c_limit,f_jpg,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7365c1ef-db05-4f8f-b4ce-707061ef7fc2_1500x500.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to all the Local Nodes for the terrific work and passion they put in during the past Gitcoin Beta Round. We can't wait for what's coming next and support you all in your unique mission. 👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="time-to-build-%F0%9F%8C%B3%F0%9F%9A%80"&gt;Time to Build! 🌳🚀&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Gitcoin Beta Round showcased the power of collaborative and decentralized funding for public goods while highlighting the importance of community collaboration and shared values.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The inspiring missions of regeneration driving the emergence ReFi Local Nodes demonstrate the passion and dedication of communities working towards a regenerative future. Congratulations to all the grantees for successfully concluding another Gitcoin funding round! Now it's time to BUILD as we edge towards the next Gitcoin funding round in 3 months - we hope with lower gas fees. ;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-54.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="468" height="477"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-newsbites-%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi NewsBites 🗞️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="em-stylebox-sizing-border-boxthe-latest-updates-across-refi-twitter-and-beyondem"&gt;&lt;em style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;The latest updates across ReFi Twitter and beyond...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-summary-of-key-refi-topics-discussed-by-ivy-protocol-%F0%9F%8D%81"&gt;A summary of key ReFi topics discussed by Ivy Protocol 🍁&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A great recap from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ivy_protocol"&gt;Ivy Protocol &lt;/a&gt;of the development around ReFi and the carbon market, highlighting &lt;a href="https://www.microsoft.com/de-de/"&gt;Microsoft&lt;/a&gt;'s plan to sequester 5,000 tonnes of CO2 in 20 years and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/southpoleglobal"&gt;South Pole's &lt;/a&gt;report on significant trends in the Voluntary Carbon Market, and much more...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌍🌼 As the world celebrated Earth Day in April, the VCM, NBS, and ReFi industries saw an abundance of activity, both big and small. Our team at Ivy has handpicked the top 8 moments that caught our eye, each with its unique impact on the planet. &lt;a href="https://t.co/cJaSND3XBd"&gt;pic.twitter.com/cJaSND3XBd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Ivy (@ivy_protocol) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ivy_protocol/status/1655541065779232769?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 8, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="topl-short-story-building-impactful-web3-solutions-with-giveth%E2%80%99s-mateo-daza-%F0%9F%93%B0"&gt;TOPL short story: Building Impactful Web3 Solutions With Giveth’s Mateo Daza 📰&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of ReFi DAO contributors, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova"&gt;Tereza&lt;/a&gt;, wrote an inspiring story about &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mateodazab"&gt;Mateo Daza&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Givethio"&gt;Giveth&lt;/a&gt;'s Lead Engineer, who co-founded QuillaLabs for blockchain education and is active in EthColombia. With his Web3 and Ethereum Smart Contract expertise, Mateo is driven to use technology for public benefit and economic transformation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Loved interviewing &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/mateodazab?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@mateodazab&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; inspiration. 👏 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;We can finally break away from the harmful narrative that one person’s gain must come at another’s loss. We’ll be playing a better game of life in the future, and that’s what excites me the most.&amp;quot;&lt;a href="https://t.co/xHfqB7pH9N"&gt;https://t.co/xHfqB7pH9N&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Tereza Bízková (:D, :D) 🇨🇴 (@TerezaBizkova) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova/status/1658102984059031553?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 15, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="submit-content-idea-or-feedback-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Submit content idea or feedback 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to see a story featured in next weeks Roundup? Or have any feedback? We would love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/content-feedback" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/02/ReFi-Cover.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="%F0%9F%94%A5-projects-of-the-week"&gt;🔥 Projects of the Week&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="ema-showcase-of-top-voted-projects-from-the-refi-dao-websiteem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;A showcase of top voted projects from the ReFi DAO website!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/projects" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-45.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-45.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/05/image-45.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/05/image-45.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-45.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top 5 most voted projects of the week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;🛞 &lt;a href="https://wheelco.in/"&gt;Wheel Coin&lt;/a&gt;: a free app that rewards you for traveling more sustainably.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌅 &lt;a href="https://www.sunrisestake.com/"&gt;Sunrise Stake&lt;/a&gt;: climate positive staking on solana.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌾 &lt;a href="https://www.thelexicon.org/"&gt;The Lexicon&lt;/a&gt;: a US-based NGO that uses evidence-based storytelling, strategy, and mobilization to build conscious movements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💡 &lt;a href="https://open-civics.super.site/"&gt;Opencivics&lt;/a&gt;: a consortium of civic innovators devoted to public service by facilitating a collaborative civic innovation ecosystem. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🌳 &lt;a href="https://callirius.com/"&gt;Callirius&lt;/a&gt;: enable financing for high-quality climate solutions through a data-driven, science-backed, and well-regulated framework.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votes have now been reset&lt;/strong&gt; so head over to &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations"&gt;refidao.com&lt;/a&gt;, make an account, and show some support to your favourite projects in the ecosystem this week! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/organizations" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Vote away!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-project-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi Project! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Have a project you want to add to our database? Click the button below to submit an application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-organization" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Submit project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-6.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-podcasts-%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;ReFi Podcasts 🎙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emtop-audio-and-video-content-from-creators-across-the-web-em%F0%9F%98%8A"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top audio and video content from creators across the web &lt;/em&gt;😊&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="%F0%9F%8C%8D-bridging-the-gap-refi-innovation-for-global-challenges"&gt;🌍 Bridging the Gap: ReFi &amp;amp; Innovation for Global Challenges&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;🎧 Don't miss &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/a&gt;'s inspiring presentation at &lt;a href="https://fintechandfunding.com/"&gt;FFCON23&lt;/a&gt;, where he dives into how the regenerative finance movement is driving social, cultural, and technological innovation to solve the world's most pressing issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SVTpj81J_S4?start=142&amp;feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="FFCON23:  Keynote - Regenerate Earth"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/SVTpj81J_S4" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="measuring-climate-impact"&gt;Measuring Climate Impact&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;📣 Don't miss out an exciting discussion with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/LucasZgr"&gt;Lucas Zaehringer&lt;/a&gt;, project lead at &lt;a href="https://veritytracking.com/"&gt;Verity Tracking&lt;/a&gt;, as he talks about tracking emissions and reducing carbon intensity in complex value chains like biofuels and agricultural commodities. Learn about the various methods used to reduce carbon emissions and the challenges faced in collecting and verifying sustainability claims.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Oprqzpm5ch0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Measuring Climate Impact: Verifiable Traceability Solution for Carbon &amp;amp; Sustainability Markets"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&amp;#x3D;Oprqzpm5ch0&amp;amp;t&amp;#x3D;1063s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="turning-the-six-strings-of-regenerative-finance"&gt;Turning the Six Strings of Regenerative Finance&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get ready to be inspired! 🤩 Tune in to watch &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gregory_landua"&gt;Gregory Landua&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt; in action as he strums the six strings of regenerative finance. 🎸 Plus, catch the latest updates from Regen Network!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/kvVWpHA6k5g?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Turning the Six Strings of Regenerative Finance: A One Year Update - Gregory Landua -SBS Boston 2023"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&amp;#x3D;kvVWpHA6k5g" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen to the episode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-1.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="refi-events-%F0%9F%AA%A9"&gt;ReFi Events 🪩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emget-your-refi-on-with-friends-in-person-and-onlineem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Get your ReFi on with friends in-person and online...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events" class="kg-header-card-button"&gt;View more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-refi-events-at-refidaocom-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Explore ReFi Events at &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;ReFiDAO.com&lt;/a&gt; 👇🏽&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="678" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/03/Screenshot-2023-03-20-at-11.48.15-am.png 2196w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://www.refidao.com/ecosystem/events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here are some highlighted upcoming events that caught our eye this week. Make sure to grab some tickets and support the ReFi regenerative renaissance wherever you are from! 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rangi-chanya-regenerating-our-earth-refi-dar-es-salaam"&gt;Rangi Chanya: Regenerating our Earth (ReFi-Dar es Salaam)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(20th May in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania)&lt;/strong&gt;: A community event aimed at raising awareness on regenerative concepts and sustainability practices in Dar es Salaam. Join us in exploring the power of recycling and sustainable circular economies to create a more resilient future. Let's empower our local community to take action and make a positive impact on the world!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-25.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="948" height="644" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-25.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-25.png 948w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/skvdw45s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-spring-harare-refi-101"&gt;ReFi Spring Harare: ReFi 101&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(20 May in Harare, Zimbabwe)&lt;/strong&gt;: Join us at ReFi Spring Harare: ReFi 101, where we explore the powerful concept of regenerative finance and its role in creating sustainable economic systems that promote well-being for both people and the planet. Discover the latest advancements in technology and learn from local climate and environment experts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-24.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-24.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-24.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refi-spring-harare-refi-101-tickets-622462170107" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="refito-monthly-meetup"&gt;ReFiTO Monthly Meetup&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(24 May in Torronto, Canada) &lt;/strong&gt;Join us for ReFi Toronto, a recurring monthly event series designed to educate and inform the community about Regenerative Finance, Economics, and Web3. Explore diverse topics, from Circular Economics to Agritech and ReFi, and collaborate with like-minded individuals to create a sustainable and equitable economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-26.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="940" height="470" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-26.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-26.png 940w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/refito-tickets-613467617157" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id="retrospectives-%F0%9F%91%80"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrospectives 👀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highlighted discussions from some of the exciting ReFi events going on across the globe and through the interwebs 🕸&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="meetup-on-biodiversity-and-resilience-for-regeneration-%F0%9F%8C%B1%F0%9F%8C%8D"&gt;Meetup on Biodiversity and Resilience for Regeneration 🌱🌍&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico"&gt;GreenPillMexico&lt;/a&gt; meetup on Biodiversity and Resilience was a huge success! A green revolution is on the rise as a community comes together to promote regenerative practices that nurture the planet and create a more sustainable future. 🌻&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌿🌊🌎✨&lt;br&gt;1/5 Inspiring photos from the Green Pilled Yucatan Peninsula&amp;#39;s first Meetup of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@GreenPillMexico&lt;/a&gt; on &amp;#39;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Biodiversity?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Biodiversity&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Resilience?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Resilience&lt;/a&gt;&amp;#39;! People gathered together to promote practices to regenerate the planet. Let&amp;#39;s create a more sustainable future. &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Regeneration?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Regeneration&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/7xAu7gxgBs"&gt;pic.twitter.com/7xAu7gxgBs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Green Pill México (@GreenPillMexico) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GreenPillMexico/status/1655321851646582788?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 7, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="refi-munich-1st-refi-summit-%E2%9B%B0"&gt;ReFi Munich 1st "ReFi Summit" ⛰&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first major ReFi Munich event was a blast! Over 100 attendees, including ReFi investors, startups, and builders met at the beautiful &lt;a href="https://www.muenchen.mini/de_DE/home/content/aktionen-angebote/mini-pavillon.html"&gt;Mini Pavilion&lt;/a&gt; at the heart of Munich. The event includes insightful presentations by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/senken_io"&gt;Senken&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://callirius.com/"&gt;Callirius&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/AgOperal"&gt;Operal AG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.water150.io/"&gt;Longhouse Foundation&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/de_ostrom"&gt;Ostrom&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-43.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="896" height="1254" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/05/image-43.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-43.png 896w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="add-your-refi-event-%F0%9F%91%87%F0%9F%8F%BD"&gt;Add your ReFi event! 👇🏽&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Got a ReFi, crypto, or climate event coming up and what to have it featured in the website &amp;amp; newsletter? Add yours to the database!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/submit-refi-event" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Add your ReFi event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-width-full kg-size-small kg-style-image" style="background-image: url(https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png)" data-kg-background-image="https://blog.refidao.com/content/images/2023/01/ReFi-Cover-5.png"&gt;&lt;h2 class="kg-header-card-header" id="thank-you-%F0%9F%A4%A9"&gt;Thank you! 🤩&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="kg-header-card-subheader" id="emfor-being-a-part-of-the-ever-evolving-movement-to-create-a-radically-better-futureem"&gt;&lt;em&gt;For being a part of the ever evolving movement to create a radically better future...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-emoji"&gt;⚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-callout-text"&gt;As we wrap up, let's reflect on a quote by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/johndoerr"&gt;John Doerr&lt;/a&gt; that packs a powerful punch to remind us that the shift towards sustainability is crucial not only for the health of our planet but also for the economy. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;"Green technologies - going green - is bigger than the Internet. It could be the biggest economic opportunity of the 21st century."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/05/image-41.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="512" height="512"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Nature &amp;amp; Tech (Generated via Designer AI)&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a fantastic week friends &amp;amp; we'll see you again next week 🫡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="enjoyed-this-newsletter"&gt;Enjoyed this newsletter?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We would be super grateful if you could help spread the word of ReFi by clicking the button below:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://ctt.ac/irWQc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share Roundup!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;From November 15 to 19, we are hosting&lt;strong&gt; the first ReFi Annual Meeting&lt;/strong&gt; for leaders of the regenerative economy ecosystem. Two days in the city of Lisbon, two days in nature in Alentejo, and a chance to be part of the largest tree planting in Portugal's history. Sounds exciting?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;On Nov 15-19, we are hosting the first annual meeting for leaders of the regenerative economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This gathering will take place in Lisbon during &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/WebSummit?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@WebSummit&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Two days in city. 🌆&lt;br&gt;Two days in nature. 🌄&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It is here we will host the largest tree planting in Portugal&amp;#39;s history 🇵🇹&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1/ &lt;a href="https://t.co/tgbrRXgRpR"&gt;pic.twitter.com/tgbrRXgRpR&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; ReFi DAO 🇪🇸 BCN (@refidaoist) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist/status/1677390585764909056?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;July 7, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-different-kind-of-gathering-%F0%9F%8F%99%EF%B8%8F"&gt;A Different Kind of Gathering 🏙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Right now, our world economy is driven by a small group of leaders—predominantly male and primarily from developed markets. Every year, they gather in Davos to plan and build relationships for the year ahead. But here's the problem: this excludes a majority of people from the networks of power that govern our world. Beyond the elitism and exclusivity, the Davos gathering lacks any tangible positive action during the event.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Meeting is different. We are gathering to plan, build relationships, and ultimately, &lt;strong&gt;take ACTION&lt;/strong&gt;. And this is what sets us apart. This is a call for you, our regenerative economy leaders. Stand up!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in participating? Be the first one to know when early bird tickets are available!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-342.jpg" width="2000" height="1334" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-342.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-342.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-342.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-342.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-398.jpg" width="2000" height="1334" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-398.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-398.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-398.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-398.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-353.jpg" width="2000" height="1334" loading="lazy" alt srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-353.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-353.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-353.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/07/poolsiderefi_krglvpht-353.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi Day @ ReFi Lisboa&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-largest-tree-planting-in-portugals-history-%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;The Largest Tree Planting in Portugal's History 🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inspired by the world-record tree planter &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen"&gt;Jimi Cohen&lt;/a&gt;, we are gathering on his birthday, November 19, to plant more trees in Portugal in a single day than on any other day in recorded history. We're partnering with forestry experts across Portugal and beyond to achieve this goal. Are you ready to join us and make history?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.thecitizen.co.tz/tanzania/news/national/environmentalist-sets-record-with-most-trees-planted-in-an-hour-4212218"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Environmentalist sets record with most trees planted in an hour&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;An environmentalist has set a new world record for most trees planted in less than 24 hours after he planted 25,650 trees, surpassing the previous record of 23,060.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://www.thecitizen.co.tz/apple-touch-icon.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;The Citizen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Hellen Nachilongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.thecitizen.co.tz/resource/image/4212226/landscape_ratio3x2/1200/800/9aa24772961b1d2eda1fc929471ef0d2/AG/environmentalist-pic.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-gathering-of-regenerative-pioneers-%F0%9F%8C%87"&gt;A Gathering of Regenerative Pioneers 🌇&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first part of the meeting will take place together with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt; on November 15-16 at a private venue in Lisbon. We're calling for an intimate assembly of local leaders and global pioneers of the emerging regenerative economy. Keep an eye on your inbox, regens, we can't wait to see you there!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-10.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/image-10.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/image-10.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-10.png 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="a-celebration-in-nature-%F0%9F%A7%98"&gt;A Celebration in Nature 🧘&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the second part of our gathering, we will meet at the world's first on-chain regenerative village—&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams"&gt;Traditional Dream Factory&lt;/a&gt; in Alentejo. It's just a short 90-minute journey from Lisbon. Here, we will come together as a larger community to celebrate life, take action, and of course, plant trees! Keep an eye out, tickets will be available soon!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-9.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/image-9.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/image-9.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-9.png 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="join-the-ecosystem-mapping-event-%F0%9F%97%BA%EF%B8%8F"&gt;Join the Ecosystem Mapping Event 🗺️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To prepare for the Annual Meeting, our community at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt; is hosting a day-long ecosystem mapping event. This will help us identify key partners and locations for our upcoming event. In collaboration with &lt;a href="http://AI.PT"&gt;AI.PT&lt;/a&gt;, the home of AI in Portugal, we'll be hosting a workshop to build prototypes using this data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://lu.ma/final-mapping"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Lisboa Regenerativa: Final Mapping of the Ecosystem &amp;amp; Prototype · Luma&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;​Join us on Saturday, July 22nd for our next monthly meetup Agenda 📝10:30 - 13:00: Mapping &amp;amp; Speakers &amp;amp; Wellness / Connection breaks13:00 - 14:00: Lunch &amp;amp; Networking 14:00 - 17:00:…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://lu.ma/apple-touch-icon.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format&amp;#x3D;auto,fit&amp;#x3D;cover,dpr&amp;#x3D;2,quality&amp;#x3D;75,width&amp;#x3D;1000,height&amp;#x3D;500/event-covers/nn/001968bb-5016-4294-a2bc-477f35e5a233" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/final-mapping" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Register Here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="building-a-network-for-action-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;Building a Network for Action 🤝&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are inviting committed local leaders from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/greenpillnet"&gt;Green Pill&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/FutureQuestDAO"&gt;Future Quest&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/_HerDAO"&gt;HerDAO&lt;/a&gt; to participate in this gathering. Together, we can build a Regen coordiNATION, combining our networks to take action on a planetary scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are encouraging everyone in Portugal to participate. Consider planting even one single tree! We'll work with plant nurseries to increase capacity in both urban and rural areas. This is a call for businesses, schools, and places of worship to host a tree-planting event in their communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/75424719_477598839767868_4784068271768862720_n-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1500" height="845" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/75424719_477598839767868_4784068271768862720_n-1.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/75424719_477598839767868_4784068271768862720_n-1.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/75424719_477598839767868_4784068271768862720_n-1.jpg 1500w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;em&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://www.traditionaldreamfactory.com/"&gt;Traditional Dream Factory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="sponsoring-a-brighter-future-%F0%9F%92%9A"&gt;Sponsoring A Brighter Future 💚&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you're a conscious corporation, we invite you to consider sponsoring a patch of trees. As we make history by planting more trees in a single day in Portugal than ever before, your brand can be a part of this significant event. We're also raising travel funding for leaders who otherwise wouldn't be able to afford travel to the event.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reach out to &lt;a&gt;rica@refilisboa.com&lt;/a&gt; if you're interested in engraving your brand's name in history.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="join-us-in-accelerating-the-transition-%F0%9F%8C%8E%F0%9F%8C%8D%F0%9F%8C%8F"&gt;Join us in Accelerating the Transition 🌎🌍🌏&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/susanne-hug.jpg" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1334" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/susanne-hug.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/susanne-hug.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/07/susanne-hug.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/07/susanne-hug.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are ReFi DAO—a network of leaders rooted in local startup communities all around the world. Our vision is to accelerate the transition to a global regenerative economy while building just systems to govern our shared resources. Over the last 18 months, we have supported 300 founders, hosted 73+ &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiEvents"&gt;ReFi Events&lt;/a&gt;, and reached over 60k+ downloads via &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast"&gt;ReFi Podcast&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Together, with ecosystem partners like &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen"&gt;Jimi Cohen&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams"&gt;Traditional Dream Factory&lt;/a&gt;, we can turn regeneration into a reality—one action at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tally.so/r/nGKZPe" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Request Early Bird Access&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hey there! &lt;/em&gt;👋&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Anna from ReFi DAO here, bringing you an update on all the events that ReFi DAO &amp;amp; ReFi Spring has supported this year so far, celebrating all the event organizers and giving an overview of the upcoming ReFi Events.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready? Let's GOO! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="refi-dao-supported-events-this-year-so-far"&gt;ReFi DAO Supported Events this year so far&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over the past year, an extraordinary wave of support from Climate Collective has enabled ReFi Spring to sponsor the orchestration of 27 ReFi events worldwide. This vibrant array of gatherings has played a pivotal role in elevating ReFi from being merely an online movement to a community that values and nurtures real-world human connections.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We stand in awe and appreciation of the diligent ReFi event organizers who have already conducted 9 vibrant ReFi events just this year. Their relentless efforts and the valuable time invested have birthed incredible connections through these in-person events. It's high time we raise a toast to celebrate their contribution and the enriching bonds they've helped forge in the ReFi community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;update pic below&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/04/ReFi-Spring-x-ReFi-DAO-7-.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;em class="italic" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Celebrating the first 10 grantees to receive ReFi Spring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 id="tereza-bizkovamedellin-colombia-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B4happened"&gt;Tereza Bizkova - Medellin, Colombia 🇨🇴 - Happened&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;During &lt;strong&gt;"Blockchain for Good? Medellín, meet ReFi!"&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova"&gt;Tereza Bizkova&lt;/a&gt; introduced ReFi and delved into particular blockchain applications for the first time in Medellín, Colombia. She achieved her goal of promoting and raising awareness about ReFi while highlighting its potential benefits for social good. Find out more about her successful event below! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $450&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x42D47645130B5A57FE5a3d06b3Fc464D6dC9b400"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x42D47645130B5A57FE5a3d06b3Fc464D6dC9b400&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Regenerative Finance is all about creating systems that regenerate their resource capacity over time. 🍃📈&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Yesterday, we hosted a great &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; event at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HASHHOUSECLUB?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@HASHHOUSECLUB&lt;/a&gt;  in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Medellin?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#Medellin&lt;/a&gt; with the support of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt;. How did it go and what were the key takeaways? 👇 &lt;a href="https://t.co/nJRej7Grji"&gt;pic.twitter.com/nJRej7Grji&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Tereza Bízková (:D, :D) 🇨🇴 (@TerezaBizkova) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TerezaBizkova/status/1638941735794651136?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;March 23, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="cyrille-frank-teukamdouala-cameroon-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B2info-in-telegram"&gt;Cyrille Frank Teukam - Douala, Cameroon 🇨🇲  - info in Telegram&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tecyfra"&gt;Cyrille Frank Teukam&lt;/a&gt; is returning with the "Cameroon ReFi Talk Series" to establish connections between ReFi-related initiatives and promote their impact through collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x226Bd17e0666AFCF75A1Ab414aA8F1eA0f0A6f4a"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x226Bd17e0666AFCF75A1Ab414aA8F1eA0f0A6f4a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="fr" dir="ltr"&gt;🌍📣 Rejoignez-nous pour un évènement captivant sur l'entreprenariat éco-responsable et la finance régénérative, soutenant les communautés locales ! 🌿💼&lt;br&gt;📅 Date: samedi 13 mai&lt;br&gt;⏰ Heure: 10h30 (heure de Douala)&lt;br&gt;📍 Lieu: Akwa, 2 églises, Hibis Academy, face station MRS &lt;a href="https://t.co/2sUoGpwqak"&gt;pic.twitter.com/2sUoGpwqak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Cyrille Frank TEUKAM 🌐 (@tecyfra) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tecyfra/status/1655979828498034689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;pictures and description in the ReFi Spring telegram group&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="felix-fritschreichenau-an-der-rax-austria-%F0%9F%87%A6%F0%9F%87%B9happened"&gt;Felix Fritsch - Reichenau an der Rax, Austria 🇦🇹 - happened&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second edition of Solarpunk Now! organized by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/FelixFritsch2"&gt;Felix Fritsch&lt;/a&gt; at the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CCommonsHub"&gt;Crypto Commons Hub&lt;/a&gt; has been an absolute success. Featuring agricultural IoT initiatives, permaculture training sessions, solarpunk art and design, all with a focus on ReFi, the event has fostered deep connections between the participants. Make sure to check out how it went! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1000&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xDfB0b22940Cc45283D639D22ba26aa55ab8Bfee8"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xDfB0b22940Cc45283D639D22ba26aa55ab8Bfee8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Solarpunk Now has ended, but its results remain ingrained in the Hub - Our new FarmBot is ready to plant! &lt;a href="https://t.co/uqe80XVa2F"&gt;pic.twitter.com/uqe80XVa2F&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Crypto Commons Association (@CCommonsHub) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CCommonsHub/status/1645008410428026882?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 9, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="susanne-zapel%C3%A3o-shauna-butterlylisboa-portugal-%F0%9F%87%B5%F0%9F%87%B9happened"&gt;Susanne Zapelão &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly - Lisboa, Portugal 🇵🇹 - happened&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi Lisboa has been organizing regular monthly events to gather the ReFi community and build strong relationships between people sharing the mission of  regeneration. Congratulations to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SZapelao"&gt;Susanne Zapelão&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly for the wonderful organization! Check out the pictures of the latest ReFi Day event! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1500&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x9871A7F7eDA940Aaa5313347eA84EC667Dd6eC46"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x9871A7F7eDA940Aaa5313347eA84EC667Dd6eC46&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;It was an amazing Day at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/PoolsideLisbon?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#PoolsideLisbon&lt;/a&gt; Opening Week with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiLisboa&lt;/a&gt;! 🎉 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@climateXcrypto&lt;/a&gt;'s Regeneration talk, yoga &amp;amp; meditation workshops, to the Networking lunch &amp;amp; DJ night—big thanks to everyone involved! 🙌&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stay tuned to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideCo?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@PoolsideCo&lt;/a&gt; for upcoming events! ✨ &lt;a href="https://t.co/uFwpdcOJo7"&gt;pic.twitter.com/uFwpdcOJo7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Poolside, Web3 ecosystem (@PoolsideCo) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/PoolsideCo/status/1647204459347312641?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;April 15, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="greenpill-festivalpranavgorkana-indiahappened"&gt;GreenPill Festival - Pranav -Gorkana, India - happened&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x1CD0b6D58A1de5E8AEe4C64D5e2b0F09e41D4bbC"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x1CD0b6D58A1de5E8AEe4C64D5e2b0F09e41D4bbC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="karla-c%C3%B3rdoba-brenescosta-rica-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B7happened"&gt;Karla Córdoba-Brenes - Costa Rica 🇨🇷 - happened&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verano ReFi Costa Rica 2023 will bring ReFi to the rural areas first, prioritizing events organized by CofiBlocks and Verdes in Poás de Alajuela and Monteverde. These regions traditionally experience a lack of educational opportunities, especially those related to technology, impact and innovation. There will also digital events focused on women and organized by Ruta Ruda, with the aim to create new opportunities for women to free themselves from workplace harassment by learning web3 tools and co-creating ReFi-inspired collaborative businesses. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xccf05CF889DFfBd44FAFb0e25E3EF4850881b0ac"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xccf05CF889DFfBd44FAFb0e25E3EF4850881b0ac&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add this one &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and article in English: &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/visiting-refi-costa-rica/"&gt;https://blog.refidao.com/visiting-refi-costa-rica/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="es" dir="ltr"&gt;El pasado 23 y 24 de junio de 2023 se llevó a cabo el I Encuentro ReFi Costa Rica 2023, con la participación de +30 personas y organizaciones que impulsan las finanzas regenerativas desde todos los rincones de nuestro país. &lt;a href="https://t.co/2fjGCx3E5v"&gt;https://t.co/2fjGCx3E5v&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/dbmzY2ICbJ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/dbmzY2ICbJ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— ReFi Costa Rica 🌱 (@ReFiCostaRica_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiCostaRica_/status/1676054871026409473?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;July 4, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="machuche-simaliketanzania-%F0%9F%87%B9%F0%9F%87%BFhappened"&gt;Machuche Simalike - Tanzania 🇹🇿 - happened&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through the Rangi Chanya event community members will be able to be onboarded to web 3 discover different opportunities for them to not only earn a living but also simultaneously take part in impacting their community positively. But also through the dApp they will get a chance to add value to their impact and personal lives through incentives (such as the plastic credits) and have more power to run their lives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;organizer: Simalike @chatafisha Organizer's Twitter: @machuche_&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $625&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://safe.celo.org/mainnet:0x78fAeCD5e33141B47b99a075aaD83f885431E297/transactions/tx?id=multisig_0x78fAeCD5e33141B47b99a075aaD83f885431E297_0xd5a2ea4dd5a57d613e221176d8c08cb7c85d1409395ab6ec8074b38c9cb7e59b"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;transaction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Our first ever &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; event in Tanzania was nothing short of successful! We were joined by the local government, regenerators as well as students from Ndumbwi primary school who might be the smartest and most environmentally woke kids we ever met! Thread 🧵: &lt;a href="https://t.co/e72uOOQzAc"&gt;pic.twitter.com/e72uOOQzAc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— CHATAFISHA (@Chatafisha) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Chatafisha/status/1660548807354974208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;May 22, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="susana-gonzalezvenezuela"&gt;Susana Gonzalez - Venezuela&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;add description&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;add pictures&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $625&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x441ac4115937f4Add72D0D249dE17E69AA996D03"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x441ac4115937f4Add72D0D249dE17E69AA996D03&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Here we are the first &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RefiVenezuela?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@RefiVenezuela&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/twist_studio?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@twist_studio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thanks for all the support &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/asilodigital?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@asilodigital&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@refidaoist&lt;/a&gt; @RefiSpring &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ETHVenezuela?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ETHVenezuela&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/web3beach?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@web3beach&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ImpactScope?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ImpactScope&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/kZAhme1mDD"&gt;pic.twitter.com/kZAhme1mDD&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Susana González (@SuaNex) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SuaNex/status/1669726712618180611?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;June 16, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="kuzy-muvezwaharare-zimbabwe-%F0%9F%87%BF%F0%9F%87%BCdidnt-hear-from-him"&gt;Kuzy Muvezwa - Harare, Zimbabwe 🇿🇼  - didn't hear from him&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KuzyTheAwsomest"&gt;Kuzy Muvezwa&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/builtndifferent"&gt;BuiltDifferent&lt;/a&gt; organizing "ReFi 101" – an event intended to gather individuals interested in Web 3, as well as developers, enthusiasts, and founders who are eager to learn and incorporate ReFi technology in Africa. This event is a fantastic opportunity to gain valuable insights and make significant strides towards the future of ReFi technology, while contributing to the development of the ecosystem&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250 - checked&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x7Da85a5Ca2DdE1A097F44ee4B081274014993560"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x7Da85a5Ca2DdE1A097F44ee4B081274014993560&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;look for a contact to get in touch with Kuzy&amp;gt; contacted him on Twitter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="upcoming-refi-events"&gt;Upcoming ReFi Events&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;introduction&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;events&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="timothy-goudzandparamaribo-suriname-%F0%9F%87%B8%F0%9F%87%B7info-in-telegram"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Timothy Goudzand - Paramaribo, Suriname &lt;/strong&gt;🇸🇷 - info in Telegram&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/GoudzandT"&gt;Timothy Goudzand&lt;/a&gt;, founder of  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/INFINITRI_IO"&gt;Infinitri&lt;/a&gt;, is planning another exciting event - "Innovators Buzz", aimed at bringing together innovative thinkers in web3. The primary objective of this event, which is being organized for the second time, is to foster connections among web 3 enthusiasts and encourage them to envision a sustainable and resilient future for Suriname. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;Add information from Telegram&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x2c26F0A08b667c279Fe90cD4ed81e7fa9328FF50"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x2c26F0A08b667c279Fe90cD4ed81e7fa9328FF50&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="cyrille-frank-teukamdouala-cameroon-%F0%9F%87%A8%F0%9F%87%B2info-in-telegram-share-the-one-coming-up"&gt;Cyrille Frank Teukam - Douala, Cameroon 🇨🇲  - info in Telegram, share the one coming up &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="showncape-town-south-africa-%F0%9F%87%BF%F0%9F%87%A6event-coming-up"&gt;Shown - Cape Town, South Africa 🇿🇦 - event coming up&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make sure to keep up with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRegennshawn"&gt;Shawn&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ixoworld"&gt;IXO&lt;/a&gt; as he leads the way in ReFi innovation at "ReFi Autumn Cape Town 2023" in South Africa. The event is designed to spark discussions on Web3 and ReFi among unemployed youth by uniting a coalition of organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xD0352D08AA93C9bc9C79d2B3a53846DCd7c9cb92"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xD0352D08AA93C9bc9C79d2B3a53846DCd7c9cb92&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;feature this event coming up&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/reficapetown/status/1676862478108467200"&gt;https://twitter.com/reficapetown/status/1676862478108467200&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="adaeze-okaforlagos-nigeria-%F0%9F%87%B3%F0%9F%87%ACcoming-up"&gt;Adaeze Okafor - Lagos, Nigeria 🇳🇬  - coming up&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="Aida_Regen"&gt;Adaeze&lt;/a&gt; is a passionate leader from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refibysouth"&gt;ReFi by South&lt;/a&gt;, who is currently at the forefront of organizing the impactful event, "Educating Nigeria Women in Climate and Web 3". The event will focus on crucial topics such as extreme weather conditions, climate adaptation policies, and bridging the gender-based digital divide. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xd351E7184211116a9B756DcBc4979d82b6fe47ca"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0xd351E7184211116a9B756DcBc4979d82b6fe47ca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;add information she sent me on Telegram&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="susanne-zapel%C3%A3o-shauna-butterlylisboa-portugal-%F0%9F%87%B5%F0%9F%87%B9happened-and-coming-up"&gt;Susanne Zapelão &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly - Lisboa, Portugal 🇵🇹 - happened and coming up&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi Lisboa has been organizing regular monthly events to gather the ReFi community and build strong relationships between people sharing the mission of  regeneration. Congratulations to &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SZapelao"&gt;Susanne Zapelão&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; Shauna Butterly for the wonderful organization! Check out the pictures of the latest ReFi Day event! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="kennedy-nganganairobi-kenya-%F0%9F%87%B0%F0%9F%87%AAcoming-up"&gt;Kennedy Ng'ang'a - Nairobi, Kenya 🇰🇪 - coming up&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/shambanetwork"&gt;Shamba Network&lt;/a&gt;, a startup led by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KennedyWNganga"&gt;Kennedy Ng'ang'a&lt;/a&gt; is working to building measurement, reporting, and verification (MRV) tools accessible to small farmers. Adter the successful gathering of last year, Kennedy is organizing the second edition of ReFi Kenya. The event will introduce local farmers to ReFi principles and foster the development of projects on the ground.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Grant received:&lt;/strong&gt; $1250&lt;br&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;See transaction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x006727868eD1B88c0Dd1c89286Da306c80363C91"&gt;https://explorer.celo.org/mainnet/address/0x006727868eD1B88c0Dd1c89286Da306c80363C91&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;future: add this one: &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiKenya/status/1678754213776756737"&gt;https://twitter.com/ReFiKenya/status/1678754213776756737&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And add it to the event page&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3 id="javier-delgadomargarita-venezuela-tbd-%F0%9F%87%BB%F0%9F%87%AAcoming-up"&gt;Javier Delgado - Margarita, Venezuela (TBD) 🇻🇪 - coming up&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Javier Delgado (https://twitter.com/polkajavier1) of Vostadg (twitter.com/vostadg) will be creating partnerships with indigenous communities, women's groups, LGBTIQ+ community and other minorities. We will have a live sign language translator, we will also include public schools and high schools as well as community brigades, housewives and the general public, our event is meant to be inclusive at all times.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;call to action - Add your ReFi Event to ReFi DAO&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-35.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1307" height="482" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/image-35.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/07/image-35.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/image-35.png 1307w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Submit your event: https://www.refidao.com/community/events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;ReFi Spring becomes ReFi Events&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/ReFi-Events-Transparent.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/07/ReFi-Events-Transparent.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/07/ReFi-Events-Transparent.png 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;Conclusion&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;What's good Refi Nation! 👋&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KaicAnna"&gt;Anna&lt;/a&gt; here, bringing you an overview of the latest ReFi Podcast episode. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/a&gt; recently sat down with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/timmoreton"&gt;Tim Moreton&lt;/a&gt;, a seasoned engineer with an impressive lineage from Cambridge University to Apple, now CEO at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cLabs"&gt;cLabs&lt;/a&gt;. What drew him to cLabs? &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg"&gt;Celo&lt;/a&gt;'s groundbreaking mission, intricately designed with a mobile-first approach to create prosperity for all.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://anchor.fm/refipodcast/embed/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" height="102px" width="400px" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/refipodcast/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen 🎧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As we journey through Celo's early days and its technical pivots a compelling narrative emerges around the '&lt;a href="https://www.ultragreen.money/"&gt;Ultragreen Money&lt;/a&gt;' meme. With eco-consciousness at its core, Celo plans to launch a protocol fee, focused on supporting global climate projects. Backed by the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/clim8collective"&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/RockyMtnInst"&gt;Rocky Mountain Institute&lt;/a&gt;, the goal is clear: direct capital to where it makes a positive impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Let's have a look at the topics covered in this ReFi Podcast episode, shall we? &lt;/em&gt;👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="clabs-and-the-celo-ecosystem-%F0%9F%A4%9D"&gt;cLabs And The Celo Ecosystem 🤝&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-3.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1296" height="649" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/09/image-3.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/09/image-3.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-3.png 1296w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cLabs"&gt;cLabs&lt;/a&gt; stands as the main contributor to the Celo platform, with its core focus rooted in product development and engineering. Working extensively with the public goods that form the &lt;a href="https://docs.celo.org/learn/celo-stack"&gt;Celo Stack&lt;/a&gt;, their involvement ranges from the foundational blockchain to essential smart contracts. While they operate as a non-profit, cLabs is primarily funded by the &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;Celo Foundation&lt;/a&gt; and the revenue generated from strategic partners seeking consultation from Celo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://clabs.co/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Discover cLabs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/41w4ivKx0Wg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Ultragreen Money with Tim Moreton │Season 3 Episode 4 🎧"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/41w4ivKx0Wg" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Watch 📺&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="accessible-financial-solutions-through-impact-market-%F0%9F%8C%90"&gt;Accessible Financial Solutions Through Impact Market 🌐&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-5.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1367" height="745" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/09/image-5.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/09/image-5.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-5.png 1367w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactmarket"&gt;Impact Market&lt;/a&gt; has seen a remarkable trajectory since its early days. Initially conceptualized as a &lt;a href="https://www.investopedia.com/terms/b/basic-income.asp"&gt;universal basic income&lt;/a&gt; protocol, it allowed communities to register, receive funds, and decide on memberships autonomously. Over the years, the project has channelled millions of dollars to tens of thousands of individuals across numerous communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/impactmarket" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Follow Impact Market&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As recipients in these communities, often situated in marginalized sectors of emerging markets, receive funds like cUSD or other UBI payments, it paves the way for localized acceptance. Merchants begin to recognize and accept these funds, individuals save them, and they become pivotal to local economies. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://anchor.fm/refipodcast/embed/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" height="102px" width="400px" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/refipodcast/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen 🎧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="ultragreen-money-%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;Ultragreen Money 🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-6.png" class="kg-image" alt loading="lazy" width="1773" height="874" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/09/image-6.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/09/image-6.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/09/image-6.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/09/image-6.png 1773w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the introduction of &lt;a href="https://www.ultragreen.money/"&gt;Ultragreen Money&lt;/a&gt;, Celo aims to intertwine climate action with protocol usability. Drawing inspiration from reward point systems of credit cards, the platform ensures that a portion of every transaction fee is allocated to an on-chain carbon offset fund. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ultragreen.money/" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Discover Ultragreen Money&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overseen by esteemed climate organizations, such as the Climate Collective and adhering to standards set by the Rocky Mountain Institute, these funds are utilized to purchase carbon offsets. This means every Celo transaction, whether it's sending funds abroad, engaging in &lt;a href="https://www.investopedia.com/decentralized-finance-defi-5113835"&gt;DeFi&lt;/a&gt;, or purchasing &lt;a href="https://www.investopedia.com/non-fungible-tokens-nft-5115211"&gt;NFTs&lt;/a&gt;, contributes to climate action. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/41w4ivKx0Wg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Ultragreen Money with Tim Moreton │Season 3 Episode 4 🎧"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/41w4ivKx0Wg" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Watch the full episode 📺&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="celos-transition-to-an-ethereum-l2-%F0%9F%A6%87%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;Celo's Transition to an Ethereum L2 🦇🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🔊 L2 Alert: A Special-Edition EthCC Announcement from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@CeloOrg&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/cLabs?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@cLabs&lt;/a&gt; 📣 &lt;a href="https://t.co/Ct7N190lNG"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Ct7N190lNG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Celo 🦇 🌳 (@CeloOrg) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/CeloOrg/status/1680515812551974913?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;July 16, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;cLabs recently proposed turning Celo into an &lt;a href="https://ethereum.org/en/layer-2/"&gt;Ethereum L2&lt;/a&gt;, and the subsequent outpouring of support from the Ethereum community in the short span of six weeks has been huge. This proposal marks a symbolic return for Celo, drawing parallels to its inception. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sharing substantial code, heritage, and community connections with Ethereum, many developers actively build on both platforms. Given the rapid advancements and the sophistication of Layer 2 (L2) solutions, cLabs felt it was the opportune moment to put forth this proposal, even as the technology behind interoperable L2s remains in its nascent stages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://anchor.fm/refipodcast/embed/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" height="102px" width="400px" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/refipodcast/episodes/Ultragreen-Money-with-Tim-Moreton-Season-3-Episode-4-e29l4ni" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen 🎧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="join-the-conversation-%F0%9F%91%87"&gt;Join the Conversation 👇&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is Ultragreen Money the future of regeneration? What advancements are we going to witness as Celo transitions to an Ethereum L2? Share your thoughts on this podcast episode and join the conversation on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast"&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/refi-dao"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. And if you liked this episode, make sure to share it by clicking the button below. Thank you! 💚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/41w4ivKx0Wg" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share on Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/rjetapdtG5A?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen title="Tackling the climate emergency is the MOST IMPORTANT thing. And we have to do it NOW. #podcast #web3"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;What is good, ReFi Nation?! 👋&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/KaicAnna" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Anna&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; here from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/refidaoist" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; excited to share with you the new episode of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;ReFi Podcast&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/stenverjerkku" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stenver Jerkku&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRez" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rez Tammsaar&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solid World&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;! Big shout out to &lt;a href="https://celo.org/"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Celo Foundation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for making this show possible. 🙏🏼&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Solid World is a climate finance platform that provides critical funding to carbon avoidance and removal projects around the world via pre-paid carbon credits. They currently have over &lt;a href="https://dune.com/solid-world/solid-world-crisp-m-dashboard"&gt;$2.19M in TVL&lt;/a&gt; (and growing) offering over 14% vAPR across their mangrove restoration and clean cookstove projects. 🤯&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project is quintessential ReFi: Solving a specific piece of the climate finance stack, offering real-world assets and competitive returns. Join us as we dive deep into Solid World with two of the brightest minds in the industry! 👏&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/j3q8EakRL7Q?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="Liquid Climate Finance with Stenver Jerkku &amp;amp; Rez Tammsaar of Solid World │Season 3 Episode 6 🎧"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://pod.fo/e/1f8beb" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen 🎧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stenver and Rez are not just ordinary builders in the ReFi space. These are two serial entrepreneurs with a wealth of experience in climate finance and software engineering. Stenver and Rez got industry insights into the challenges of the carbon market during their previous successful venture &lt;a href="https://www.eagronom.com/"&gt;eAgronom&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;They developed a hypothesis about how to finance projects in a way that actually works for the project developers on the ground, and after many months of engineering, fundraising and partnerships have launched their platform with a sizable supply of pre-paid carbon credits from top project developers like &lt;a href="https://vlinderclimate.com/"&gt;Vlinder&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://www.allcot.com/"&gt;Allcot&lt;/a&gt;. Along the way, Solid World built an all-star line-up of industry partners including &lt;a href="https://mclighthouse.com/"&gt;Mastercard Lighthouse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://starcb.com/"&gt;StarCB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://toucan.earth/"&gt;Toucan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.dclimate.net/"&gt;dClimate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.openforestprotocol.org/"&gt;Open Forest Protocol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://mangrovedao.earth/"&gt;Mangrove DAO&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://climatecollective.org/"&gt;Climate Collective&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/10/Screenshot-2023-10-18-at-13.03.39.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="856" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/10/Screenshot-2023-10-18-at-13.03.39.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/10/Screenshot-2023-10-18-at-13.03.39.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/10/Screenshot-2023-10-18-at-13.03.39.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/10/Screenshot-2023-10-18-at-13.03.39.png 2332w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;This liquid forward financing innovation that Solid World provides is nothing short of revolutionary, solving a key bottleneck in the current carbon credit project development lifecycle: Forward financing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In other words, Solid World's innovation ensures they receive the necessary capital upfront, enabling projects to take climate action now, as opposed to waiting three to five years to get their first batch of credits issued! The traditional voluntary carbon market has been negotiating bi-lateral 'over the counter' deals to provide these type of financing mechanisms, but now thanks to Solid World and their &lt;a href="https://www.solid.world/crisp"&gt;CRISP framework&lt;/a&gt;, the industry has a liquid supply of pre-purchased carbon credits for both mangrove restoration and clean cookstoves—already reaching over $2M TVL since launching this summer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j3q8EakRL7Q" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Watch the episode 📺&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The discussion delved deeper into the technological foundations and methodologies adopted by Solid World. Their approach to risk assessment and the potential expansion beyond the voluntary carbon market offers a massive expanding horizon of opportunities. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="the-og-story-of-refi"&gt;The OG Story of ReFi&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We also touch on the real story of how ReFi got started, which not many people seem to talk about! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Do you know the OG story of how &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt; got started...?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;... which token financed the world's most successful mangrove restoration project in the world?&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/stenverjerkku?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@stenverjerkku&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRez?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@0xRez&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@solidworldhq&lt;/a&gt; drop one from the history books!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stay tuned for the full episode on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiPodcast&lt;/a&gt;! &lt;a href="https://t.co/xgxQCPRPaQ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/xgxQCPRPaQ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— jE ❤️🌍🙏 Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1707806735811871226?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;September 29, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This episode covers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;[00:00:00] Teaser&lt;br&gt;[00:00:46] Introduction&lt;br&gt;[00:02:31] Who is Stenver Jerkku?&lt;br&gt;[00:05:20] Who is Rez Tammsaar?&lt;br&gt;[00:06:53] The Limitations of the Current Financial Instruments&lt;br&gt;[00:10:00] Solid World: How Does It Work And Who Is It For&lt;br&gt;[00:13:48] Liquidity &amp;amp; Trust&lt;br&gt;[00:16:11] From Order Books to Web3&lt;br&gt;[00:18:52] Using Market Activity to Set Liquidity Pool Parameters&lt;br&gt;[00:20:03] Redefining Carbon Markets&lt;br&gt;[00:22:09] Building Resilient Systems: The Robustness of Crisp-M&lt;br&gt;[00:29:46] The Origins of ReFi: Myanmar 1764 and TreeCoin&lt;br&gt;[00:38:09] The CRISP Framework and the Pursuit of Transparent Climate Action&lt;br&gt;[00:44:50] Assessing Carbon Credit Risk and Ensuring Quality&lt;br&gt;[00:42:01] Commitment, Innovation, and the Current State of the Market&lt;br&gt;[00:56:16] Navigating the Digital Frontier&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://pod.fo/e/1f8beb" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Listen 🎧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;How can we finance real-world climate action at scale?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this week's episode of &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiPodcast&lt;/a&gt; we dive deep into &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/solidworldhq?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@solidworldhq&lt;/a&gt;'s answer with two of the brightest minds in &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFi?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFi&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/stenverjerkku?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@stenverjerkku&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/0xRez?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@0xRez&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🎞 &lt;a href="https://t.co/DoCIuFjLCB"&gt;https://t.co/DoCIuFjLCB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;🎧 &lt;a href="https://t.co/bcqpzj8pxw"&gt;https://t.co/bcqpzj8pxw&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We touch on:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🏔… &lt;a href="https://t.co/tG2TO2w1GH"&gt;pic.twitter.com/tG2TO2w1GH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— jE ❤️🌍🙏 Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1714609629265543285?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;October 18, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="solid-worlds-massive-growth-%F0%9F%93%88"&gt;Solid World's MASSIVE growth 📈&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The market is taking onto Solid World's innovation and is fueling massive growth with a 63.6% increase in TVL on Polygon in the last week of September. They say that "Capital flows at the speed of trust" and this is clearly a signal from the market that this solution is working...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card"&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets-global.website-files.com/61f1477dfd9f9087efc144b8/65241945014eeb4078b32590_F7hQSXWWoAAYrIs.jpg" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="join-the-conversation-%F0%9F%8C%9F"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Conversation &lt;/strong&gt;🌟&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every voice matters in this conversation about our planet's future and the myriad of solutions available to take action today. Let's continue to foster these valuable discussions and drive meaningful action together. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the conversation on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiPodcast?ref=blog.refidao.com" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/refi-dao/?originalSubdomain=pt&amp;amp;ref=blog.refidao.com" rel="noreferrer"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; or check out one of the &lt;a href="https://www.refidao.com/community/local"&gt;70+ local ReFi communities in a city near you&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If this episode resonated with you, we'd be super grateful for a &lt;a href="https://podfollow.com/refi-podcast"&gt;five-star review where ever you listen to your podcasts&lt;/a&gt;! 💙&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1714609629265543285" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Share on Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In an era of climate change and economic turmoil, the ReFi movement's commitment to reshaping the financial landscape and regenerating the planet has never been more critical. ReFi Week was a call to action for this cause. In collaboration with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.bankless.community/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Bankless DAO&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiLisboa" rel="noreferrer"&gt;ReFi Lisboa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Treegens&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dMeter4dmrv" rel="noreferrer"&gt;dMeter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SilviProtocol" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Silvi Protocol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/crypto4commons" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Crypto Commons Association&lt;/a&gt; and others, it was a week-long experiment that fused the digital tools of ReFi with in-real-life collaborations and tangible ecological impact. Here are some highlights 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8089.jpg" width="2000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8089.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8089.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8089.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8089.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.23-pm.jpeg" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.23-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.23-pm.jpeg 960w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8191.jpg" width="2000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8191.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8191.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8191.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8191.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.01-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="576" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.01-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.01-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.01-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8104.jpg" width="2000" height="2667" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8104.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8104.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8104.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8104.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="regenerative-co-living-at-the-traditional-dream-factory-tdf-%F0%9F%90%91"&gt;Regenerative Co-Living at The Traditional Dream Factory (TDF) 🐑&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the heart of ReFi Week was the &lt;a href="https://www.traditionaldreamfactory.com/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Traditional Dream Factory&lt;/a&gt; (TDF), a regenerative village that enacts a seamless blend of community co-living, technology, and permaculture. TDF exemplifies the power of shared space to spark co-creation and foster a living laboratory for new ideas and solutions to emerge.  During the week, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/samueldelesque" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Samuel Delesque&lt;/a&gt; shared his vision of expanding the work of TDF into a network of Regenerative Villages and ReFi Hubs across the globe, powered by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/oasaliving" rel="noreferrer"&gt;OASA&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://closer.earth/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Closer DAO&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fJ3YCJyFDk4?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="ReFi Village Network | Samuel Delesque @ ReFi Week"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fJ3YCJyFDk4" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Watch Sam's Talk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;🌱 Traditional Dream Factory is at a pivotal moment, and we need your support to make 2024 a year of thriving regeneration! &lt;a href="https://t.co/HCx9ppmKOL"&gt;pic.twitter.com/HCx9ppmKOL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— traditionaldreamfactory (@tdfinyourdreams) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams/status/1720053090806534175?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;November 2, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://traditionaldreamfactory.com/support-us" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support TDF&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="mass-tree-planting-%F0%9F%8C%B3"&gt;Mass Tree Planting! 🌳&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over 40 participants embarked on a monumental project with the goal of helping plant 1000 trees at TDF. Sponsored by &lt;a href="https://www.silvi.earth/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Silvi&lt;/a&gt;, this effort was an experiment in holistically regenerating an ecosystem while exploring the potential of blockchain technology and innovative methodologies to quantify and capture the value of our actions beyond traditional mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8113.jpg" width="2000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8113.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8113.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8113.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8113.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8160.jpg" width="2000" height="2667" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8160.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8160.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8160.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8160.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8118.jpg" width="2000" height="2667" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8118.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8118.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8118.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8118.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;planting trees &amp;amp; making new regen frens 🫡🌳&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;happy &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/refiweek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#refiweek&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/pA0faika14"&gt;pic.twitter.com/pA0faika14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Sophia Dew 📍 istanbul (@sophiadew_) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/sophiadew_/status/1719656341382279403?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;November 1, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The planting process utilized Silvi's cutting-edge decentralized Measurement, Reporting, and Verification (dMRV) technology, where genesis claims were created through a combination of phone and drone ground-truth technology, capturing the initiation of our project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lqX1OMxdsV0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="Drones &amp;amp; Decentralized Tech: A New Era of Reforestation | Djimo Serodio &amp;amp; Lara Malta"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Follow-up MRV events, utilizing cost-effective and replicable dMRV technology from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dMeter4dmrv" rel="noreferrer"&gt;dMeter&lt;/a&gt;'s tech stack, will determine the success of these efforts in the years to come.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SR6-FfIHSmA?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="Silvi Reforestation Protocol | Djimo Serodio @ ReFi Week"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SR6-FfIHSmA&amp;amp;t=2s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Watch Djimo's Talk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project also intends to adopt &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SunflowerEcoTec" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Sunflower Ecotech&lt;/a&gt;’s adaptive agroforestry methodology, with eco credits hosted on &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regen_network" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Regen Network&lt;/a&gt;’s registry for the agroforestry areas not covered by the &lt;a href="https://www.openforestprotocol.org/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Open Forest Protocol&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="exploring-ecological-benefits-%E2%9C%A8"&gt;Exploring Ecological Benefits ✨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exploration of the &lt;a href="__GHOST_URL__/ecological-benefits-activator/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Ecological Benefits Framework&lt;/a&gt; (EBF) was also a key part of the week. The EBF provides a structured and comprehensive methodology for evaluating impacts, extending beyond traditional metrics to encompass essential dimensions such as &lt;strong&gt;air&lt;/strong&gt; quality improvement, &lt;strong&gt;water&lt;/strong&gt; conservation, &lt;strong&gt;soil&lt;/strong&gt; health enhancement, &lt;strong&gt;biodiversity&lt;/strong&gt; support, &lt;strong&gt;equity&lt;/strong&gt; promotion, and &lt;strong&gt;carbon&lt;/strong&gt; sequestration. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.canyouchangethefuture.org/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Can You Change the Future?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;A Framework for Diverse Investors to Create Positive Impacts in Six Key Areas: Air, Water, Soil, Biodiversity, Equity, and Carbon&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://www.canyouchangethefuture.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/EBF-Logo_v1-177-300x300.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Can you change the future?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.canyouchangethefuture.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/EBF-Logo_v1-179.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;How can these six words change the world? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Air. Water. Soil. Biodiversity. Equity. Carbon. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⁦&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MontyMerlin&lt;/a&gt;⁩ giving ⁦&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TheLexicon_org?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@TheLexicon_org&lt;/a&gt;⁩ &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/EBF?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#EBF&lt;/a&gt; download to the fam at ⁦&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@tdfinyourdreams&lt;/a&gt;⁩ during &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFiWeek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFiWeek&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/Oug9xgRy8z"&gt;pic.twitter.com/Oug9xgRy8z&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— jE ❤️🌍🙏 Regeneration (@climateXcrypto) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto/status/1718968456970940757?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;October 30, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qWM9wINa99w?start=1&amp;amp;feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="Unlocking the Ecological Benefits Framework (EBF) for ReFi &amp;amp; Web3 | Monty Merlin @ ReFi Week"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWM9wINa99w&amp;amp;t=1s" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Go deep on EBF x ReFi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;EBF is the “Framework for the Regenerative Paradigm” - &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MontyMerlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/DTOEE7GUdx"&gt;pic.twitter.com/DTOEE7GUdx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Jimi🌳🐝 #GG19 (Treegen.eth) (@JimiCohen) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen/status/1718974764016861339?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;October 30, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;This also led to an exciting announcement from &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/hackrefi" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Hack ReFi&lt;/a&gt;: In building towards their &lt;a href="https://dorahacks.io/hackathon/hackrefi/detail" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Regenerative Finance Hackathon at COP28&lt;/a&gt;, there is a new intention to align their efforts with EBF and push the movement forward together. 🤝&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Until now we have done the problem playoff to identify the problem-scape of the hackathon. To further guide hackers, until November 15th! We have decided to align this hackathon with the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/EcoBenefitFrame?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@EcoBenefitFrame&lt;/a&gt; created by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TheLexicon_org?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@TheLexicon_org&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="https://t.co/cpWUTX17Sm"&gt;https://t.co/cpWUTX17Sm&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/5v2OuoSHwP"&gt;pic.twitter.com/5v2OuoSHwP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Hack ReFi (@HackReFi) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/HackReFi/status/1719371133156261975?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;October 31, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="minting-ecological-benefits-with-hypercerts"&gt;Minting Ecological Benefits with Hypercerts&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Moreover, exploration of the EBF had broader implications for the ReFi movement as a whole. It set the stage for discussion of &lt;a href="https://hypercerts.org/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;hypercerts&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.gitcoin.co/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; within the framework, opening up exciting possibilities for aligning projects and tracking progress. Led by &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/sophiadew_" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Sophia Dew&lt;/a&gt;, a product contributor for both Hypercerts and Gitcoin, the exploration of new &lt;a href="https://hypercerts.org/docs/whitepaper/hypercerts-intro/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Impact Funding Systems&lt;/a&gt; took center stage as ReFi Week participants brainstormed innovative ways to utilize EBF, Hypercerts, and Gitcoin to create new systems for sustainability and ecological impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2BKAfgssdKE?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" title="Web3 Hypercerts &amp;amp; Ecological Benefits❓ | ReFi Week @TDF"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.03-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.03-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.03-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.03-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/data-src-image-24e779f4-f157-4519-b391-5204c241b8a9.png" width="802" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/data-src-image-24e779f4-f157-4519-b391-5204c241b8a9.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/data-src-image-24e779f4-f157-4519-b391-5204c241b8a9.png 802w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;This weekend - we planted 700 trees with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SilviProtocol?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@SilviProtocol&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt;  - and we just minted a &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hypercerts?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@hypercerts&lt;/a&gt; so our impact claim can be stored on chain forever 🌱&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.co/RurjWJhuCz"&gt;https://t.co/RurjWJhuCz&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@JimiCohen&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/climateXcrypto?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@climateXcrypto&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@MontyMerlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/sophiadew_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@sophiadew_&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Terexitarius?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@Terexitarius&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/DjimoSerodio?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@DjimoSerodio&lt;/a&gt;…&lt;/p&gt;— traditionaldreamfactory (@tdfinyourdreams) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/tdfinyourdreams/status/1720471461914169763?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;November 3, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="reimagining-refi-dao-%F0%9F%92%AB"&gt;Reimagining ReFi DAO 💫&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi Week also marked the beginning of a new chapter for ReFi DAO. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="__GHOST_URL__/a-leadership-transition-at-refi-dao-paving-the-way-for-new-growth/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;A Leadership Transition at ReFi DAO: Paving The Way for New Growth&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;I am super excited to announce a major milestone in ReFi DAO’s evolution as an organization: both Daryl Edwards and I are stepping down from leadership to pave the way for the next generation of leaders at ReFi DAO. After nearly two years of service, we will be shifting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w256h256/2022/12/6319c4c1d0b248c635dc4002_ReFi-DAO.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/10/leadership-transition-1.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the 40+ participants at ReFi Week, the focus was on co-creating the future of ReFi DAO together. A variety of workshops facilitated discussions on:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building a DAO with &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/raamchandrasekharan/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Raam Chandrasekharan&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/845751087" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Hypha DAO Canvas&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1OYY_w4ezxoKGVuRZVC93pnc7r2VXORR2tcYcGHp_3_g/edit#slide=id.g1330f8922d6_1_1"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;DAO ACTIVATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Hypha: /Noun /ˈhīfə/ each of the branching filaments that make up the mycelium network that coordinates thriving ecosystems. DAO Activation December, 2022 http://hypha.earth https://discord.gg/JUnHNzVXSJ&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://ssl.gstatic.com/docs/presentations/images/favicon6.ico" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Google Docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyLQ2Gf5AqqYr7-kbzhTm6YI9dSQs5jEOFGwI6gdlwxiLAYwwr6w4jYP5aMhze8iCLzkw5eUhHA5e5SW-csek9hk8jWW5y_JeRyJLvg-tPESlfc=w1200-h630-p" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Co-creation of a &lt;a href="https://refi-dao.notion.site/ReFi-DAO-Mission-Vision-and-Values-draft-Oct-2023-3a0d88d97fbc497391ba194c1ae800a1?pvs=4" rel="noreferrer"&gt;new community-led Mission, Vision and Values&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Establishing DAO tooling and structure with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/yamine_x" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Yamine&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetokenjedi" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Scott&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exploring principles of &lt;a href="https://timotheebrs.medium.com/the-androgynous-organisation-2966547863d3" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Androgynous Organizations&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/timothee-bres/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Timothée Brès&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://timotheebrs.medium.com/the-androgynous-organisation-2966547863d3"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;The Androgynous Organisation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;The Androgynous Organisation (T.A.O.) is a research project exploring the following question&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://cdn-static-1.medium.com/_/fp/icons/Medium-Avatar-500x500.svg" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Timothée Brès&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1112/1*tfwwJSVG-uy8FnKhWAmixg.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;Redesigning &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/ReFiDAOist?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;@ReFiDAOist&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ReFiWeek?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;#ReFiWeek&lt;/a&gt; pt.1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉 Co-creations of a new community-led mission, vision, and values…&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Online forum session coming soon! 🌱 &lt;a href="https://t.co/T1jWtVQEt0"&gt;pic.twitter.com/T1jWtVQEt0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Monty Merlin Bryant 🧙✨ (@MontyMerlin) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/MontyMerlin/status/1719342675055305014?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;October 31, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Together we explored the potential of ReFi DAO as a dynamic, action-driven community that connects regenerative DAOs, organizations, and communities. The integration of various entities like &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/regensunite" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Regens Unite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/gitcoin" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.bankless.community/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Bankless DAO&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SilviProtocol" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Silvi Protocol&lt;/a&gt;,  &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/thetreegens" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Treegens&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dMeter4dmrv" rel="noreferrer"&gt;dMeter&lt;/a&gt;, and others within the ReFi ecosystem further demonstrated the potential for synergistic collaboration in advancing the movement towards a thriving future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.16-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.16-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.16-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.16-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*rsrDjhiZkoqcpV07TGMHJw.png" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8207.jpg" width="2000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8207.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8207.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8207.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/IMG_8207.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/Screenshot-2023-11-03-at-6.52.02-pm.png" width="2000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/Screenshot-2023-11-03-at-6.52.02-pm.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/Screenshot-2023-11-03-at-6.52.02-pm.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/Screenshot-2023-11-03-at-6.52.02-pm.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2023/11/Screenshot-2023-11-03-at-6.52.02-pm.png 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.48.04-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.48.04-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.48.04-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.48.04-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="post-capitalism-and-the-commons"&gt;Post-Capitalism and the Commons&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a diverse exchange of ideas and perspectives, and led by thought-leaders such as Josh from &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/TBSocialist" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Blockchain Socialist&lt;/a&gt; and Giulio from the &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/crypto4commons" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Crypto Commons Association&lt;/a&gt;, deep conversations explored the intersection of Web3, ReFi, &lt;a href="https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVMRG45iA=/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;CoFi&lt;/a&gt; Post-Capitalism, and the Commons, shedding light on the potential for transformative change in financial systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.13-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.13-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.13-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.57.13-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.49.44-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.49.44-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.49.44-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.49.44-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="regeneration-inside-and-out"&gt;Regeneration inside and out&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the spirit of 'regeneration begins within', the week was also packed with rejuvenating and mindful practices to enhance our collective compassion, well-being and care for one another and the planet at large. Participants engaged in daily yoga sessions, regular check-ins, breathwork exercises guided by John, and meditation sessions with Eve of &lt;a href="https://appletreemeditation.com/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Apple Tree Meditation&lt;/a&gt;. Additionally, &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/timothee-bres/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Timothée&lt;/a&gt; led a &lt;a href="https://www.theblindspot.space/disc0punk" rel="noreferrer"&gt;disc0punk experiment&lt;/a&gt; - a cultural reprogramming experience, moving from cyberpunk to solarpunk on tracks like “Didgeridoo” from Aphex Twin and early 80’s disco/punk artists.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.33-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.33-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.33-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.33-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.53-pm-2.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.53-pm-2.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.53-pm-2.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.53-pm-2.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uniting through these practices supported us in connecting &amp;amp; discovering how we can support each other in the ReFi space and move forward as a cohesive movement.&amp;nbsp;Through these expressions, a plethora of inspirations and ideas emerged, including the potential for dedicated spaces where women of ReFi can connect, share, and grow together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 id="looking-forward-a-shared-vision-for-a-regenerative-future"&gt;Looking Forward: A Shared Vision for a Regenerative Future&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;ReFi Week 2023 was a testament to the power of collaboration, innovation, and regeneration in addressing environmental challenges. In a world facing extractive practices, climate change, and instability, ReFi stands as a beacon of hope, driven by leaders determined to create a better future. As the movement evolves, it holds the potential to fortify local nodes, connect online communities, and usher in a thriving global regenerative society. Lets grow 🌱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;blockquote class="twitter-tweet"&gt;&lt;p lang="en" dir="ltr"&gt;How was ReFi Week?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;glad you asked anon &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🧠 = blown&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌳 = growing  &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;💚 = warm &amp;amp; fuzzy&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Feeling regenerated by the healthy food, blessed by the vibes &amp;amp; motivated by the potential to grow 🙏&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So let’s GROW!!!! 🌱 &lt;a href="https://t.co/vdPQIAVuaJ"&gt;pic.twitter.com/vdPQIAVuaJ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Jimi🌳🐝 #GG19 (Treegen.eth) (@JimiCohen) &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/JimiCohen/status/1720389003583607002?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"&gt;November 3, 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async="" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subscribe to the blog for updates and opportunities to get involved in upcoming Forums, Local Node programs, and Gitcoin grant rounds. And check out the linktree below for other ways to level up 👇&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://linktr.ee/refidao"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;ReFi DAO | Twitter | Linktree&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;A network society for the ReFi ecosystem. Get involved 👇&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="https://assets.production.linktr.ee/profiles/_next/static/logo-assets/apple-icon-180x180.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Linktree&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="https://linktr.ee/og/image/refidao.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-container"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.09-pm.jpeg" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.09-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.55.09-pm.jpeg 960w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.47-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.47-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.47-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.47-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.53.44-pm.jpeg" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.53.44-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.53.44-pm.jpeg 960w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.34-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.34-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.34-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-03-6.54.34-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8091.jpg" width="2000" height="2667" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/IMG_8091.jpg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/IMG_8091.jpg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2023/11/IMG_8091.jpg 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/IMG_8091.jpg 2316w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-row"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.35-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="579" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.35-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.35-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.35-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-gallery-image"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.29-pm.jpeg" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.29-pm.jpeg 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.29-pm.jpeg 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/2023/11/photo_2023-11-05-1.43.29-pm.jpeg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 720px) 720px"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-video-card kg-width-regular" data-kg-thumbnail="https://blog.refidao.com/content/media/2023/11/IMG_6469_thumb.jpg" data-kg-custom-thumbnail=""&gt;
