        &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/x9kg4ebb" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get your ticket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="learn-more-about-tdf-%F0%9F%90%8F-%F0%9F%A5%95"&gt;Learn more about TDF 🐏 🥕&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you haven't checked out the amazing work that Sam, Luna and crew are up to at TDF, this amazing video by our friend &lt;a href="https://x.com/zkMenno" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Menno&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://x.com/dClimateDAO" rel="noreferrer"&gt;dClimate&lt;/a&gt; is well worth the four minutes! 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"&gt;&lt;iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/btBqOboLdOg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="Join the dream and support a climate resilient regenerative village in Alentejo, Portugal."&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h2 id="hope-to-see-you-there-%F0%9F%A4%A0"&gt;Hope to see you there! 🤠&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Really looking forward to seeing the ReFi fam again almost a year after handing over the Source baton to Monty at ReFi DAO. Hit me up if you have any questions!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Peace and love,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;John&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.regenera.xyz/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;regenera.xyz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/iamjohnellison" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;x.com/@iamjohnellison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://instagram.com/iamjohnellison" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;instagram.com/@iamjohnellison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/x9kg4ebb?coupon=REFIFAM75" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Get €75 off Your Ticket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;P.S. —&amp;nbsp;If you read this far, here's &lt;a href="https://lu.ma/x9kg4ebb?coupon=REFIFAM75"&gt;a discount code for €75&lt;/a&gt; off the Regen MSTRMND! Or use ' REFIFAM75' at checkout'. Some of my favorite posts from Regenera over the last six months below 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.regenera.xyz/p/from-ashes-to-regeneration?r=1l137j&amp;amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;From Ashes to Regeneration 🔥&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;An odyssey through love, loss, and the vision of a regenerative era. My first post on a new Substack sharing my journey sitting with sacred medicine alongside a group of leaders in Mexico during the OYASīN Awakening Retreat.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Ff4004741-714e-4784-a8d2-c1a8aacb2352-2Fapple-touch-icon-180x180.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Regenera with John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Fec6e1f0e-21ef-4262-8be8-c43e339498fd_1024x1024.webp" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.regenera.xyz/p/myths-of-the-regenerative-era-part"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Myths of The Regenerative Era: Part I — The Eagle &amp;amp; The Condor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;What an ancient prophecy from The Americas teaches us about the regenerative age&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Ff4004741-714e-4784-a8d2-c1a8aacb2352-2Fapple-touch-icon-180x180-1.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Regenera with John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Fe54573a0-9ac8-4f5b-8daa-eadf0fd5ff6e_1280x731.jpeg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.regenera.xyz/p/only-love-is-real-ep-coming-soon"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Only Love Is Real — EP COMING SOON&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;This demo is an offering: A gift from my heart ❤️‍🔥&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Ff4004741-714e-4784-a8d2-c1a8aacb2352-2Fapple-touch-icon-180x180-2.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Regenera with John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fvideo_upload-2Fpost-2F149441997-2F72103944-2e54-4168-b35d-971d092f7245-2Ftranscoded-06542.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.regenera.xyz/p/part-ii-the-condors-wisdom-seven"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Part II: The Condor’s Wisdom — Seven Myths for a Regenerative Future&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;How The Indigenous Worldview Can Decolonize Our Minds and Heal Our Planet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Ff4004741-714e-4784-a8d2-c1a8aacb2352-2Fapple-touch-icon-180x180-3.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Regenera with John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2F41354090-8394-4592-80df-10222f09b9d3_1728x706.jpeg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://www.regenera.xyz/p/awakening-from-the-dream"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Awakening From The Dream&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;What emerged from Shared Dreaming with friends at TDF after The Gathering&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fpublic-2Fimages-2Ff4004741-714e-4784-a8d2-c1a8aacb2352-2Fapple-touch-icon-180x180-4.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Regenera with John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;John Ellison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/https-3A-2F-2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com-2Fvideo_upload-2Fpost-2F149219754-2F83390925-2538-451a-814c-b05c1798a495-2Ftranscoded-00001.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;GM GM Regens! It's Trinity from&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/?ref=blog.refidao.com" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;CARBON copy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;with another weekly roundup of key news and developments in the ReFi ecosystem.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I hope you touched some trees during the weekend.&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Here's a recap of key happenings last week in the ReFi space, including the regen alphas you missed 👇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="%F0%9F%8C%B1-refi-project-support"&gt;🌱 ReFi Project Support&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Help ReFi projects secure substantial matched funding in the Glo Dollar x Optimism Builders Round with a donation of as little as $1 per project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://explorer.gitcoin.co/#/collections/bafkreidogdvsbrloqevj44r5sjzsmeb4ncgl3zztqhhb6a622nr47tuloa" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Donate to ReFi projects in the round&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/project/decleanup/?ref=blog.refidao.com" rel="noreferrer"&gt;DeCleanup Network&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;in securing matching funds from the Asia-Based Grant Initiative for DeSci and DAO research with your donations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href="https://app.fundesci.com/projects/6786713708352b7ec3cc20dc" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Support DeCleanup Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="%F0%9F%93%B0-octant-steps-up-climate-game"&gt;📰 Octant steps up climate game&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/project/octant/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Octant&lt;/a&gt;, a platform redirecting staked ETH revenue to fund public-good Web3 projects, has announced a new climate-focused funding round, offering significantly larger grants than typical &lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/project/gitcoin/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Gitcoin&lt;/a&gt; Climate Solutions rounds. The initiative aims to empower grassroots climate projects with consistent funding while testing emerging impact verification systems. In the latest &lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;CARBON Copy&lt;/a&gt; newsletter, we explore how Octant highlights the potential of regenerative finance to scale climate impact and set a new standard for wealth stewardship in the Web3 space. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"&gt;&lt;a href=" https://paragraph.xyz/@carboncopy/octant-takes-climate-action" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent"&gt;Read newsletter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="%F0%9F%97%9E%EF%B8%8F-now-the-headlines"&gt;🗞️ Now the headlines:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://carboncopy.news/project/octant/"&gt;Octant&lt;/a&gt; distributes 469.2 $ETH (~1.5M USD) in Epoch 6 Public Goods Funding round 👉 &lt;a href="https://x.com/OctantApp/status/1883202383746044350"&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
