&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🗓️ October 18 – November 15, 2025&lt;br&gt;📍 San Martín de los Andes, Patagonia, Argentina&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This October, we invite you to join ReFi DAO in to San Martín de los Andes — a breathtaking mountain-and-lake town at the edge of the Andes in southern Argentina — for a month of living, learning, and building together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In collaboration with &lt;strong&gt;Edge City&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;NetX State&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Regen Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;, we are hosting the &lt;strong&gt;Regen Haus Residency&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Edge City Patagonia&lt;/strong&gt; — a month-long popup village for innovators, builders, and dreamers shaping the regenerative future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-full"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2025/08/Regen-Haus-Residency---Edge-City-Patagonia.png" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="667" srcset="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w600/2025/08/Regen-Haus-Residency---Edge-City-Patagonia.png 600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1000/2025/08/Regen-Haus-Residency---Edge-City-Patagonia.png 1000w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w1600/2025/08/Regen-Haus-Residency---Edge-City-Patagonia.png 1600w, __GHOST_URL__/content/images/size/w2400/2025/08/Regen-Haus-Residency---Edge-City-Patagonia.png 2400w"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="why-patagonia"&gt;Why Patagonia?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Martín de los Andes&lt;/strong&gt; is a rare and beautiful place where nature and culture meet. Nestled between crystal lakes and snow-capped peaks, it’s the perfect environment for focus, deep collaboration, and fresh perspective.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Edge City chose San Martín not only for its beauty, but also for its strong infrastructure, vibrant local community, and growing tech scene — anchored by &lt;a href="https://www.bitcotesma.ar/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;BIT Cotesma&lt;/a&gt;, a public innovation hub and coworking space in the heart of town. And with easy access to &lt;a href="https://devconnect.org/" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Devconnect Buenos Aires&lt;/a&gt;, it’s a uniquely connected frontier.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-is-edge-city-patagonia"&gt;What is Edge City Patagonia?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;From &lt;strong&gt;October 18 to November 15&lt;/strong&gt;, Edge City will transform San Martín into a &lt;strong&gt;popup village&lt;/strong&gt; — a month-long experiment bringing together high-agency people working at the frontiers of tech, science, and culture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Edge City are &lt;strong&gt;residencies&lt;/strong&gt; — themed, co-living experiences of 5–50 people working around a shared focus. Past residencies have led to open-source projects, research collaborations, venture funding, and lifelong friendships.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Days in the village flow between deep work, workshops, adventure, and connection:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Morning workouts and lake plunges&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborative coworking in town&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Afternoon hikes and spontaneous workshops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evenings of shared meals, local music, and fireside conversation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="__GHOST_URL__/incubating-new-societies-the-rise-of-pop-up-cities-with-timour-kosters-s4-bonus-2/"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Incubating New Societies: The Rise of Pop-Up Cities with Timour Kosters │ S4 Bonus 🏙️🎧&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Can temporary pop-up cities incubate the future of society? In this Bonus Episode of Season 4, The Regeneration Nexus, of the ReFi Podcast, hosts Maya Dentzel and Tereza Bízková welcome Timour Kosters, co-founder of Edge City, a project pioneering the pop-up city&amp;nbsp;model. These temporary, month-long communities bring together people&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/6319c4c1d0b248c635dc4002_ReFi-DAO-7.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;ReFi DAO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-publisher"&gt;Tereza Bizkova&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/Refi-Landscape-Thumbnail.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="the-regen-haus-residency"&gt;The Regen Haus Residency&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regen Haus&lt;/strong&gt; will be our dedicated home within Edge City Patagonia — a space for &lt;strong&gt;regeneration, collaboration, and creative action&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our residency blends:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coworking &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Deep work with peers from across the global ReFi ecosystem and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inner Regeneration&lt;/strong&gt; — Daily practices and wellness activities to recharge and realign.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bioregional Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Immersing ourselves in the landscapes, ecology, communities and culture of Patagonia.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collective Building&lt;/strong&gt; — Co-creating regenerative Web3 infrastructure and tools for the common good.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is more than just a space to work — it’s a living laboratory for the regenerative movement in Web3.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-video-card kg-width-regular" data-kg-thumbnail="https://blog.refidao.com/content/media/2025/08/Regen-Haus---Edge-City-Patagonia_thumb.jpg" data-kg-custom-thumbnail=""&gt;
            &lt;div class="kg-video-container"&gt;
                &lt;video src="__GHOST_URL__/content/media/2025/08/Regen-Haus---Edge-City-Patagonia.mp4" poster="https://img.spacergif.org/v1/1920x1080/0a/spacer.png" width="1920" height="1080" playsinline="" preload="metadata" style="background: transparent url('__GHOST_URL__/content/media/2025/08/Regen-Haus---Edge-City-Patagonia_thumb.jpg') 50% 50% / cover no-repeat;"&gt;&lt;/video&gt;
