        &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="who-is-this-for"&gt;Who is This For?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Regen Haus Residency is open to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReFi community members&lt;/strong&gt; — builders, founders, creatives, and contributors already active in regenerative finance.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Newcomers to ReFi&lt;/strong&gt; — explorers who want to dive in deeper for how Web3 can support ecological and social regeneration and wanting to get involved.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re leading a project, contributing to a DAO, or simply seeking a meaningful on-ramp into the ReFi movement, this is your invitation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="why-join"&gt;Why Join?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Momentum&lt;/strong&gt; — Align your work with other high-agency peers in a focused, inspiring environment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Build lasting relationships across the global ReFi and frontier tech ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context&lt;/strong&gt; — Experience regeneration not just as a concept, but as a way of living, working, and being.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt; — Co-create tools, ideas, and collaborations that carry forward long after Patagonia.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="how-to-join"&gt;How to Join&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;Dates:&lt;/strong&gt; October 18 – November 15, 2025 (join for a week or longer)&lt;br&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; San Martín de los Andes, Patagonia, Argentina&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about Edge City Patagonia:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://edgecitypatagonia2025.substack.com/p/welcome-to-edge-city-patagonia" rel="noopener"&gt;Read the Welcome Letter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Register for the Regen Haus Residency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://lu.ma/drfil5al" rel="noopener"&gt;Sign up via Luma&lt;/a&gt; and receive discount code for &lt;strong&gt;20% off&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plan your stay:&lt;/strong&gt; Join the Edge City housing and coordination channels for more info (we will share link).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2 id="final-word"&gt;Final Word&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Edge City offers the kind of rare environment that can transform your work, your thinking, and your connections. And Regen Haus will be the heart of the regenerative community within it all.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’ve ever wanted to experience ReFi in action — surrounded by nature, driven by purpose, and connected to a global network — this is your moment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let’s gather here and now to shape what’s next for the regenerative movement. 🌱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📄 &lt;strong&gt;Register now&lt;/strong&gt; → &lt;a href="https://lu.ma/drfil5al" rel="noopener"&gt;https://lu.ma/drfil5al&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"&gt;&lt;a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="https://lu.ma/drfil5al"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-content"&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-title"&gt;Regen Haus at Edge City · Luma&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-description"&gt;Regen Haus at Edge City Patagonia
For 29 days, we will inhabit the Andean Patagonia, a territory of deep natural connection, where regeneration starts with…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"&gt;&lt;img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/icon/apple-touch-icon-1.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;span class="kg-bookmark-author"&gt;Netx State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"&gt;&lt;img src="__GHOST_URL__/content/images/thumbnail/event-one" alt="" onerror="this.style.display = 'none'"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
